 mood literally accelerates the physical degradation of the reactor walls. It is entirely connected. And it works in reverse, too. Over-promising timelines today drains the public trust basin for tomorrow. Oh, like when a startup promises commercial electricity in five years. Right. When a fusion startup issues a press release promising the moon and they inevitably fail to deliver, they aren't just missing a deadline, they are draining the trust basin. Which hurts them later. This leaves the technology incredibly vulnerable when it actually does deploy a decade later. Because the accumulated societal credibility required to weather the early inevitable operational hiccups simply isn't there anymore. Looking at this massive intertwined web array. The quantum mechanics of the plasma. The atomic degradation of the walls. The tacit knowledge of the human operators. The fragility of the supply chain. The flow of capital. And the shifting winds of public trust. We arrive at the final, mind-bending, philosophical conclusion of Flixian's work. The physics of viability and the concept of identity without matter. The theory scales up, right? It does. Because fusion is just one mechanism among many in the universe used to sustain organizational coherence against the relentless drag of the second law of thermodynamics. Think about identity across continuous replacement. We established earlier that over a 30-year lifespan, because of that brutal neutron damage and thermodynamic wear, nearly every physical part of the reactor will be replaced. The walls, the sensors, the cooling loops, perhaps even the magnets. Over enough time, not a single atom of the original machine will remain. So, it's the same reactor. It is the classic philosophical problem of the ship of Theseus, mapped onto advanced nuclear engineering. I love this. For those listening who might not be familiar, the ship of Theseus is an ancient thought experiment. It goes like this. If you have a famous wooden ship, and over the years, as it sails, you replace every single rotting board with a new piece of wood, until absolutely no original wood remains, is it still the ship of Theseus? And Flickshane argues yes. Resoundingly yes. Why? Because the identity of the reactor, or the ship, doesn't live in the atoms. It doesn't live in the steel, or the lithium, or the copper. It lives in the maintained pattern. It is the continuous conservation of organization. Energy is conserved automatically by the universe. You can't create or destroy it. But organizational coherence, the specific pattern that makes a reactor a reactor, or a ship, a ship, is fragile. Extremely fragile. It's constantly decaying. It must be fought for, purchased with energy, and projected every single second. And what's truly fascinating is that this framework of viability theory goes far beyond fusion energy. The exact same mathematical principles, the exact same logic of attractor basins and constraint projection applies to deep space probes. Like the Voyager probe. It has zero physical repair capacity. It can't swap out a degraded wall. Right. It relies entirely on incredibly deep attractor basins built by its original engineers and predictive digital twins run by operators back on Earth to survive decades in the void. Wow. And this applies to other things too, right? Oh yeah. It applies to manufacturing hubs. It applies to civic institutions in a bustling city. It applies to biological ecosystems. Cities are just thermodynamic organizations. Exactly. A city brings in energy and materials. It repairs its physical infrastructure. It maintains its institutional knowledge through schools and culture. And it expends massive amounts of energy to push back against urban decay. The physics of viability is universal. We have to stop looking at advanced technology and human progress in general as a sprint to a magic threshold. The Lawson criterion is just the starting line. It's the moment the baby takes its first breath. We have to start looking at engineering as the careful, costly, recursive maintenance of order against the chaos of the universe. Persistence over performance. Designing the deep basin rather than balancing on the edge of the plate. The endless marathon, not the glorious sprint. That is the core message of the theory. I want to leave you, the listener, with a direct challenge based on this theory. Consider your own life, your career, or the company you work for as a thermodynamic organization. Are you constantly optimizing for peak performance? Trying to hit your own personal Lawson criterion. Exactly. Are you running at 100% capacity, chasing the headline, and leaving yourself perfectly balanced on the dinner plate, completely vulnerable to the slightest breeze of disruption? Or are you investing in basin depth? Are you building those reserves? Are you deliberately leaving some power on the table to build the invisible reserves, the redundancies, the financial margins, and the tacit knowledge required to simply survive the long, slow, inevitable decay of time? Because a skyscraper is a static illusion. Everything, ultimately, is a bridge that you have to rebuild while you're driving over it. Thank you for joining us on this deep dive. Stay curious, build your basins deep, and we will see you next time.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.82, "text": " You know, if you build a skyscraper, the whole process has a very clear, satisfying finish line.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 458, 11, 498, 291, 1322, 257, 48227, 39302, 610, 11, 264, 1379, 1399, 575, 257, 588, 1850, 11, 18348, 2413, 1622, 13, 50656], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07414215367014815, "compression_ratio": 1.6458333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.1423759074119522e-12}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 5.98, "end": 9.040000000000001, "text": " Right. You pour the concrete, bolt the steel, and you're done.", "tokens": [50664, 1779, 13, 509, 2016, 264, 9859, 11, 13436, 264, 8269, 11, 293, 291, 434, 1096, 13, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07414215367014815, "compression_ratio": 1.6458333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.1423759074119522e-12}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 9.22, "end": 13.780000000000001, "text": " Exactly. You cut the ribbon, you walk away, and the building is just there. It exists.", "tokens": [50826, 7587, 13, 509, 1723, 264, 20921, 11, 291, 1792, 1314, 11, 293, 264, 2390, 307, 445, 456, 13, 467, 8198, 13, 51054], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07414215367014815, "compression_ratio": 1.6458333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.1423759074119522e-12}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 13.98, "end": 15.22, "text": " It's a static achievement.", "tokens": [51064, 467, 311, 257, 13437, 15838, 13, 51126], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07414215367014815, "compression_ratio": 1.6458333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.1423759074119522e-12}, {"id": 4, "seek": 0, "start": 15.56, "end": 20.580000000000002, "text": " Yeah, but if you try to build a star on Earth, like if you step into the world of advanced nuclear fusion,", "tokens": [51143, 865, 11, 457, 498, 291, 853, 281, 1322, 257, 3543, 322, 4755, 11, 411, 498, 291, 1823, 666, 264, 1002, 295, 7339, 8179, 23100, 11, 51394], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07414215367014815, "compression_ratio": 1.6458333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.1423759074119522e-12}, {"id": 5, "seek": 0, "start": 21.12, "end": 25.64, "text": " that skyscraper metaphor doesn't just fall apart. It actually becomes dangerously misleading.", "tokens": [51421, 300, 48227, 39302, 610, 19157, 1177, 380, 445, 2100, 4936, 13, 467, 767, 3643, 4330, 5098, 36429, 13, 51647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07414215367014815, "compression_ratio": 1.6458333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 1.1423759074119522e-12}, {"id": 6, "seek": 2564, "start": 25.64, "end": 30.700000000000003, "text": " Oh, absolutely, because from the very first millisecond you turn a fusion reactor on,", "tokens": [50365, 876, 11, 3122, 11, 570, 490, 264, 588, 700, 27940, 18882, 291, 1261, 257, 23100, 20628, 322, 11, 50618], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 7, "seek": 2564, "start": 30.86, "end": 34.84, "text": " the machine is violently, continuously trying to unbuild itself.", "tokens": [50626, 264, 3479, 307, 46728, 11, 15684, 1382, 281, 517, 11516, 2564, 13, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 8, "seek": 2564, "start": 34.96, "end": 36.9, "text": " It's terrifying when you really think about it.", "tokens": [50831, 467, 311, 18106, 562, 291, 534, 519, 466, 309, 13, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 9, "seek": 2564, "start": 36.980000000000004, "end": 41.82, "text": " It is the absolute definition of a precarious, dynamically maintained state.", "tokens": [50932, 467, 307, 264, 8236, 7123, 295, 257, 4346, 289, 851, 11, 43492, 17578, 1785, 13, 51174], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 10, "seek": 2564, "start": 42.3, "end": 48.44, "text": " You aren't building a monument, you know. You are birthing an organism into an incredibly hostile environment.", "tokens": [51198, 509, 3212, 380, 2390, 257, 20289, 11, 291, 458, 13, 509, 366, 1904, 825, 364, 24128, 666, 364, 6252, 27312, 2823, 13, 51505], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 11, "seek": 2564, "start": 48.68, "end": 53.3, "text": " And you're sourcing it to fight for its own survival every single fraction of a second.", "tokens": [51517, 400, 291, 434, 11006, 2175, 309, 281, 2092, 337, 1080, 1065, 12559, 633, 2167, 14135, 295, 257, 1150, 13, 51748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 12, "seek": 2564, "start": 53.400000000000006, "end": 53.92, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [51753, 48746, 736, 13, 51779], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09545672043510105, "compression_ratio": 1.6552901023890785, "no_speech_prob": 7.03807563444403e-13}, {"id": 13, "seek": 5392, "start": 53.92, "end": 58.36, "text": " And that fight for survival is exactly what we are getting into today.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 300, 2092, 337, 12559, 307, 2293, 437, 321, 366, 1242, 666, 965, 13, 50587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15083483493689334, "compression_ratio": 1.5650557620817844, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832365157798177e-12}, {"id": 14, "seek": 5392, "start": 59.08, "end": 60.58, "text": " Welcome to the Deep Dive.", "tokens": [50623, 4027, 281, 264, 14895, 413, 488, 13, 50698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15083483493689334, "compression_ratio": 1.5650557620817844, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832365157798177e-12}, {"id": 15, "seek": 5392, "start": 60.800000000000004, "end": 68.14, "text": " We are taking you into a revolutionary, honestly mind-bending framework by an independent researcher named Flixion.", "tokens": [50709, 492, 366, 1940, 291, 666, 257, 22687, 11, 6095, 1575, 12, 65, 2029, 8388, 538, 364, 6695, 21751, 4926, 3235, 970, 313, 13, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15083483493689334, "compression_ratio": 1.5650557620817844, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832365157798177e-12}, {"id": 16, "seek": 5392, "start": 68.48, "end": 71.92, "text": " The work is titled A Viability Theory of Fusion Reactors.", "tokens": [51093, 440, 589, 307, 19841, 316, 6626, 2310, 29009, 295, 36721, 30644, 830, 13, 51265], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15083483493689334, "compression_ratio": 1.5650557620817844, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832365157798177e-12}, {"id": 17, "seek": 5392, "start": 72.56, "end": 75.24000000000001, "text": " All right. And our mission on this Deep Dive is pretty bold.", "tokens": [51297, 1057, 558, 13, 400, 527, 4447, 322, 341, 14895, 413, 488, 307, 1238, 11928, 13, 51431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15083483493689334, "compression_ratio": 1.5650557620817844, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832365157798177e-12}, {"id": 18, "seek": 5392, "start": 75.64, "end": 81.38, "text": " We are going to fundamentally rethink how we evaluate complex technological achievements.", "tokens": [51451, 492, 366, 516, 281, 17879, 34595, 577, 321, 13059, 3997, 18439, 21420, 13, 51738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15083483493689334, "compression_ratio": 1.5650557620817844, "no_speech_prob": 1.3832365157798177e-12}, {"id": 19, "seek": 8138, "start": 81.38, "end": 85.22, "text": " And not just fusion. I mean, massive engineering systems as a whole.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 406, 445, 23100, 13, 286, 914, 11, 5994, 7043, 3652, 382, 257, 1379, 13, 50557], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18667120615641275, "compression_ratio": 1.413265306122449, "no_speech_prob": 1.537096730279408e-12}, {"id": 20, "seek": 8138, "start": 85.75999999999999, "end": 93.25999999999999, "text": " Yeah. Because the way we currently measure success in fusion energy, it's entirely focused on one specific threshold.", "tokens": [50584, 865, 13, 1436, 264, 636, 321, 4362, 3481, 2245, 294, 23100, 2281, 11, 309, 311, 7696, 5178, 322, 472, 2685, 14678, 13, 50959], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18667120615641275, "compression_ratio": 1.413265306122449, "no_speech_prob": 1.537096730279408e-12}, {"id": 21, "seek": 8138, "start": 93.82, "end": 95.28, "text": " The Lawson Criterion.", "tokens": [50987, 440, 7744, 3015, 4779, 1681, 313, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18667120615641275, "compression_ratio": 1.413265306122449, "no_speech_prob": 1.537096730279408e-12}, {"id": 22, "seek": 8138, "start": 95.44, "end": 97.62, "text": " Or what the media often calls ignition.", "tokens": [51068, 1610, 437, 264, 3021, 2049, 5498, 37031, 13, 51177], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18667120615641275, "compression_ratio": 1.413265306122449, "no_speech_prob": 1.537096730279408e-12}, {"id": 23, "seek": 8138, "start": 98.14, "end": 99.24, "text": " Right. The Holy Grail.", "tokens": [51203, 1779, 13, 440, 6295, 8985, 388, 13, 51258], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18667120615641275, "compression_ratio": 1.413265306122449, "no_speech_prob": 1.537096730279408e-12}, {"id": 24, "seek": 8138, "start": 99.47999999999999, "end": 99.66, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51270, 865, 13, 51279], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18667120615641275, "compression_ratio": 1.413265306122449, "no_speech_prob": 1.537096730279408e-12}, {"id": 25, "seek": 9966, "start": 99.66, "end": 103.67999999999999, "text": " It's that magical moment when a reactor produces more energy than it consumes.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 300, 12066, 1623, 562, 257, 20628, 14725, 544, 2281, 813, 309, 48823, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1311648029020463, "compression_ratio": 1.450199203187251, "no_speech_prob": 1.421368448287219e-12}, {"id": 26, "seek": 9966, "start": 103.82, "end": 103.96, "text": " Yep.", "tokens": [50573, 7010, 13, 50580], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1311648029020463, "compression_ratio": 1.450199203187251, "no_speech_prob": 1.421368448287219e-12}, {"id": 27, "seek": 9966, "start": 104.1, "end": 114.16, "text": " Whenever we hear about breakthroughs at, say, EIDER in France or the National Ignition Facility in California, it's almost always about getting closer to this single point on a graph.", "tokens": [50587, 14159, 321, 1568, 466, 22397, 82, 412, 11, 584, 11, 462, 2777, 1598, 294, 6190, 420, 264, 4862, 24754, 849, 17667, 1140, 294, 5384, 11, 309, 311, 1920, 1009, 466, 1242, 4966, 281, 341, 2167, 935, 322, 257, 4295, 13, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1311648029020463, "compression_ratio": 1.450199203187251, "no_speech_prob": 1.421368448287219e-12}, {"id": 28, "seek": 9966, "start": 114.39999999999999, "end": 119.14, "text": " But Flixion makes a very compelling and honestly somewhat controversial argument here.", "tokens": [51102, 583, 3235, 970, 313, 1669, 257, 588, 20050, 293, 6095, 8344, 17323, 6770, 510, 13, 51339], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1311648029020463, "compression_ratio": 1.450199203187251, "no_speech_prob": 1.421368448287219e-12}, {"id": 29, "seek": 9966, "start": 119.19999999999999, "end": 119.66, "text": " Which is?", "tokens": [51342, 3013, 307, 30, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1311648029020463, "compression_ratio": 1.450199203187251, "no_speech_prob": 1.421368448287219e-12}, {"id": 30, "seek": 11966, "start": 119.66, "end": 124.16, "text": " That the Lawson Criterion is the wrong finish line. It is merely a local threshold.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 264, 7744, 3015, 4779, 1681, 313, 307, 264, 2085, 2413, 1622, 13, 467, 307, 17003, 257, 2654, 14678, 13, 50590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11309125811554664, "compression_ratio": 1.5150214592274678, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071282980297362e-12}, {"id": 31, "seek": 11966, "start": 124.3, "end": 126.17999999999999, "text": " Wait. So hitting it doesn't mean we've solved fusion.", "tokens": [50597, 3802, 13, 407, 8850, 309, 1177, 380, 914, 321, 600, 13041, 23100, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11309125811554664, "compression_ratio": 1.5150214592274678, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071282980297362e-12}, {"id": 32, "seek": 11966, "start": 126.44, "end": 132.04, "text": " Not at all. I mean, hitting ignition for a fraction of a second is an incredible feat of physics, obviously.", "tokens": [50704, 1726, 412, 439, 13, 286, 914, 11, 8850, 37031, 337, 257, 14135, 295, 257, 1150, 307, 364, 4651, 15425, 295, 10649, 11, 2745, 13, 50984], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11309125811554664, "compression_ratio": 1.5150214592274678, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071282980297362e-12}, {"id": 33, "seek": 11966, "start": 132.51999999999998, "end": 138.42, "text": " But it tells us almost nothing about whether the machine can actually survive its own success for decades.", "tokens": [51008, 583, 309, 5112, 505, 1920, 1825, 466, 1968, 264, 3479, 393, 767, 7867, 1080, 1065, 2245, 337, 7878, 13, 51303], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11309125811554664, "compression_ratio": 1.5150214592274678, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071282980297362e-12}, {"id": 34, "seek": 13842, "start": 138.42, "end": 146.83999999999997, "text": " Wow. And this is the core hook for this entire framework. We are so culturally conditioned to celebrate peak performance, right?", "tokens": [50365, 3153, 13, 400, 341, 307, 264, 4965, 6328, 337, 341, 2302, 8388, 13, 492, 366, 370, 28879, 35833, 281, 8098, 10651, 3389, 11, 558, 30, 50786], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.062020239428939104, "compression_ratio": 1.6920415224913494, "no_speech_prob": 1.604572703005347e-12}, {"id": 35, "seek": 13842, "start": 146.83999999999997, "end": 154.56, "text": " Oh, constantly. We want the highest temperature, the longest plasma pulse, the record-breaking energy output.", "tokens": [50786, 876, 11, 6460, 13, 492, 528, 264, 6343, 4292, 11, 264, 15438, 22564, 17709, 11, 264, 2136, 12, 20602, 2281, 5598, 13, 51172], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.062020239428939104, "compression_ratio": 1.6920415224913494, "no_speech_prob": 1.604572703005347e-12}, {"id": 36, "seek": 13842, "start": 154.89999999999998, "end": 158.32, "text": " But what if peak performance is actually the enemy of long-term survival?", "tokens": [51189, 583, 437, 498, 10651, 3389, 307, 767, 264, 5945, 295, 938, 12, 7039, 12559, 30, 51360], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.062020239428939104, "compression_ratio": 1.6920415224913494, "no_speech_prob": 1.604572703005347e-12}, {"id": 37, "seek": 13842, "start": 158.54, "end": 167.44, "text": " Exactly. And to understand why we've been optimizing for the wrong thing, we have to look at the only fusion reactors that have actually solved this long-term survival problem.", "tokens": [51371, 7587, 13, 400, 281, 1223, 983, 321, 600, 668, 40425, 337, 264, 2085, 551, 11, 321, 362, 281, 574, 412, 264, 787, 23100, 41649, 300, 362, 767, 13041, 341, 938, 12, 7039, 12559, 1154, 13, 51816], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.062020239428939104, "compression_ratio": 1.6920415224913494, "no_speech_prob": 1.604572703005347e-12}, {"id": 38, "seek": 16744, "start": 167.44, "end": 168.62, "text": " You mean the ones in the nice sky?", "tokens": [50365, 509, 914, 264, 2306, 294, 264, 1481, 5443, 30, 50424], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 39, "seek": 16744, "start": 169.18, "end": 174.7, "text": " Yeah, stars. Stars are fundamentally recursively maintained thermodynamic organizations.", "tokens": [50452, 865, 11, 6105, 13, 20957, 366, 17879, 20560, 3413, 17578, 8810, 34988, 6150, 13, 50728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 40, "seek": 16744, "start": 175.02, "end": 175.57999999999998, "text": " That's a mouthful.", "tokens": [50744, 663, 311, 257, 4525, 906, 13, 50772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 41, "seek": 16744, "start": 175.84, "end": 181.44, "text": " It is, but it just means they have been running continuously for billions of years without a single maintenance outage.", "tokens": [50785, 467, 307, 11, 457, 309, 445, 1355, 436, 362, 668, 2614, 15684, 337, 17375, 295, 924, 1553, 257, 2167, 11258, 484, 609, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 42, "seek": 16744, "start": 182.1, "end": 187.82, "text": " But stars don't have control rooms, you know? They don't have engineers in hardhats running around swapping out degraded parts.", "tokens": [51098, 583, 6105, 500, 380, 362, 1969, 9396, 11, 291, 458, 30, 814, 500, 380, 362, 11955, 294, 1152, 71, 1720, 2614, 926, 1693, 10534, 484, 24740, 292, 3166, 13, 51384], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 43, "seek": 16744, "start": 187.92, "end": 195.94, "text": " Yeah, because they don't need them. Stars persist because their conditions for survival are enforced automatically by the laws of physics.", "tokens": [51389, 865, 11, 570, 436, 500, 380, 643, 552, 13, 20957, 13233, 570, 641, 4487, 337, 12559, 366, 40953, 6772, 538, 264, 6064, 295, 10649, 13, 51790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 44, "seek": 16744, "start": 195.94, "end": 196.82, "text": " How so?", "tokens": [51790, 1012, 370, 30, 51834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13802322387695312, "compression_ratio": 1.6728971962616823, "no_speech_prob": 1.6621303942573884e-12}, {"id": 45, "seek": 19682, "start": 196.82, "end": 202.73999999999998, "text": " Well, you have the immense crushing force of gravity pulling matter inward, right?", "tokens": [50365, 1042, 11, 291, 362, 264, 22920, 31317, 3464, 295, 12110, 8407, 1871, 29876, 11, 558, 30, 50661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 46, "seek": 19682, "start": 202.92, "end": 208.7, "text": " And that perfectly balances against the outward thermal pressure generated by the fusion reactions in the core.", "tokens": [50670, 400, 300, 6239, 33993, 1970, 264, 26914, 15070, 3321, 10833, 538, 264, 23100, 12215, 294, 264, 4965, 13, 50959], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 19682, "start": 208.9, "end": 210.72, "text": " So it's like an automatic tug-of-war.", "tokens": [50969, 407, 309, 311, 411, 364, 12509, 33543, 12, 2670, 12, 6925, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 19682, "start": 210.95999999999998, "end": 213.5, "text": " Exactly. It's a dynamically stabilized pattern.", "tokens": [51072, 7587, 13, 467, 311, 257, 43492, 48384, 5102, 13, 51199], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 19682, "start": 214.06, "end": 216.95999999999998, "text": " If the fusion rate drops, gravity compresses the star.", "tokens": [51227, 759, 264, 23100, 3314, 11438, 11, 12110, 14778, 279, 264, 3543, 13, 51372], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 19682, "start": 217.34, "end": 220.82, "text": " That heats up the core, which increases the fusion rate again.", "tokens": [51391, 663, 41035, 493, 264, 4965, 11, 597, 8637, 264, 23100, 3314, 797, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 51, "seek": 19682, "start": 220.92, "end": 221.44, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [51570, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 51596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1284512138366699, "compression_ratio": 1.583657587548638, "no_speech_prob": 1.8903476874110314e-12}, {"id": 52, "seek": 22144, "start": 221.44, "end": 227.35999999999999, "text": " Yeah, it's an automatic, self-correcting feedback loop renegotiated constantly over billions of years.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 11, 309, 311, 364, 12509, 11, 2698, 12, 19558, 2554, 278, 5824, 6367, 319, 28561, 8206, 770, 6460, 670, 17375, 295, 924, 13, 50661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08907093320574079, "compression_ratio": 1.120879120879121, "no_speech_prob": 1.6744185248399046e-12}, {"id": 53, "seek": 22736, "start": 227.36, "end": 232.8, "text": " But we don't get gravity for free on Earth. We can't build a star with the mass of our actual sun.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 321, 500, 380, 483, 12110, 337, 1737, 322, 4755, 13, 492, 393, 380, 1322, 257, 3543, 365, 264, 2758, 295, 527, 3539, 3295, 13, 50637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11156846284866333, "compression_ratio": 1.5137614678899083, "no_speech_prob": 1.694507923734323e-12}, {"id": 54, "seek": 22736, "start": 232.96, "end": 234.24, "text": " Right. We'd destroy the planet.", "tokens": [50645, 1779, 13, 492, 1116, 5293, 264, 5054, 13, 50709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11156846284866333, "compression_ratio": 1.5137614678899083, "no_speech_prob": 1.694507923734323e-12}, {"id": 55, "seek": 22736, "start": 234.58, "end": 244.64000000000001, "text": " Yeah. So to recreate those conditions, we have to engineer that stability deliberately, continuously, and at an astronomical cost.", "tokens": [50726, 865, 13, 407, 281, 25833, 729, 4487, 11, 321, 362, 281, 11403, 300, 11826, 23506, 11, 15684, 11, 293, 412, 364, 49035, 2063, 13, 51229], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11156846284866333, "compression_ratio": 1.5137614678899083, "no_speech_prob": 1.694507923734323e-12}, {"id": 56, "seek": 22736, "start": 244.74, "end": 248.18, "text": " Which leads to a massive divergence in how we design these machines.", "tokens": [51234, 3013, 6689, 281, 257, 5994, 47387, 294, 577, 321, 1715, 613, 8379, 13, 51406], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11156846284866333, "compression_ratio": 1.5137614678899083, "no_speech_prob": 1.694507923734323e-12}, {"id": 57, "seek": 24818, "start": 248.18, "end": 253.62, "text": " Let's use an analogy here. Think about the difference between a Formula One race car and a Honda Civic.", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 764, 364, 21663, 510, 13, 6557, 466, 264, 2649, 1296, 257, 35872, 1485, 4569, 1032, 293, 257, 26989, 46237, 13, 50637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13675585915060604, "compression_ratio": 1.4690721649484537, "no_speech_prob": 1.6415757642107565e-12}, {"id": 58, "seek": 24818, "start": 253.9, "end": 254.86, "text": " I like where this is going.", "tokens": [50651, 286, 411, 689, 341, 307, 516, 13, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13675585915060604, "compression_ratio": 1.4690721649484537, "no_speech_prob": 1.6415757642107565e-12}, {"id": 59, "seek": 24818, "start": 255.16, "end": 264.9, "text": " If you were building a fusion plant designed purely to set a record like to hit that glorious photogenic moment of ignition, you build a Formula One car.", "tokens": [50714, 759, 291, 645, 2390, 257, 23100, 3709, 4761, 17491, 281, 992, 257, 2136, 411, 281, 2045, 300, 24026, 2409, 25473, 1623, 295, 37031, 11, 291, 1322, 257, 35872, 1485, 1032, 13, 51201], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13675585915060604, "compression_ratio": 1.4690721649484537, "no_speech_prob": 1.6415757642107565e-12}, {"id": 60, "seek": 26490, "start": 264.9, "end": 271.35999999999996, "text": " Because it's optimized to output the absolute maximum possible performance for, what, a two-hour window?", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 309, 311, 26941, 281, 5598, 264, 8236, 6674, 1944, 3389, 337, 11, 437, 11, 257, 732, 12, 18048, 4910, 30, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07802394398471765, "compression_ratio": 1.5945017182130585, "no_speech_prob": 1.26438377996696e-12}, {"id": 61, "seek": 26490, "start": 271.58, "end": 278.88, "text": " Right. But to achieve that, the tolerances are so tight that if it hits a small pothole, the suspension shatters.", "tokens": [50699, 1779, 13, 583, 281, 4584, 300, 11, 264, 11125, 2676, 366, 370, 4524, 300, 498, 309, 8664, 257, 1359, 280, 900, 4812, 11, 264, 15771, 402, 37690, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07802394398471765, "compression_ratio": 1.5945017182130585, "no_speech_prob": 1.26438377996696e-12}, {"id": 62, "seek": 26490, "start": 279.12, "end": 284.06, "text": " Yeah, and after every single race, a whole team of engineers has to completely rebuild the engine.", "tokens": [51076, 865, 11, 293, 934, 633, 2167, 4569, 11, 257, 1379, 1469, 295, 11955, 575, 281, 2584, 16877, 264, 2848, 13, 51323], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07802394398471765, "compression_ratio": 1.5945017182130585, "no_speech_prob": 1.26438377996696e-12}, {"id": 63, "seek": 26490, "start": 284.21999999999997, "end": 287.0, "text": " It has absolutely no slack. No margins for error.", "tokens": [51331, 467, 575, 3122, 572, 29767, 13, 883, 30317, 337, 6713, 13, 51470], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07802394398471765, "compression_ratio": 1.5945017182130585, "no_speech_prob": 1.26438377996696e-12}, {"id": 64, "seek": 26490, "start": 287.28, "end": 292.64, "text": " But a power plant that we actually use to light up our cities, that needs to be the Honda Civic.", "tokens": [51484, 583, 257, 1347, 3709, 300, 321, 767, 764, 281, 1442, 493, 527, 6486, 11, 300, 2203, 281, 312, 264, 26989, 46237, 13, 51752], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07802394398471765, "compression_ratio": 1.5945017182130585, "no_speech_prob": 1.26438377996696e-12}, {"id": 65, "seek": 29264, "start": 292.64, "end": 297.32, "text": " Yes. It needs to run for 200,000 miles with nothing but routine oil changes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 467, 2203, 281, 1190, 337, 2331, 11, 1360, 6193, 365, 1825, 457, 9927, 3184, 2962, 13, 50599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09017469281348113, "compression_ratio": 1.5765472312703583, "no_speech_prob": 1.3617869852600162e-12}, {"id": 66, "seek": 29264, "start": 297.71999999999997, "end": 302.5, "text": " It has to survive bad weather, missed maintenance schedules, and just the slow degradation of time.", "tokens": [50619, 467, 575, 281, 7867, 1578, 5503, 11, 6721, 11258, 28078, 11, 293, 445, 264, 2964, 40519, 295, 565, 13, 50858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09017469281348113, "compression_ratio": 1.5765472312703583, "no_speech_prob": 1.3617869852600162e-12}, {"id": 67, "seek": 29264, "start": 302.71999999999997, "end": 311.97999999999996, "text": " Building a bridge that holds its own weight for one afternoon is an entirely different engineering discipline than building one that safely carries rush hour traffic for 50 years.", "tokens": [50869, 18974, 257, 7283, 300, 9190, 1080, 1065, 3364, 337, 472, 6499, 307, 364, 7696, 819, 7043, 13635, 813, 2390, 472, 300, 11750, 16402, 9300, 1773, 6419, 337, 2625, 924, 13, 51332], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09017469281348113, "compression_ratio": 1.5765472312703583, "no_speech_prob": 1.3617869852600162e-12}, {"id": 68, "seek": 29264, "start": 312.21999999999997, "end": 317.65999999999997, "text": " And you can really see how the sociology of big science warps our focus toward the Formula One car.", "tokens": [51344, 400, 291, 393, 534, 536, 577, 264, 41744, 295, 955, 3497, 1516, 1878, 527, 1879, 7361, 264, 35872, 1485, 1032, 13, 51616], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09017469281348113, "compression_ratio": 1.5765472312703583, "no_speech_prob": 1.3617869852600162e-12}, {"id": 69, "seek": 29264, "start": 317.7, "end": 318.53999999999996, "text": " Oh, because of the funding.", "tokens": [51618, 876, 11, 570, 295, 264, 6137, 13, 51660], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09017469281348113, "compression_ratio": 1.5765472312703583, "no_speech_prob": 1.3617869852600162e-12}, {"id": 70, "seek": 31854, "start": 318.54, "end": 325.14000000000004, "text": " Exactly. Government funding, grant cycles, media headlines, they all demand clear, tangible milestones.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 7321, 6137, 11, 6386, 17796, 11, 3021, 23867, 11, 436, 439, 4733, 1850, 11, 27094, 42038, 13, 50695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0989772461272858, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071336106203814e-12}, {"id": 71, "seek": 31854, "start": 325.68, "end": 328.70000000000005, "text": " Ignition is quotable. It's a very clean metric.", "tokens": [50722, 24754, 849, 307, 9641, 712, 13, 467, 311, 257, 588, 2541, 20678, 13, 50873], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0989772461272858, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071336106203814e-12}, {"id": 72, "seek": 31854, "start": 328.88, "end": 338.58000000000004, "text": " Right. You hit what's called the triple product, which is a specific combination of plasma density, extreme temperature, and the amount of time you can hold that heat.", "tokens": [50882, 1779, 13, 509, 2045, 437, 311, 1219, 264, 15508, 1674, 11, 597, 307, 257, 2685, 6562, 295, 22564, 10305, 11, 8084, 4292, 11, 293, 264, 2372, 295, 565, 291, 393, 1797, 300, 3738, 13, 51367], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0989772461272858, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071336106203814e-12}, {"id": 73, "seek": 31854, "start": 338.66, "end": 342.12, "text": " And then you get a massive press release, and the funding keeps flowing.", "tokens": [51371, 400, 550, 291, 483, 257, 5994, 1886, 4374, 11, 293, 264, 6137, 5965, 13974, 13, 51544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0989772461272858, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071336106203814e-12}, {"id": 74, "seek": 34212, "start": 342.12, "end": 344.8, "text": " But persistence doesn't get a press release.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 37617, 1177, 380, 483, 257, 1886, 4374, 13, 50499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14033375740051268, "compression_ratio": 1.51171875, "no_speech_prob": 1.7619999426524147e-12}, {"id": 75, "seek": 34212, "start": 344.8, "end": 347.24, "text": " No. Persistence is quiet. It is invisible.", "tokens": [50499, 883, 13, 14006, 468, 655, 307, 5677, 13, 467, 307, 14603, 13, 50621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14033375740051268, "compression_ratio": 1.51171875, "no_speech_prob": 1.7619999426524147e-12}, {"id": 76, "seek": 34212, "start": 347.88, "end": 355.4, "text": " You do not get a Nobel Prize for a reactor that simply refuses to break down on a Tuesday in year 14 of operation.", "tokens": [50653, 509, 360, 406, 483, 257, 24611, 22604, 337, 257, 20628, 300, 2935, 33222, 281, 1821, 760, 322, 257, 10017, 294, 1064, 3499, 295, 6916, 13, 51029], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14033375740051268, "compression_ratio": 1.51171875, "no_speech_prob": 1.7619999426524147e-12}, {"id": 77, "seek": 34212, "start": 355.76, "end": 356.7, "text": " That's such a great point.", "tokens": [51047, 663, 311, 1270, 257, 869, 935, 13, 51094], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14033375740051268, "compression_ratio": 1.51171875, "no_speech_prob": 1.7619999426524147e-12}, {"id": 78, "seek": 34212, "start": 357.16, "end": 362.54, "text": " But optimizing for that photogenic peak might actually doom the reactor's long-term viability.", "tokens": [51117, 583, 40425, 337, 300, 2409, 25473, 10651, 1062, 767, 37131, 264, 20628, 311, 938, 12, 7039, 1932, 2310, 13, 51386], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14033375740051268, "compression_ratio": 1.51171875, "no_speech_prob": 1.7619999426524147e-12}, {"id": 79, "seek": 34212, "start": 362.72, "end": 365.98, "text": " Because you are tuning the machine to exist on a razor's edge.", "tokens": [51395, 1436, 291, 366, 15164, 264, 3479, 281, 2514, 322, 257, 30478, 311, 4691, 13, 51558], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14033375740051268, "compression_ratio": 1.51171875, "no_speech_prob": 1.7619999426524147e-12}, {"id": 80, "seek": 36598, "start": 365.98, "end": 372.78000000000003, "text": " So if the reactor isn't just a physics experiment designed to hit a peak and make the evening news, what exactly is it?", "tokens": [50365, 407, 498, 264, 20628, 1943, 380, 445, 257, 10649, 5120, 4761, 281, 2045, 257, 10651, 293, 652, 264, 5634, 2583, 11, 437, 2293, 307, 309, 30, 50705], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 81, "seek": 36598, "start": 373.16, "end": 378.06, "text": " Well, Foucletian argues that to answer that, we have to completely redefine the boundary of the machine itself.", "tokens": [50724, 1042, 11, 479, 263, 66, 2631, 952, 38218, 300, 281, 1867, 300, 11, 321, 362, 281, 2584, 38818, 533, 264, 12866, 295, 264, 3479, 2564, 13, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 82, "seek": 36598, "start": 378.22, "end": 381.18, "text": " We have to stop saying, you know, the reactor is the plasma.", "tokens": [50977, 492, 362, 281, 1590, 1566, 11, 291, 458, 11, 264, 20628, 307, 264, 22564, 13, 51125], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 83, "seek": 36598, "start": 381.26, "end": 382.72, "text": " Which is the immediate instinct, right?", "tokens": [51129, 3013, 307, 264, 11629, 16556, 11, 558, 30, 51202], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 84, "seek": 36598, "start": 382.98, "end": 388.82, "text": " Yeah, because the plasma is the swirling 100 million degree cloud of ionized gas.", "tokens": [51215, 865, 11, 570, 264, 22564, 307, 264, 30310, 278, 2319, 2459, 4314, 4588, 295, 17437, 1602, 4211, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 85, "seek": 36598, "start": 388.94, "end": 391.28000000000003, "text": " That's where the atoms are actually smashing together.", "tokens": [51513, 663, 311, 689, 264, 16871, 366, 767, 43316, 1214, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 86, "seek": 36598, "start": 391.5, "end": 392.72, "text": " That's where the magic happens.", "tokens": [51641, 663, 311, 689, 264, 5585, 2314, 13, 51702], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11147999385046581, "compression_ratio": 1.6755852842809364, "no_speech_prob": 1.4325133960990666e-12}, {"id": 87, "seek": 39272, "start": 392.72, "end": 394.5, "text": " But the plasma is just one component.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 22564, 307, 445, 472, 6542, 13, 50454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 88, "seek": 39272, "start": 395.12, "end": 399.26000000000005, "text": " In viability theory, the reactor is the coupled totality of the system.", "tokens": [50485, 682, 1932, 2310, 5261, 11, 264, 20628, 307, 264, 29482, 1993, 1860, 295, 264, 1185, 13, 50692], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 89, "seek": 39272, "start": 399.40000000000003, "end": 401.34000000000003, "text": " The coupled totality. Let's break that down.", "tokens": [50699, 440, 29482, 1993, 1860, 13, 961, 311, 1821, 300, 760, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 90, "seek": 39272, "start": 401.44000000000005, "end": 403.12, "text": " Sure. Yes, it's the plasma.", "tokens": [50801, 4894, 13, 1079, 11, 309, 311, 264, 22564, 13, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 91, "seek": 39272, "start": 403.66, "end": 410.42, "text": " But it is also the massive superconducting magnets creating the invisible cage around that plasma.", "tokens": [50912, 583, 309, 307, 611, 264, 5994, 1687, 38150, 278, 33022, 4084, 264, 14603, 17302, 926, 300, 22564, 13, 51250], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 92, "seek": 39272, "start": 410.68, "end": 410.90000000000003, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51263, 1779, 13, 51274], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 93, "seek": 39272, "start": 411.14000000000004, "end": 417.38000000000005, "text": " It is the cryogenic system pumping liquid helium to keep those magnets at temperatures colder than deep space.", "tokens": [51286, 467, 307, 264, 3305, 25473, 1185, 27131, 6553, 40175, 281, 1066, 729, 33022, 412, 12633, 31020, 813, 2452, 1901, 13, 51598], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 94, "seek": 39272, "start": 417.66, "end": 417.90000000000003, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51612, 3153, 13, 51624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1364915921137883, "compression_ratio": 1.6557377049180328, "no_speech_prob": 1.4048062843205478e-12}, {"id": 95, "seek": 41790, "start": 417.9, "end": 426.56, "text": " It's the structural materials, the cooling loops, the complex control software, and crucially, it is the human operators sitting at the consoles.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 264, 15067, 5319, 11, 264, 14785, 16121, 11, 264, 3997, 1969, 4722, 11, 293, 5140, 1909, 11, 309, 307, 264, 1952, 19077, 3798, 412, 264, 28948, 13, 50798], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09201833426234234, "compression_ratio": 1.5899581589958158, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439638720831205e-12}, {"id": 96, "seek": 41790, "start": 426.88, "end": 428.15999999999997, "text": " The humans are part of the machine.", "tokens": [50814, 440, 6255, 366, 644, 295, 264, 3479, 13, 50878], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09201833426234234, "compression_ratio": 1.5899581589958158, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439638720831205e-12}, {"id": 97, "seek": 41790, "start": 428.34, "end": 428.71999999999997, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50887, 7587, 13, 50906], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09201833426234234, "compression_ratio": 1.5899581589958158, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439638720831205e-12}, {"id": 98, "seek": 41790, "start": 429.14, "end": 439.73999999999995, "text": " And the global supply chains feeding specialized replacement parts into the facility remove any one of those pieces for long enough, and the reactor ceases to exist as a functioning system.", "tokens": [50927, 400, 264, 4338, 5847, 12626, 12919, 19813, 14419, 3166, 666, 264, 8973, 4159, 604, 472, 295, 729, 3755, 337, 938, 1547, 11, 293, 264, 20628, 1769, 1957, 281, 2514, 382, 257, 18483, 1185, 13, 51457], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09201833426234234, "compression_ratio": 1.5899581589958158, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439638720831205e-12}, {"id": 99, "seek": 43974, "start": 439.74, "end": 448.06, "text": " I actually want to introduce a completely different example of fliction brings up here, because it beautifully illustrates how to engineer for this coupled totality.", "tokens": [50365, 286, 767, 528, 281, 5366, 257, 2584, 819, 1365, 295, 932, 4105, 5607, 493, 510, 11, 570, 309, 16525, 41718, 577, 281, 11403, 337, 341, 29482, 1993, 1860, 13, 50781], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 100, "seek": 43974, "start": 448.26, "end": 449.38, "text": " The caldera reactor.", "tokens": [50791, 440, 2104, 1068, 64, 20628, 13, 50847], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 101, "seek": 43974, "start": 449.62, "end": 449.90000000000003, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50859, 1079, 13, 50873], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 102, "seek": 43974, "start": 450.12, "end": 453.88, "text": " And the best part is, it has absolutely nothing to do with nuclear fusion.", "tokens": [50884, 400, 264, 1151, 644, 307, 11, 309, 575, 3122, 1825, 281, 360, 365, 8179, 23100, 13, 51072], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 103, "seek": 43974, "start": 454.02, "end": 456.46000000000004, "text": " It is entirely outside the nuclear field.", "tokens": [51079, 467, 307, 7696, 2380, 264, 8179, 2519, 13, 51201], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 104, "seek": 43974, "start": 456.56, "end": 460.5, "text": " It's an oceanic thermo-pneumatic biomass processing system.", "tokens": [51206, 467, 311, 364, 7810, 299, 8810, 78, 12, 79, 716, 449, 2399, 47420, 9007, 1185, 13, 51403], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 105, "seek": 43974, "start": 460.64, "end": 461.44, "text": " Quite the title.", "tokens": [51410, 20464, 264, 4876, 13, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15866540141941346, "compression_ratio": 1.5587044534412955, "no_speech_prob": 1.304040534409745e-12}, {"id": 106, "seek": 46144, "start": 461.44, "end": 471.66, "text": " Yeah, basically imagine a massive offshore platform that sucks in ocean kelp and peat and uses geothermal steam to process it into biocrude.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 11, 1936, 3811, 257, 5994, 34567, 3663, 300, 15846, 294, 7810, 31332, 79, 293, 520, 267, 293, 4960, 1519, 47280, 11952, 281, 1399, 309, 666, 3228, 3617, 2303, 13, 50876], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11503548423449199, "compression_ratio": 1.5809128630705394, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776667302957014e-12}, {"id": 107, "seek": 46144, "start": 471.82, "end": 471.94, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50884, 1779, 13, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11503548423449199, "compression_ratio": 1.5809128630705394, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776667302957014e-12}, {"id": 108, "seek": 46144, "start": 472.32, "end": 475.62, "text": " So why on earth are we talking about kelp in a deep dive about fusion?", "tokens": [50909, 407, 983, 322, 4120, 366, 321, 1417, 466, 31332, 79, 294, 257, 2452, 9192, 466, 23100, 30, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11503548423449199, "compression_ratio": 1.5809128630705394, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776667302957014e-12}, {"id": 109, "seek": 46144, "start": 475.8, "end": 481.46, "text": " Because the caldera reactor was designed from its inception for persistence, not peak output.", "tokens": [51083, 1436, 264, 2104, 1068, 64, 20628, 390, 4761, 490, 1080, 49834, 337, 37617, 11, 406, 10651, 5598, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11503548423449199, "compression_ratio": 1.5809128630705394, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776667302957014e-12}, {"id": 110, "seek": 46144, "start": 481.64, "end": 481.9, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51375, 1779, 13, 51388], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11503548423449199, "compression_ratio": 1.5809128630705394, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776667302957014e-12}, {"id": 111, "seek": 46144, "start": 482.28, "end": 485.78, "text": " The designers of caldera recognize that the ocean is chaotic.", "tokens": [51407, 440, 16196, 295, 2104, 1068, 64, 5521, 300, 264, 7810, 307, 27013, 13, 51582], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11503548423449199, "compression_ratio": 1.5809128630705394, "no_speech_prob": 1.4776667302957014e-12}, {"id": 112, "seek": 48578, "start": 485.78, "end": 492.17999999999995, "text": " You have massive storms, changing sea states, unpredictable variations in the density of the kelp.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 362, 5994, 23288, 11, 4473, 4158, 4368, 11, 31160, 17840, 294, 264, 10305, 295, 264, 31332, 79, 13, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 113, "seek": 48578, "start": 492.26, "end": 504.58, "text": " And a traditional centralized control system where a main computer reads sensors and barks orders to open or close specific valves, it would be constantly overwhelmed trying to micromanage that chaos.", "tokens": [50689, 400, 257, 5164, 32395, 1969, 1185, 689, 257, 2135, 3820, 15700, 14840, 293, 16202, 82, 9470, 281, 1269, 420, 1998, 2685, 34950, 11, 309, 576, 312, 6460, 19042, 1382, 281, 3123, 81, 4277, 609, 300, 14158, 13, 51305], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 114, "seek": 48578, "start": 504.64, "end": 505.55999999999995, "text": " So what did they do instead?", "tokens": [51308, 407, 437, 630, 436, 360, 2602, 30, 51354], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 115, "seek": 48578, "start": 506.09999999999997, "end": 509.26, "text": " They engineered what's called a thermal clutch knot lattice.", "tokens": [51381, 814, 38648, 437, 311, 1219, 257, 15070, 20597, 16966, 34011, 13, 51539], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 116, "seek": 48578, "start": 509.53999999999996, "end": 510.7, "text": " A thermal clutch knot lattice.", "tokens": [51553, 316, 15070, 20597, 16966, 34011, 13, 51611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 117, "seek": 48578, "start": 510.84, "end": 510.96, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51618, 865, 13, 51624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 118, "seek": 48578, "start": 510.96, "end": 511.55999999999995, "text": " Explain that.", "tokens": [51624, 39574, 300, 13, 51654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1745612644913173, "compression_ratio": 1.6236162361623616, "no_speech_prob": 1.4381183960701649e-12}, {"id": 119, "seek": 51156, "start": 511.56, "end": 517.82, "text": " Instead of digital commands, the routing of fluid and heat is handled by the physical mechanics of the pipes themselves.", "tokens": [50365, 7156, 295, 4562, 16901, 11, 264, 32722, 295, 9113, 293, 3738, 307, 18033, 538, 264, 4001, 12939, 295, 264, 21882, 2969, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 120, "seek": 51156, "start": 517.94, "end": 518.62, "text": " Oh, that's wild.", "tokens": [50684, 876, 11, 300, 311, 4868, 13, 50718], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 121, "seek": 51156, "start": 518.9, "end": 519.1, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50732, 865, 13, 50742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 122, "seek": 51156, "start": 519.44, "end": 525.7, "text": " Picture a vast network of mechanical, spring-loaded valves that naturally yield to high pressure.", "tokens": [50759, 35730, 257, 8369, 3209, 295, 12070, 11, 5587, 12, 2907, 292, 34950, 300, 8195, 11257, 281, 1090, 3321, 13, 51072], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 123, "seek": 51156, "start": 525.86, "end": 526.12, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51080, 1033, 13, 51093], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 124, "seek": 51156, "start": 526.4, "end": 527.14, "text": " I'm picturing it.", "tokens": [51107, 286, 478, 2317, 1345, 309, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 125, "seek": 51156, "start": 527.24, "end": 535.1, "text": " If one section of the plant gets too hot or too pressurized because of a surge in biomass, the local valves physically expand.", "tokens": [51149, 759, 472, 3541, 295, 264, 3709, 2170, 886, 2368, 420, 886, 1886, 374, 1602, 570, 295, 257, 18989, 294, 47420, 11, 264, 2654, 34950, 9762, 5268, 13, 51542], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 126, "seek": 51156, "start": 535.1, "end": 541.34, "text": " They automatically route the excess heat and fluid to cooler, underutilized sections of the plant.", "tokens": [51542, 814, 6772, 7955, 264, 9310, 3738, 293, 9113, 281, 15566, 11, 833, 20835, 1602, 10863, 295, 264, 3709, 13, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10428933302561443, "compression_ratio": 1.698961937716263, "no_speech_prob": 2.0204473944601675e-12}, {"id": 127, "seek": 54156, "start": 541.56, "end": 548.0799999999999, "text": " So it's constantly automatically computing the safest path of the energy to flow just through its physical geometry.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 309, 311, 6460, 6772, 15866, 264, 37558, 3100, 295, 264, 2281, 281, 3095, 445, 807, 1080, 4001, 18426, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 128, "seek": 54156, "start": 548.4, "end": 548.8599999999999, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50707, 7587, 13, 50730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 129, "seek": 54156, "start": 549.1199999999999, "end": 554.02, "text": " It never asks the central computer, you know, how much bio crude can I produce right now?", "tokens": [50743, 467, 1128, 8962, 264, 5777, 3820, 11, 291, 458, 11, 577, 709, 12198, 30796, 393, 286, 5258, 558, 586, 30, 50988], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 130, "seek": 54156, "start": 554.0799999999999, "end": 558.0, "text": " It asks the local environment, what do I need to do to avoid exploding?", "tokens": [50991, 467, 8962, 264, 2654, 2823, 11, 437, 360, 286, 643, 281, 360, 281, 5042, 35175, 30, 51187], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 131, "seek": 54156, "start": 558.26, "end": 560.6999999999999, "text": " It is a decentralized survival mechanism.", "tokens": [51200, 467, 307, 257, 32870, 12559, 7513, 13, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 132, "seek": 54156, "start": 560.6999999999999, "end": 565.64, "text": " And this introduces the absolute central concept of Fliction's entire theory, the admissible region.", "tokens": [51322, 400, 341, 31472, 264, 8236, 5777, 3410, 295, 3235, 4105, 311, 2302, 5261, 11, 264, 5910, 41073, 4458, 13, 51569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 133, "seek": 54156, "start": 565.7399999999999, "end": 566.4799999999999, "text": " The safe zone.", "tokens": [51574, 440, 3273, 6668, 13, 51611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 134, "seek": 54156, "start": 566.5799999999999, "end": 566.7199999999999, "text": " Correct.", "tokens": [51616, 12753, 13, 51623], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 135, "seek": 54156, "start": 566.8399999999999, "end": 570.8199999999999, "text": " The admissible region is the multidimensional space where the system is safe to operate.", "tokens": [51629, 440, 5910, 41073, 4458, 307, 264, 2120, 327, 332, 11075, 1901, 689, 264, 1185, 307, 3273, 281, 9651, 13, 51828], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1216934558957122, "compression_ratio": 1.6504559270516717, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674084209368888e-12}, {"id": 136, "seek": 57082, "start": 570.82, "end": 571.3000000000001, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50365, 1033, 13, 50389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 137, "seek": 57082, "start": 571.62, "end": 573.2600000000001, "text": " Viability is not a binary state.", "tokens": [50405, 6626, 2310, 307, 406, 257, 17434, 1785, 13, 50487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 138, "seek": 57082, "start": 573.62, "end": 575.7600000000001, "text": " A machine is not simply working or broken.", "tokens": [50505, 316, 3479, 307, 406, 2935, 1364, 420, 5463, 13, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 139, "seek": 57082, "start": 576.58, "end": 579.6800000000001, "text": " Viability is a continuously evaluated condition.", "tokens": [50653, 6626, 2310, 307, 257, 15684, 25509, 4188, 13, 50808], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 140, "seek": 57082, "start": 579.82, "end": 580.9200000000001, "text": " Because it's always drifting.", "tokens": [50815, 1436, 309, 311, 1009, 37973, 13, 50870], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 141, "seek": 57082, "start": 581.38, "end": 581.86, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50893, 7587, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 142, "seek": 57082, "start": 582.4000000000001, "end": 586.5600000000001, "text": " A complex system is always, always drifting toward failure.", "tokens": [50944, 316, 3997, 1185, 307, 1009, 11, 1009, 37973, 7361, 7763, 13, 51152], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 143, "seek": 57082, "start": 586.84, "end": 587.58, "text": " Parts wear down.", "tokens": [51166, 4100, 82, 3728, 760, 13, 51203], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 144, "seek": 57082, "start": 588.0, "end": 589.0, "text": " Temperatures fluctuate.", "tokens": [51224, 34864, 3377, 23448, 10107, 13, 51274], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 145, "seek": 57082, "start": 589.46, "end": 590.7600000000001, "text": " Software hits edge cases.", "tokens": [51297, 27428, 8664, 4691, 3331, 13, 51362], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 146, "seek": 57082, "start": 591.0200000000001, "end": 596.5600000000001, "text": " So active work has to be done every second to push the system back into that admissible region.", "tokens": [51375, 407, 4967, 589, 575, 281, 312, 1096, 633, 1150, 281, 2944, 264, 1185, 646, 666, 300, 5910, 41073, 4458, 13, 51652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18721878415062315, "compression_ratio": 1.6131687242798354, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747626506094515e-12}, {"id": 147, "seek": 59656, "start": 596.56, "end": 597.04, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 50389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 148, "seek": 59656, "start": 597.54, "end": 598.02, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50414, 1033, 13, 50438], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 149, "seek": 59656, "start": 598.26, "end": 602.0999999999999, "text": " I want to push back on this a little bit for you as the listener, because as I was reading", "tokens": [50450, 286, 528, 281, 2944, 646, 322, 341, 257, 707, 857, 337, 291, 382, 264, 31569, 11, 570, 382, 286, 390, 3760, 50642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 150, "seek": 59656, "start": 602.0999999999999, "end": 605.4, "text": " this, I kept thinking, aren't engineers already doing this?", "tokens": [50642, 341, 11, 286, 4305, 1953, 11, 3212, 380, 11955, 1217, 884, 341, 30, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 151, "seek": 59656, "start": 605.6199999999999, "end": 606.3599999999999, "text": " It's a fair question.", "tokens": [50818, 467, 311, 257, 3143, 1168, 13, 50855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 152, "seek": 59656, "start": 606.5, "end": 611.3199999999999, "text": " Like nobody builds a coal plant or an airplane expecting it to run flawlessly without maintenance", "tokens": [50862, 1743, 5079, 15182, 257, 10209, 3709, 420, 364, 17130, 9650, 309, 281, 1190, 13717, 12048, 1553, 11258, 51103], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 153, "seek": 59656, "start": 611.3199999999999, "end": 611.8599999999999, "text": " or drift.", "tokens": [51103, 420, 19699, 13, 51130], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 154, "seek": 59656, "start": 612.54, "end": 617.02, "text": " Why is Fliction acting like drift is a brand new concept to structural engineers?", "tokens": [51164, 1545, 307, 3235, 4105, 6577, 411, 19699, 307, 257, 3360, 777, 3410, 281, 15067, 11955, 30, 51388], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 155, "seek": 59656, "start": 617.28, "end": 617.64, "text": " Right?", "tokens": [51401, 1779, 30, 51419], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872743718764361, "compression_ratio": 1.5510204081632653, "no_speech_prob": 1.6617296731344378e-12}, {"id": 156, "seek": 61764, "start": 617.64, "end": 621.6, "text": " Can't we just over-engineer the parts to stay in their own safe zones?", "tokens": [50365, 1664, 380, 321, 445, 670, 12, 25609, 260, 264, 3166, 281, 1754, 294, 641, 1065, 3273, 16025, 30, 50563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 157, "seek": 61764, "start": 622.22, "end": 626.72, "text": " If the magnets have a huge safety margin, and the cooling loop has a huge safety margin,", "tokens": [50594, 759, 264, 33022, 362, 257, 2603, 4514, 10270, 11, 293, 264, 14785, 6367, 575, 257, 2603, 4514, 10270, 11, 50819], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 158, "seek": 61764, "start": 627.42, "end": 628.8199999999999, "text": " isn't the whole reactor safe?", "tokens": [50854, 1943, 380, 264, 1379, 20628, 3273, 30, 50924], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 159, "seek": 61764, "start": 629.16, "end": 634.16, "text": " It's a very fair critique, but it misses the unprecedented nature of fusion.", "tokens": [50941, 467, 311, 257, 588, 3143, 25673, 11, 457, 309, 29394, 264, 21555, 3687, 295, 23100, 13, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 160, "seek": 61764, "start": 634.74, "end": 639.68, "text": " The speed and the sheer density of the interactions in a fusion reactor are just unlike anything we", "tokens": [51220, 440, 3073, 293, 264, 23061, 10305, 295, 264, 13280, 294, 257, 23100, 20628, 366, 445, 8343, 1340, 321, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 161, "seek": 61764, "start": 639.68, "end": 640.4399999999999, "text": " have ever built.", "tokens": [51467, 362, 1562, 3094, 13, 51505], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 162, "seek": 61764, "start": 640.58, "end": 642.0, "text": " So it's not just about thicker steel.", "tokens": [51512, 407, 309, 311, 406, 445, 466, 18142, 8269, 13, 51583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13869110891752154, "compression_ratio": 1.684, "no_speech_prob": 1.604724491309495e-12}, {"id": 163, "seek": 64200, "start": 642.0, "end": 642.32, "text": " No.", "tokens": [50365, 883, 13, 50381], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 164, "seek": 64200, "start": 642.82, "end": 646.02, "text": " The answer to your question lies in something called coupled constraints.", "tokens": [50406, 440, 1867, 281, 428, 1168, 9134, 294, 746, 1219, 29482, 18491, 13, 50566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 165, "seek": 64200, "start": 646.6, "end": 650.08, "text": " You cannot factor the admissible region into separate, independent boxes.", "tokens": [50595, 509, 2644, 5952, 264, 5910, 41073, 4458, 666, 4994, 11, 6695, 9002, 13, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 166, "seek": 64200, "start": 650.5, "end": 651.52, "text": " Oh, because they overlap.", "tokens": [50790, 876, 11, 570, 436, 19959, 13, 50841], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 167, "seek": 64200, "start": 651.68, "end": 651.9, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50849, 1779, 13, 50860], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 168, "seek": 64200, "start": 652.32, "end": 656.9, "text": " Let's say you have a state that is perfectly safe for the plasma alone.", "tokens": [50881, 961, 311, 584, 291, 362, 257, 1785, 300, 307, 6239, 3273, 337, 264, 22564, 3312, 13, 51110], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 169, "seek": 64200, "start": 657.38, "end": 660.5, "text": " And it's a state that is perfectly safe for the magnets alone.", "tokens": [51134, 400, 309, 311, 257, 1785, 300, 307, 6239, 3273, 337, 264, 33022, 3312, 13, 51290], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 170, "seek": 64200, "start": 660.72, "end": 660.96, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51301, 1033, 13, 51313], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 171, "seek": 64200, "start": 661.2, "end": 667.02, "text": " But jointly, that state might be a ticking time bomb because of how those two systems interact.", "tokens": [51325, 583, 46557, 11, 300, 1785, 1062, 312, 257, 33999, 565, 7851, 570, 295, 577, 729, 732, 3652, 4648, 13, 51616], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1545309210723301, "compression_ratio": 1.6574803149606299, "no_speech_prob": 1.6047146250697253e-12}, {"id": 172, "seek": 66702, "start": 667.02, "end": 672.04, "text": " Walk me through a concrete scenario of how that coupling actually plays out in a reactor.", "tokens": [50365, 10818, 385, 807, 257, 9859, 9005, 295, 577, 300, 37447, 767, 5749, 484, 294, 257, 20628, 13, 50616], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 173, "seek": 66702, "start": 672.3, "end": 676.22, "text": " Let's look at the temperature of the cooling loop and the electrical conductivity of the", "tokens": [50629, 961, 311, 574, 412, 264, 4292, 295, 264, 14785, 6367, 293, 264, 12147, 42982, 295, 264, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 174, "seek": 66702, "start": 676.22, "end": 676.52, "text": " magnets.", "tokens": [50825, 33022, 13, 50840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 175, "seek": 66702, "start": 677.28, "end": 681.3199999999999, "text": " Say the cooling loop experiences a tiny drop in flow rate.", "tokens": [50878, 6463, 264, 14785, 6367, 5235, 257, 5870, 3270, 294, 3095, 3314, 13, 51080], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 176, "seek": 66702, "start": 681.4399999999999, "end": 682.34, "text": " Just a small dip.", "tokens": [51086, 1449, 257, 1359, 10460, 13, 51131], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 177, "seek": 66702, "start": 682.5, "end": 682.6999999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51139, 1779, 13, 51149], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 178, "seek": 66702, "start": 683.22, "end": 687.12, "text": " On its own, the cooling system is still well within its safety margin.", "tokens": [51175, 1282, 1080, 1065, 11, 264, 14785, 1185, 307, 920, 731, 1951, 1080, 4514, 10270, 13, 51370], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 179, "seek": 66702, "start": 687.3, "end": 688.18, "text": " It hasn't failed.", "tokens": [51379, 467, 6132, 380, 7612, 13, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 180, "seek": 66702, "start": 688.78, "end": 693.9399999999999, "text": " But that slight temperature increase causes a microscopic change in the electrical resistance", "tokens": [51453, 583, 300, 4036, 4292, 3488, 7700, 257, 47897, 1319, 294, 264, 12147, 7335, 51711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 181, "seek": 66702, "start": 693.9399999999999, "end": 695.74, "text": " of the superconducting magnets.", "tokens": [51711, 295, 264, 1687, 38150, 278, 33022, 13, 51801], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13245763449833312, "compression_ratio": 1.7482014388489209, "no_speech_prob": 1.410518078205636e-12}, {"id": 182, "seek": 69574, "start": 695.74, "end": 697.3, "text": " But the magnets are fine, right?", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 33022, 366, 2489, 11, 558, 30, 50443], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 183, "seek": 69574, "start": 697.6800000000001, "end": 698.7, "text": " Technically, yes.", "tokens": [50462, 42494, 11, 2086, 13, 50513], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 184, "seek": 69574, "start": 698.94, "end": 702.16, "text": " The magnets are also still within their safe operating limits.", "tokens": [50525, 440, 33022, 366, 611, 920, 1951, 641, 3273, 7447, 10406, 13, 50686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 185, "seek": 69574, "start": 702.52, "end": 704.28, "text": " Neither system triggers an alarm.", "tokens": [50704, 23956, 1185, 22827, 364, 14183, 13, 50792], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 186, "seek": 69574, "start": 704.38, "end": 706.66, "text": " But the connection between them is where the danger lives.", "tokens": [50797, 583, 264, 4984, 1296, 552, 307, 689, 264, 4330, 2909, 13, 50911], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 187, "seek": 69574, "start": 706.8, "end": 707.32, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50918, 7587, 13, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 188, "seek": 69574, "start": 707.72, "end": 712.58, "text": " That tiny shift in the magnetic field alters the shape of the plasma by a fraction of a", "tokens": [50964, 663, 5870, 5513, 294, 264, 12688, 2519, 419, 1559, 264, 3909, 295, 264, 22564, 538, 257, 14135, 295, 257, 51207], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 189, "seek": 69574, "start": 712.58, "end": 712.88, "text": " millimeter.", "tokens": [51207, 17942, 13, 51222], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 190, "seek": 69574, "start": 713.0, "end": 713.42, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [51228, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 51249], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 191, "seek": 69574, "start": 713.6800000000001, "end": 719.44, "text": " And suddenly, the edge of that 100 million degree plasma is brushing against a section of", "tokens": [51262, 400, 5800, 11, 264, 4691, 295, 300, 2319, 2459, 4314, 22564, 307, 33130, 1970, 257, 3541, 295, 51550], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 192, "seek": 69574, "start": 719.44, "end": 722.34, "text": " the physical wall that wasn't designed for that direct heat load.", "tokens": [51550, 264, 4001, 2929, 300, 2067, 380, 4761, 337, 300, 2047, 3738, 3677, 13, 51695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 193, "seek": 69574, "start": 722.44, "end": 723.52, "text": " Which is catastrophic.", "tokens": [51700, 3013, 307, 34915, 13, 51754], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12043826786551888, "compression_ratio": 1.66006600660066, "no_speech_prob": 1.8465569785047764e-12}, {"id": 194, "seek": 72352, "start": 723.52, "end": 729.34, "text": " The wall scorches, releases impurities into the plasma, which rapidly cools the reaction.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 2929, 38629, 3781, 11, 16952, 704, 21973, 666, 264, 22564, 11, 597, 12910, 42883, 264, 5480, 13, 50656], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.161102294921875, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685228281827392e-12}, {"id": 195, "seek": 72352, "start": 729.88, "end": 734.38, "text": " It collapses and violently dumps all its energy into the surrounding structure.", "tokens": [50683, 467, 48765, 293, 46728, 11430, 82, 439, 1080, 2281, 666, 264, 11498, 3877, 13, 50908], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.161102294921875, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685228281827392e-12}, {"id": 196, "seek": 72352, "start": 734.5799999999999, "end": 740.5799999999999, "text": " So catastrophic failures in fusion almost never come from one single component spontaneously", "tokens": [50918, 407, 34915, 20774, 294, 23100, 1920, 1128, 808, 490, 472, 2167, 6542, 47632, 51218], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.161102294921875, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685228281827392e-12}, {"id": 197, "seek": 72352, "start": 740.5799999999999, "end": 741.1, "text": " breaking.", "tokens": [51218, 7697, 13, 51244], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.161102294921875, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685228281827392e-12}, {"id": 198, "seek": 72352, "start": 741.38, "end": 742.02, "text": " Almost never.", "tokens": [51258, 12627, 1128, 13, 51290], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.161102294921875, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685228281827392e-12}, {"id": 199, "seek": 72352, "start": 742.4399999999999, "end": 746.3, "text": " They come from these invisible chains of drift across coupled systems.", "tokens": [51311, 814, 808, 490, 613, 14603, 12626, 295, 19699, 2108, 29482, 3652, 13, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.161102294921875, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.7685228281827392e-12}, {"id": 200, "seek": 74630, "start": 746.3, "end": 751.64, "text": " One subsystem drifts slightly, which pushes a second subsystem outside its tolerances, which", "tokens": [50365, 1485, 2090, 9321, 1224, 8065, 4748, 11, 597, 21020, 257, 1150, 2090, 9321, 2380, 1080, 11125, 2676, 11, 597, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 201, "seek": 74630, "start": 751.64, "end": 754.6999999999999, "text": " pushes a third, and suddenly the whole plant comes down.", "tokens": [50632, 21020, 257, 2636, 11, 293, 5800, 264, 1379, 3709, 1487, 760, 13, 50785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 202, "seek": 74630, "start": 754.8199999999999, "end": 755.14, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [50791, 3153, 13, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 203, "seek": 74630, "start": 755.5, "end": 760.28, "text": " So to really grasp this dangerous coupling, we need to dive into the most punishing environment", "tokens": [50825, 407, 281, 534, 21743, 341, 5795, 37447, 11, 321, 643, 281, 9192, 666, 264, 881, 49824, 2823, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 204, "seek": 74630, "start": 760.28, "end": 760.78, "text": " on Earth.", "tokens": [51064, 322, 4755, 13, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 205, "seek": 74630, "start": 761.0, "end": 763.5999999999999, "text": " The immediate physical subsystems of the reactor.", "tokens": [51100, 440, 11629, 4001, 2090, 9321, 82, 295, 264, 20628, 13, 51230], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 206, "seek": 74630, "start": 763.76, "end": 767.3, "text": " The unforgiving physics of the plasma, the fuel, and the walls.", "tokens": [51238, 440, 31411, 15441, 10649, 295, 264, 22564, 11, 264, 6616, 11, 293, 264, 7920, 13, 51415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 207, "seek": 74630, "start": 767.5799999999999, "end": 771.0799999999999, "text": " Let's start with the plasma itself and the magnetic confinement that holds it.", "tokens": [51429, 961, 311, 722, 365, 264, 22564, 2564, 293, 264, 12688, 41064, 300, 9190, 309, 13, 51604], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13457601564424532, "compression_ratio": 1.7159090909090908, "no_speech_prob": 2.262425923688083e-12}, {"id": 208, "seek": 77108, "start": 771.08, "end": 775.96, "text": " Fliction uses an analogy for this that completely reframed how I picture a reactor.", "tokens": [50365, 3235, 4105, 4960, 364, 21663, 337, 341, 300, 2584, 1895, 2356, 292, 577, 286, 3036, 257, 20628, 13, 50609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 209, "seek": 77108, "start": 776.1600000000001, "end": 777.1600000000001, "text": " The bucket analogy.", "tokens": [50619, 440, 13058, 21663, 13, 50669], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 210, "seek": 77108, "start": 777.6800000000001, "end": 777.8000000000001, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50695, 1779, 13, 50701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 211, "seek": 77108, "start": 778.22, "end": 780.94, "text": " Confining plasma isn't like filling a bucket with water.", "tokens": [50722, 11701, 1760, 22564, 1943, 380, 411, 10623, 257, 13058, 365, 1281, 13, 50858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 212, "seek": 77108, "start": 781.1, "end": 782.08, "text": " A bucket is passive.", "tokens": [50866, 316, 13058, 307, 14975, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 213, "seek": 77108, "start": 782.44, "end": 786.14, "text": " You pour the water in, the bucket does its job through its physical shape, and that's", "tokens": [50933, 509, 2016, 264, 1281, 294, 11, 264, 13058, 775, 1080, 1691, 807, 1080, 4001, 3909, 11, 293, 300, 311, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 214, "seek": 77108, "start": 786.14, "end": 786.86, "text": " the end of the story.", "tokens": [51118, 264, 917, 295, 264, 1657, 13, 51154], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 215, "seek": 77108, "start": 786.98, "end": 787.22, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51160, 865, 13, 51172], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 216, "seek": 77108, "start": 787.62, "end": 792.4200000000001, "text": " But confining plasma is like actively balancing a heavy pole on your fingertip.", "tokens": [51192, 583, 1497, 1760, 22564, 307, 411, 13022, 22495, 257, 4676, 13208, 322, 428, 25948, 647, 13, 51432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14911478299361008, "compression_ratio": 1.5916666666666666, "no_speech_prob": 1.6678802436387308e-12}, {"id": 217, "seek": 79242, "start": 792.42, "end": 795.02, "text": " That is a brilliant way to conceptualize it.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 257, 10248, 636, 281, 24106, 1125, 309, 13, 50495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 218, "seek": 79242, "start": 795.4, "end": 798.74, "text": " Plasma is not a substance like water or steel.", "tokens": [50514, 2149, 17494, 307, 406, 257, 12961, 411, 1281, 420, 8269, 13, 50681], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 219, "seek": 79242, "start": 799.06, "end": 801.04, "text": " It is a dynamic field.", "tokens": [50697, 467, 307, 257, 8546, 2519, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 220, "seek": 79242, "start": 801.18, "end": 801.3, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50803, 1779, 13, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 221, "seek": 79242, "start": 801.66, "end": 802.68, "text": " Because it's ionized.", "tokens": [50827, 1436, 309, 311, 17437, 1602, 13, 50878], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 222, "seek": 79242, "start": 802.78, "end": 803.18, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50883, 7587, 13, 50903], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 223, "seek": 79242, "start": 803.6999999999999, "end": 808.9, "text": " When you heat gas to these extreme temperatures, the electrons are stripped away from the atomic", "tokens": [50929, 1133, 291, 3738, 4211, 281, 613, 8084, 12633, 11, 264, 14265, 366, 33221, 1314, 490, 264, 22275, 51189], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 224, "seek": 79242, "start": 808.9, "end": 809.3399999999999, "text": " nuclei.", "tokens": [51189, 49919, 13, 51211], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 225, "seek": 79242, "start": 809.56, "end": 815.3399999999999, "text": " You get this swirling, chaotic soup of charged particles, temperature gradients, and internal", "tokens": [51222, 509, 483, 341, 30310, 278, 11, 27013, 7884, 295, 11109, 10007, 11, 4292, 2771, 2448, 11, 293, 6920, 51511], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 226, "seek": 79242, "start": 815.3399999999999, "end": 816.24, "text": " electrical currents.", "tokens": [51511, 12147, 30110, 13, 51556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 227, "seek": 79242, "start": 816.36, "end": 818.68, "text": " And it desperately wants to expand and cool down, right?", "tokens": [51562, 400, 309, 23726, 2738, 281, 5268, 293, 1627, 760, 11, 558, 30, 51678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 228, "seek": 79242, "start": 818.74, "end": 819.18, "text": " Desperately.", "tokens": [51681, 3885, 610, 1592, 13, 51703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17068242626029903, "compression_ratio": 1.589928057553957, "no_speech_prob": 1.6613767653272937e-12}, {"id": 229, "seek": 81918, "start": 819.5799999999999, "end": 822.2399999999999, "text": " Magnetic confinement isn't a rigid physical cage.", "tokens": [50385, 19664, 3532, 41064, 1943, 380, 257, 22195, 4001, 17302, 13, 50518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 230, "seek": 81918, "start": 822.62, "end": 826.0, "text": " It is the active, continuous enforcement of a constraint.", "tokens": [50537, 467, 307, 264, 4967, 11, 10957, 11475, 295, 257, 25534, 13, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 231, "seek": 81918, "start": 826.1999999999999, "end": 831.5999999999999, "text": " So imagine you are the operator, or like the control algorithm, actively balancing that", "tokens": [50716, 407, 3811, 291, 366, 264, 12973, 11, 420, 411, 264, 1969, 9284, 11, 13022, 22495, 300, 50986], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 232, "seek": 81918, "start": 831.5999999999999, "end": 832.38, "text": " pole on your finger.", "tokens": [50986, 13208, 322, 428, 5984, 13, 51025], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 233, "seek": 81918, "start": 832.78, "end": 837.3, "text": " If you look away for a fraction of a second, the pole tilts, accelerates, and falls.", "tokens": [51045, 759, 291, 574, 1314, 337, 257, 14135, 295, 257, 1150, 11, 264, 13208, 8440, 1373, 11, 10172, 1024, 11, 293, 8804, 13, 51271], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 234, "seek": 81918, "start": 837.78, "end": 838.9399999999999, "text": " The plasma disrupts.", "tokens": [51295, 440, 22564, 14124, 82, 13, 51353], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 235, "seek": 81918, "start": 838.9399999999999, "end": 844.4, "text": " And to stop that, the magnetic field has to be actively adjusted, literally millisecond", "tokens": [51353, 400, 281, 1590, 300, 11, 264, 12688, 2519, 575, 281, 312, 13022, 19871, 11, 3736, 27940, 18882, 51626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 236, "seek": 81918, "start": 844.4, "end": 848.52, "text": " by millisecond, to suppress instabilities that naturally form in the plasma.", "tokens": [51626, 538, 27940, 18882, 11, 281, 26835, 1058, 6167, 300, 8195, 1254, 294, 264, 22564, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12977757974832999, "compression_ratio": 1.7269503546099292, "no_speech_prob": 1.66197665438933e-12}, {"id": 237, "seek": 84852, "start": 848.52, "end": 849.54, "text": " And that takes power.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 300, 2516, 1347, 13, 50416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 238, "seek": 84852, "start": 849.86, "end": 850.96, "text": " Enormous amounts of power.", "tokens": [50432, 2193, 687, 563, 11663, 295, 1347, 13, 50487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 239, "seek": 84852, "start": 851.4399999999999, "end": 856.64, "text": " You need external heating systems, things like neutral beam injection, or high-frequency", "tokens": [50511, 509, 643, 8320, 15082, 3652, 11, 721, 411, 10598, 14269, 22873, 11, 420, 1090, 12, 19325, 48154, 50771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 240, "seek": 84852, "start": 856.64, "end": 858.74, "text": " radio waves, just to keep the temperature up.", "tokens": [50771, 6477, 9417, 11, 445, 281, 1066, 264, 4292, 493, 13, 50876], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 241, "seek": 84852, "start": 859.16, "end": 864.42, "text": " So immediately, your safe, admissible region for the plasma is entirely coupled to the availability", "tokens": [50897, 407, 4258, 11, 428, 3273, 11, 5910, 41073, 4458, 337, 264, 22564, 307, 7696, 29482, 281, 264, 17945, 51160], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 242, "seek": 84852, "start": 864.42, "end": 867.52, "text": " and stability of your external power supply.", "tokens": [51160, 293, 11826, 295, 428, 8320, 1347, 5847, 13, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 243, "seek": 84852, "start": 867.66, "end": 868.6, "text": " And your cooling loops.", "tokens": [51322, 400, 428, 14785, 16121, 13, 51369], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 244, "seek": 84852, "start": 868.9399999999999, "end": 869.34, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51386, 7587, 13, 51406], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 245, "seek": 84852, "start": 869.4399999999999, "end": 870.1, "text": " It's all connected.", "tokens": [51411, 467, 311, 439, 4582, 13, 51444], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 246, "seek": 84852, "start": 870.3199999999999, "end": 872.96, "text": " And then there is the fuel cycle, the tritium bottleneck.", "tokens": [51455, 400, 550, 456, 307, 264, 6616, 6586, 11, 264, 504, 270, 2197, 44641, 547, 13, 51587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16255457359447814, "compression_ratio": 1.579136690647482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900237498855165e-12}, {"id": 247, "seek": 87296, "start": 872.96, "end": 877.86, "text": " I really want to spend some time on this, because it feels like the elephant in the room that", "tokens": [50365, 286, 534, 528, 281, 3496, 512, 565, 322, 341, 11, 570, 309, 3417, 411, 264, 19791, 294, 264, 1808, 300, 50610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 248, "seek": 87296, "start": 877.86, "end": 880.12, "text": " the general public never, ever hears about.", "tokens": [50610, 264, 2674, 1908, 1128, 11, 1562, 25688, 466, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 249, "seek": 87296, "start": 880.48, "end": 881.0600000000001, "text": " Oh, it is.", "tokens": [50741, 876, 11, 309, 307, 13, 50770], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 250, "seek": 87296, "start": 881.2800000000001, "end": 885.38, "text": " It is arguably the most daunting physical constraint in the entire endeavor.", "tokens": [50781, 467, 307, 26771, 264, 881, 37657, 4001, 25534, 294, 264, 2302, 34975, 13, 50986], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 251, "seek": 87296, "start": 885.6, "end": 890.12, "text": " Because we are trying to run a commercial power plant on a fuel that effectively does", "tokens": [50997, 1436, 321, 366, 1382, 281, 1190, 257, 6841, 1347, 3709, 322, 257, 6616, 300, 8659, 775, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 252, "seek": 87296, "start": 890.12, "end": 891.02, "text": " not exist in nature.", "tokens": [51223, 406, 2514, 294, 3687, 13, 51268], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 253, "seek": 87296, "start": 891.24, "end": 892.0600000000001, "text": " That's the reality.", "tokens": [51279, 663, 311, 264, 4103, 13, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 254, "seek": 87296, "start": 892.38, "end": 895.88, "text": " A standard fusion reaction requires two isotopes of hydrogen.", "tokens": [51336, 316, 3832, 23100, 5480, 7029, 732, 38018, 30545, 295, 12697, 13, 51511], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 255, "seek": 87296, "start": 896.82, "end": 898.36, "text": " Deuterium and tritium.", "tokens": [51558, 1346, 20314, 2197, 293, 504, 270, 2197, 13, 51635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 256, "seek": 87296, "start": 898.5400000000001, "end": 899.5, "text": " Deuterium is easy, Ray.", "tokens": [51644, 1346, 20314, 2197, 307, 1858, 11, 10883, 13, 51692], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12578887626773022, "compression_ratio": 1.6062717770034842, "no_speech_prob": 1.890352674741025e-12}, {"id": 257, "seek": 89950, "start": 899.5, "end": 900.46, "text": " Very easy.", "tokens": [50365, 4372, 1858, 13, 50413], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 258, "seek": 89950, "start": 900.86, "end": 901.78, "text": " It's stable and abundant.", "tokens": [50433, 467, 311, 8351, 293, 30657, 13, 50479], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 259, "seek": 89950, "start": 902.12, "end": 903.44, "text": " You can extract it from seawater.", "tokens": [50496, 509, 393, 8947, 309, 490, 369, 1607, 771, 13, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 260, "seek": 89950, "start": 903.98, "end": 909.16, "text": " But tritium is a radioactive isotope with a half-life of roughly 12 years.", "tokens": [50589, 583, 504, 270, 2197, 307, 257, 35844, 38018, 1114, 365, 257, 1922, 12, 9073, 295, 9810, 2272, 924, 13, 50848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 261, "seek": 89950, "start": 909.3, "end": 910.78, "text": " Meaning it disappears over time.", "tokens": [50855, 19948, 309, 25527, 670, 565, 13, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 262, "seek": 89950, "start": 910.9, "end": 911.26, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50935, 7587, 13, 50953], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 263, "seek": 89950, "start": 911.6, "end": 916.52, "text": " Even if a natural deposit did exist on Earth, it would decay into helium relatively quickly.", "tokens": [50970, 2754, 498, 257, 3303, 19107, 630, 2514, 322, 4755, 11, 309, 576, 21039, 666, 40175, 7226, 2661, 13, 51216], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 264, "seek": 89950, "start": 916.72, "end": 917.66, "text": " So we can't mine it.", "tokens": [51226, 407, 321, 393, 380, 3892, 309, 13, 51273], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 265, "seek": 89950, "start": 917.8, "end": 918.9, "text": " Where does it come from today?", "tokens": [51280, 2305, 775, 309, 808, 490, 965, 30, 51335], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 266, "seek": 89950, "start": 919.32, "end": 923.16, "text": " Currently, the global supply of tritium is measured in mere kilograms.", "tokens": [51356, 19964, 11, 264, 4338, 5847, 295, 504, 270, 2197, 307, 12690, 294, 8401, 30690, 13, 51548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 267, "seek": 89950, "start": 923.36, "end": 924.0, "text": " Kilograms.", "tokens": [51558, 23912, 12820, 82, 13, 51590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 268, "seek": 89950, "start": 924.28, "end": 925.14, "text": " For the whole planet.", "tokens": [51604, 1171, 264, 1379, 5054, 13, 51647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 269, "seek": 89950, "start": 925.24, "end": 925.54, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51652, 1079, 13, 51667], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 270, "seek": 89950, "start": 925.72, "end": 929.44, "text": " Most of it is just a byproduct from a specific type of fission reactor.", "tokens": [51676, 4534, 295, 309, 307, 445, 257, 538, 33244, 490, 257, 2685, 2010, 295, 283, 3106, 20628, 13, 51862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1762106082583434, "compression_ratio": 1.5313432835820895, "no_speech_prob": 1.44374204431863e-12}, {"id": 271, "seek": 92950, "start": 929.84, "end": 931.86, "text": " Like the CandiU reactors in Canada.", "tokens": [50382, 1743, 264, 20466, 72, 52, 41649, 294, 6309, 13, 50483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 272, "seek": 92950, "start": 932.0, "end": 933.8, "text": " Wait, but aren't those being decommissioned?", "tokens": [50490, 3802, 11, 457, 3212, 380, 729, 885, 979, 1204, 3106, 292, 30, 50580], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 273, "seek": 92950, "start": 934.0, "end": 934.34, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50590, 1079, 13, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 274, "seek": 92950, "start": 934.72, "end": 940.12, "text": " And as those older fission plants shut down, that tiny trickle of global tritium supply", "tokens": [50626, 400, 382, 729, 4906, 283, 3106, 5972, 5309, 760, 11, 300, 5870, 4282, 306, 295, 4338, 504, 270, 2197, 5847, 50896], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 275, "seek": 92950, "start": 940.12, "end": 941.14, "text": " is going to dry up.", "tokens": [50896, 307, 516, 281, 4016, 493, 13, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 276, "seek": 92950, "start": 941.28, "end": 946.48, "text": " Which means a commercial fusion reactor has to manufacture its own fuel while it is running.", "tokens": [50954, 3013, 1355, 257, 6841, 23100, 20628, 575, 281, 27400, 1080, 1065, 6616, 1339, 309, 307, 2614, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 277, "seek": 92950, "start": 946.9, "end": 947.72, "text": " It has to breed it.", "tokens": [51235, 467, 575, 281, 18971, 309, 13, 51276], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 278, "seek": 92950, "start": 947.82, "end": 948.44, "text": " It has to eat.", "tokens": [51281, 467, 575, 281, 1862, 13, 51312], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 279, "seek": 92950, "start": 948.86, "end": 953.58, "text": " And it has to cook its own food at the exact same time using the heat from the meal it", "tokens": [51333, 400, 309, 575, 281, 2543, 1080, 1065, 1755, 412, 264, 1900, 912, 565, 1228, 264, 3738, 490, 264, 6791, 309, 51569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 280, "seek": 92950, "start": 953.58, "end": 954.28, "text": " is currently eating.", "tokens": [51569, 307, 4362, 3936, 13, 51604], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 281, "seek": 92950, "start": 954.74, "end": 955.0, "text": " Oh.", "tokens": [51627, 876, 13, 51640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 282, "seek": 92950, "start": 955.14, "end": 957.18, "text": " That is, I mean, that's wild.", "tokens": [51647, 663, 307, 11, 286, 914, 11, 300, 311, 4868, 13, 51749], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19142208511023212, "compression_ratio": 1.6535714285714285, "no_speech_prob": 1.3830258552977037e-12}, {"id": 283, "seek": 95718, "start": 957.18, "end": 959.04, "text": " It does this using a breeding blanket.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 775, 341, 1228, 257, 26051, 17907, 13, 50458], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14307486424680615, "compression_ratio": 1.485207100591716, "no_speech_prob": 1.426922273915776e-12}, {"id": 284, "seek": 95718, "start": 959.66, "end": 963.3399999999999, "text": " The fusion reaction inside the plasma produces high-energy neutrons.", "tokens": [50489, 440, 23100, 5480, 1854, 264, 22564, 14725, 1090, 12, 49016, 7989, 13270, 13, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14307486424680615, "compression_ratio": 1.485207100591716, "no_speech_prob": 1.426922273915776e-12}, {"id": 285, "seek": 95718, "start": 964.04, "end": 967.9599999999999, "text": " These neutrons have no electrical charge, so they punch right through the magnetic cage", "tokens": [50708, 1981, 7989, 13270, 362, 572, 12147, 4602, 11, 370, 436, 8135, 558, 807, 264, 12688, 17302, 50904], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14307486424680615, "compression_ratio": 1.485207100591716, "no_speech_prob": 1.426922273915776e-12}, {"id": 286, "seek": 95718, "start": 967.9599999999999, "end": 970.5, "text": " and slam into the physical walls of the reactor.", "tokens": [50904, 293, 25617, 666, 264, 4001, 7920, 295, 264, 20628, 13, 51031], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14307486424680615, "compression_ratio": 1.485207100591716, "no_speech_prob": 1.426922273915776e-12}, {"id": 287, "seek": 95718, "start": 970.7399999999999, "end": 970.9599999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51043, 1779, 13, 51054], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14307486424680615, "compression_ratio": 1.485207100591716, "no_speech_prob": 1.426922273915776e-12}, {"id": 288, "seek": 97096, "start": 970.96, "end": 974.8000000000001, "text": " Surrounding the plasma is a thick blanket containing lithium-6.", "tokens": [50365, 6732, 5453, 278, 264, 22564, 307, 257, 5060, 17907, 19273, 32180, 12, 21, 13, 50557], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12061770931705014, "compression_ratio": 1.5523809523809524, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356190490549039e-12}, {"id": 289, "seek": 97096, "start": 975.34, "end": 980.64, "text": " When a neutron hits a lithium atom, it splits into helium and a single atom of tritium.", "tokens": [50584, 1133, 257, 44362, 8664, 257, 32180, 12018, 11, 309, 37741, 666, 40175, 293, 257, 2167, 12018, 295, 504, 270, 2197, 13, 50849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12061770931705014, "compression_ratio": 1.5523809523809524, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356190490549039e-12}, {"id": 290, "seek": 97096, "start": 980.96, "end": 981.5, "text": " And then what?", "tokens": [50865, 400, 550, 437, 30, 50892], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12061770931705014, "compression_ratio": 1.5523809523809524, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356190490549039e-12}, {"id": 291, "seek": 97096, "start": 981.5600000000001, "end": 982.5, "text": " You just scoop it out?", "tokens": [50895, 509, 445, 19555, 309, 484, 30, 50942], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12061770931705014, "compression_ratio": 1.5523809523809524, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356190490549039e-12}, {"id": 292, "seek": 97096, "start": 982.62, "end": 987.82, "text": " You have to rapidly extract that tritium gas from the hot metal, purify it, and inject", "tokens": [50948, 509, 362, 281, 12910, 8947, 300, 504, 270, 2197, 4211, 490, 264, 2368, 5760, 11, 1864, 2505, 309, 11, 293, 10711, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12061770931705014, "compression_ratio": 1.5523809523809524, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356190490549039e-12}, {"id": 293, "seek": 97096, "start": 987.82, "end": 990.24, "text": " it back into the plasma to keep the fire burning.", "tokens": [51208, 309, 646, 666, 264, 22564, 281, 1066, 264, 2610, 9488, 13, 51329], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12061770931705014, "compression_ratio": 1.5523809523809524, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356190490549039e-12}, {"id": 294, "seek": 99024, "start": 990.24, "end": 994.62, "text": " And here is the brutal, unforgiving math of the viability theory.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 510, 307, 264, 17878, 11, 31411, 15441, 5221, 295, 264, 1932, 2310, 5261, 13, 50584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 295, "seek": 99024, "start": 995.6, "end": 1000.12, "text": " The breeding ratio, meaning the number of tritium atoms produced versus the number consumed,", "tokens": [50633, 440, 26051, 8509, 11, 3620, 264, 1230, 295, 504, 270, 2197, 16871, 7126, 5717, 264, 1230, 21226, 11, 50859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 296, "seek": 99024, "start": 1000.6800000000001, "end": 1002.66, "text": " must reliably exceed 1.0.", "tokens": [50887, 1633, 49927, 14048, 502, 13, 15, 13, 50986], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 297, "seek": 99024, "start": 1002.9, "end": 1008.4, "text": " If a fusion reaction consumes one atom of tritium, it must breed at least one atom of tritium just", "tokens": [50998, 759, 257, 23100, 5480, 48823, 472, 12018, 295, 504, 270, 2197, 11, 309, 1633, 18971, 412, 1935, 472, 12018, 295, 504, 270, 2197, 445, 51273], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 298, "seek": 99024, "start": 1008.4, "end": 1009.3, "text": " to break even.", "tokens": [51273, 281, 1821, 754, 13, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 299, "seek": 99024, "start": 1009.42, "end": 1010.08, "text": " The things leak.", "tokens": [51324, 440, 721, 17143, 13, 51357], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 300, "seek": 99024, "start": 1010.28, "end": 1010.6800000000001, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51367, 7587, 13, 51387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14883490668402777, "compression_ratio": 1.6281407035175879, "no_speech_prob": 1.8179276443583414e-12}, {"id": 301, "seek": 101068, "start": 1010.68, "end": 1014.9399999999999, "text": " Because some tritium is inevitably lost, it permeates through metal pipes, gets trapped", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 512, 504, 270, 2197, 307, 28171, 2731, 11, 309, 30287, 1024, 807, 5760, 21882, 11, 2170, 14994, 50578], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 302, "seek": 101068, "start": 1014.9399999999999, "end": 1019.66, "text": " in structural components, or decays in a storage tank, the reactor actually needs a breeding", "tokens": [50578, 294, 15067, 6677, 11, 420, 979, 3772, 294, 257, 6725, 5466, 11, 264, 20628, 767, 2203, 257, 26051, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 303, "seek": 101068, "start": 1019.66, "end": 1023.3199999999999, "text": " ratio closer to 1.05 or 1.1 just to survive.", "tokens": [50814, 8509, 4966, 281, 502, 13, 13328, 420, 502, 13, 16, 445, 281, 7867, 13, 50997], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 304, "seek": 101068, "start": 1023.42, "end": 1024.8, "text": " What happens if it hits 0.99?", "tokens": [51002, 708, 2314, 498, 309, 8664, 1958, 13, 8494, 30, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 305, "seek": 101068, "start": 1025.24, "end": 1026.1, "text": " You are dying.", "tokens": [51093, 509, 366, 8639, 13, 51136], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 306, "seek": 101068, "start": 1026.8999999999999, "end": 1028.32, "text": " And it's worse than just shutting down.", "tokens": [51176, 400, 309, 311, 5324, 813, 445, 36057, 760, 13, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 307, "seek": 101068, "start": 1028.44, "end": 1030.1599999999999, "text": " It is a compounding deficit.", "tokens": [51253, 467, 307, 257, 14154, 278, 22132, 13, 51339], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 308, "seek": 101068, "start": 1030.46, "end": 1034.3799999999999, "text": " It's not a temporary glitch that you can just shrug off and try again tomorrow.", "tokens": [51354, 467, 311, 406, 257, 13413, 23552, 300, 291, 393, 445, 9884, 697, 766, 293, 853, 797, 4153, 13, 51550], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 309, "seek": 101068, "start": 1034.46, "end": 1034.6599999999999, "text": " No.", "tokens": [51554, 883, 13, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 310, "seek": 101068, "start": 1035.1799999999998, "end": 1038.84, "text": " If you fall behind on breeding fuel, your plasma loses density.", "tokens": [51590, 759, 291, 2100, 2261, 322, 26051, 6616, 11, 428, 22564, 18293, 10305, 13, 51773], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11971161970451696, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 1.9427430584390004e-12}, {"id": 311, "seek": 103884, "start": 1038.84, "end": 1044.06, "text": " Which means it produces fewer neutrons, which means you breed even less tritium.", "tokens": [50365, 3013, 1355, 309, 14725, 13366, 7989, 13270, 11, 597, 1355, 291, 18971, 754, 1570, 504, 270, 2197, 13, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 312, "seek": 103884, "start": 1044.36, "end": 1045.1, "text": " It's a death spiral.", "tokens": [50641, 467, 311, 257, 2966, 25165, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 313, "seek": 103884, "start": 1045.26, "end": 1046.4399999999998, "text": " A total death spiral.", "tokens": [50686, 316, 3217, 2966, 25165, 13, 50745], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 314, "seek": 103884, "start": 1047.0, "end": 1050.3999999999999, "text": " And you cannot just call a supplier and buy more on the open market because it doesn't", "tokens": [50773, 400, 291, 2644, 445, 818, 257, 31909, 293, 2256, 544, 322, 264, 1269, 2142, 570, 309, 1177, 380, 50943], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 315, "seek": 103884, "start": 1050.3999999999999, "end": 1050.78, "text": " exist.", "tokens": [50943, 2514, 13, 50962], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 316, "seek": 103884, "start": 1050.9599999999998, "end": 1053.48, "text": " You will slowly starve the reactor.", "tokens": [50971, 509, 486, 5692, 46755, 264, 20628, 13, 51097], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 317, "seek": 103884, "start": 1053.86, "end": 1058.1999999999998, "text": " And on top of all that, we're expecting these highly complex breeding blankets to operate", "tokens": [51116, 400, 322, 1192, 295, 439, 300, 11, 321, 434, 9650, 613, 5405, 3997, 26051, 38710, 281, 9651, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 318, "seek": 103884, "start": 1058.1999999999998, "end": 1063.28, "text": " inside an environment that no material in the universe naturally evolved to survive.", "tokens": [51333, 1854, 364, 2823, 300, 572, 2527, 294, 264, 6445, 8195, 14178, 281, 7867, 13, 51587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 319, "seek": 103884, "start": 1063.76, "end": 1065.4199999999998, "text": " Which brings us to the walls.", "tokens": [51611, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 264, 7920, 13, 51694], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 320, "seek": 103884, "start": 1065.58, "end": 1066.98, "text": " Ah, the first wall.", "tokens": [51702, 2438, 11, 264, 700, 2929, 13, 51772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14704960682353035, "compression_ratio": 1.6426116838487972, "no_speech_prob": 1.6881563421472512e-12}, {"id": 321, "seek": 106698, "start": 1066.98, "end": 1071.98, "text": " Yeah, the physical surface directly facing the plasma and the structural materials behind", "tokens": [50365, 865, 11, 264, 4001, 3753, 3838, 7170, 264, 22564, 293, 264, 15067, 5319, 2261, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 322, "seek": 106698, "start": 1071.98, "end": 1072.2, "text": " it.", "tokens": [50615, 309, 13, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 323, "seek": 106698, "start": 1072.8, "end": 1077.16, "text": " They are subjected to a continuous torrential flood of 14 mevi neutrons.", "tokens": [50656, 814, 366, 32153, 281, 257, 10957, 3930, 1753, 831, 10481, 295, 3499, 385, 4917, 7989, 13270, 13, 50874], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 324, "seek": 106698, "start": 1077.3600000000001, "end": 1079.94, "text": " And neutron damage doesn't look like a hammer hitting a wall.", "tokens": [50884, 400, 44362, 4344, 1177, 380, 574, 411, 257, 13017, 8850, 257, 2929, 13, 51013], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 325, "seek": 106698, "start": 1080.1, "end": 1085.08, "text": " It is a slow, insidious compounding process at the microscopic level.", "tokens": [51021, 467, 307, 257, 2964, 11, 1028, 327, 851, 14154, 278, 1399, 412, 264, 47897, 1496, 13, 51270], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 326, "seek": 106698, "start": 1085.2, "end": 1086.22, "text": " What does that actually look like?", "tokens": [51276, 708, 775, 300, 767, 574, 411, 30, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 327, "seek": 106698, "start": 1086.22, "end": 1089.14, "text": " Like when a neutron hits the wall, what physically happens to the metal?", "tokens": [51327, 1743, 562, 257, 44362, 8664, 264, 2929, 11, 437, 9762, 2314, 281, 264, 5760, 30, 51473], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1496938705444336, "compression_ratio": 1.5859375, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612943880458086e-12}, {"id": 328, "seek": 108914, "start": 1089.14, "end": 1094.8600000000001, "text": " Think of the metal as an incredibly orderly, three-dimensional grid of atoms.", "tokens": [50365, 6557, 295, 264, 5760, 382, 364, 6252, 1668, 356, 11, 1045, 12, 18759, 10748, 295, 16871, 13, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 329, "seek": 108914, "start": 1095.4, "end": 1096.5400000000002, "text": " A crystal lattice.", "tokens": [50678, 316, 13662, 34011, 13, 50735], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 330, "seek": 108914, "start": 1096.98, "end": 1098.2800000000002, "text": " Okay, I can picture that.", "tokens": [50757, 1033, 11, 286, 393, 3036, 300, 13, 50822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 331, "seek": 108914, "start": 1098.5, "end": 1103.0400000000002, "text": " When a high-energy neutron collides with one of those metal atoms, it hits it with such", "tokens": [50833, 1133, 257, 1090, 12, 49016, 44362, 1263, 1875, 365, 472, 295, 729, 5760, 16871, 11, 309, 8664, 309, 365, 1270, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 332, "seek": 108914, "start": 1103.0400000000002, "end": 1107.24, "text": " force that it knocks the atom completely out of its position in the grid.", "tokens": [51060, 3464, 300, 309, 40815, 264, 12018, 2584, 484, 295, 1080, 2535, 294, 264, 10748, 13, 51270], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 333, "seek": 108914, "start": 1107.5200000000002, "end": 1107.76, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51284, 865, 13, 51296], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 334, "seek": 108914, "start": 1108.0, "end": 1112.5200000000002, "text": " That displaced atom ricochets through the lattice, knocking dozens of other atoms out of place", "tokens": [51308, 663, 33692, 12018, 41529, 339, 1385, 807, 264, 34011, 11, 24085, 18431, 295, 661, 16871, 484, 295, 1081, 51534], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 335, "seek": 108914, "start": 1112.5200000000002, "end": 1113.74, "text": " before coming to a stop.", "tokens": [51534, 949, 1348, 281, 257, 1590, 13, 51595], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1304559885898483, "compression_ratio": 1.6334661354581674, "no_speech_prob": 1.4439669078492035e-12}, {"id": 336, "seek": 111374, "start": 1113.74, "end": 1118.98, "text": " So it's like a microscopic bowling ball tearing through a highly organized rack of pins.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 309, 311, 411, 257, 47897, 35537, 2594, 29401, 807, 257, 5405, 9983, 14788, 295, 16392, 13, 50627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 337, "seek": 111374, "start": 1119.18, "end": 1120.2, "text": " That's perfectly said.", "tokens": [50637, 663, 311, 6239, 848, 13, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 338, "seek": 111374, "start": 1120.8, "end": 1125.9, "text": " And over months and years, as trillions of these collisions happen, the internal structure", "tokens": [50718, 400, 670, 2493, 293, 924, 11, 382, 504, 46279, 295, 613, 46537, 1051, 11, 264, 6920, 3877, 50973], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 339, "seek": 111374, "start": 1125.9, "end": 1127.86, "text": " of the metal is fundamentally altered.", "tokens": [50973, 295, 264, 5760, 307, 17879, 28783, 13, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 340, "seek": 111374, "start": 1128.1, "end": 1128.8, "text": " It weakens it.", "tokens": [51083, 467, 5336, 694, 309, 13, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 341, "seek": 111374, "start": 1129.08, "end": 1130.0, "text": " It becomes brittle.", "tokens": [51132, 467, 3643, 49325, 13, 51178], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 342, "seek": 111374, "start": 1130.24, "end": 1131.6, "text": " It loses its ductility.", "tokens": [51190, 467, 18293, 1080, 25954, 1140, 13, 51258], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 343, "seek": 111374, "start": 1131.9, "end": 1135.5, "text": " It can even swell in size, warping the shape of the components.", "tokens": [51273, 467, 393, 754, 34251, 294, 2744, 11, 1516, 3381, 264, 3909, 295, 264, 6677, 13, 51453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 344, "seek": 111374, "start": 1135.8, "end": 1137.22, "text": " But it might look fine on the outside, right?", "tokens": [51468, 583, 309, 1062, 574, 2489, 322, 264, 2380, 11, 558, 30, 51539], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 345, "seek": 111374, "start": 1137.26, "end": 1137.84, "text": " Oh, absolutely.", "tokens": [51541, 876, 11, 3122, 13, 51570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17168505845871646, "compression_ratio": 1.5719557195571956, "no_speech_prob": 1.7830286943090745e-12}, {"id": 346, "seek": 113784, "start": 1137.84, "end": 1142.9199999999998, "text": " From the outside, after a year, the wall might look perfectly fine to a visual camera.", "tokens": [50365, 3358, 264, 2380, 11, 934, 257, 1064, 11, 264, 2929, 1062, 574, 6239, 2489, 281, 257, 5056, 2799, 13, 50619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11054033499497634, "compression_ratio": 1.5923344947735192, "no_speech_prob": 1.728182484270202e-12}, {"id": 347, "seek": 113784, "start": 1143.3999999999999, "end": 1149.1599999999999, "text": " But internally, it is quietly accumulating microscopic damage that will make it structurally", "tokens": [50643, 583, 19501, 11, 309, 307, 19141, 12989, 12162, 47897, 4344, 300, 486, 652, 309, 6594, 6512, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11054033499497634, "compression_ratio": 1.5923344947735192, "no_speech_prob": 1.728182484270202e-12}, {"id": 348, "seek": 113784, "start": 1149.1599999999999, "end": 1154.4199999999998, "text": " unsafe or even prone to shattering under thermal stress by year 5 or 10.", "tokens": [50931, 35948, 420, 754, 25806, 281, 402, 14849, 833, 15070, 4244, 538, 1064, 1025, 420, 1266, 13, 51194], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11054033499497634, "compression_ratio": 1.5923344947735192, "no_speech_prob": 1.728182484270202e-12}, {"id": 349, "seek": 113784, "start": 1154.78, "end": 1158.36, "text": " Which completely shifts the paradigm of how we have to build these massive structures.", "tokens": [51212, 3013, 2584, 19201, 264, 24709, 295, 577, 321, 362, 281, 1322, 613, 5994, 9227, 13, 51391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11054033499497634, "compression_ratio": 1.5923344947735192, "no_speech_prob": 1.728182484270202e-12}, {"id": 350, "seek": 113784, "start": 1158.76, "end": 1162.52, "text": " You don't design the first wall of a fusion reactor for permanence.", "tokens": [51411, 509, 500, 380, 1715, 264, 700, 2929, 295, 257, 23100, 20628, 337, 8105, 655, 13, 51599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11054033499497634, "compression_ratio": 1.5923344947735192, "no_speech_prob": 1.728182484270202e-12}, {"id": 351, "seek": 113784, "start": 1162.72, "end": 1165.1599999999999, "text": " You have to design it for continuous replacement.", "tokens": [51609, 509, 362, 281, 1715, 309, 337, 10957, 14419, 13, 51731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11054033499497634, "compression_ratio": 1.5923344947735192, "no_speech_prob": 1.728182484270202e-12}, {"id": 352, "seek": 116516, "start": 1165.16, "end": 1167.16, "text": " The maintenance isn't an afterthought.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 11258, 1943, 380, 364, 934, 43135, 13, 50465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 353, "seek": 116516, "start": 1167.38, "end": 1170.3600000000001, "text": " It is a structural feature of the design from day one.", "tokens": [50476, 467, 307, 257, 15067, 4111, 295, 264, 1715, 490, 786, 472, 13, 50625], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 354, "seek": 116516, "start": 1170.5800000000002, "end": 1171.9, "text": " You have to know it's going to fail.", "tokens": [50636, 509, 362, 281, 458, 309, 311, 516, 281, 3061, 13, 50702], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 355, "seek": 116516, "start": 1172.0800000000002, "end": 1176.8000000000002, "text": " If you know the core of your machine will become intensely radioactive and structurally", "tokens": [50711, 759, 291, 458, 264, 4965, 295, 428, 3479, 486, 1813, 43235, 35844, 293, 6594, 6512, 50947], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 356, "seek": 116516, "start": 1176.8000000000002, "end": 1182.22, "text": " compromised within a few years, you have to design the entire reactor to be disassembled", "tokens": [50947, 32463, 1951, 257, 1326, 924, 11, 291, 362, 281, 1715, 264, 2302, 20628, 281, 312, 717, 29386, 1493, 51218], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 357, "seek": 116516, "start": 1182.22, "end": 1185.22, "text": " and reassembled by robotic remote handling equipment.", "tokens": [51218, 293, 319, 29386, 1493, 538, 30468, 8607, 13175, 5927, 13, 51368], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 358, "seek": 116516, "start": 1185.48, "end": 1186.8400000000001, "text": " Because humans can't go in there.", "tokens": [51381, 1436, 6255, 393, 380, 352, 294, 456, 13, 51449], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 359, "seek": 116516, "start": 1187.14, "end": 1187.5800000000002, "text": " Never.", "tokens": [51464, 7344, 13, 51486], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 360, "seek": 116516, "start": 1188.1000000000001, "end": 1193.3000000000002, "text": " Every bolt, every pipe connection has to be accessible to a robot arm because a human being", "tokens": [51512, 2048, 13436, 11, 633, 11240, 4984, 575, 281, 312, 9515, 281, 257, 7881, 3726, 570, 257, 1952, 885, 51772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10833181428515222, "compression_ratio": 1.6632996632996633, "no_speech_prob": 1.6750159202369441e-12}, {"id": 361, "seek": 119330, "start": 1193.3, "end": 1197.26, "text": " can never safely walk into that chamber again once it has been operating.", "tokens": [50365, 393, 1128, 11750, 1792, 666, 300, 13610, 797, 1564, 309, 575, 668, 7447, 13, 50563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 362, "seek": 119330, "start": 1197.6399999999999, "end": 1202.74, "text": " So bringing this back to Flixion's theory of viability versus peak performance, let's", "tokens": [50582, 407, 5062, 341, 646, 281, 3235, 970, 313, 311, 5261, 295, 1932, 2310, 5717, 10651, 3389, 11, 718, 311, 50837], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 363, "seek": 119330, "start": 1202.74, "end": 1205.08, "text": " say you have a genius materials engineer.", "tokens": [50837, 584, 291, 362, 257, 14017, 5319, 11403, 13, 50954], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 364, "seek": 119330, "start": 1205.3999999999999, "end": 1205.76, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50970, 1033, 13, 50988], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 365, "seek": 119330, "start": 1206.32, "end": 1210.8799999999999, "text": " They design a lithium breeding blanket that is incredibly efficient on day one.", "tokens": [51016, 814, 1715, 257, 32180, 26051, 17907, 300, 307, 6252, 7148, 322, 786, 472, 13, 51244], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 366, "seek": 119330, "start": 1211.3, "end": 1214.98, "text": " It breeds tritium like crazy, giving you a massive surplus of fuel.", "tokens": [51265, 467, 41609, 504, 270, 2197, 411, 3219, 11, 2902, 291, 257, 5994, 31019, 295, 6616, 13, 51449], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 367, "seek": 119330, "start": 1215.1, "end": 1215.86, "text": " Sounds great on paper.", "tokens": [51455, 14576, 869, 322, 3035, 13, 51493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18588581491023937, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 1.7691698800392786e-12}, {"id": 368, "seek": 121586, "start": 1215.86, "end": 1216.3799999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 50391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 369, "seek": 121586, "start": 1216.8799999999999, "end": 1223.06, "text": " But under that intense neutron bombardment, the complex architecture of that blanket grades", "tokens": [50416, 583, 833, 300, 9447, 44362, 42894, 518, 11, 264, 3997, 9482, 295, 300, 17907, 18041, 50725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 370, "seek": 121586, "start": 1223.06, "end": 1224.54, "text": " rapidly by year five.", "tokens": [50725, 12910, 538, 1064, 1732, 13, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 371, "seek": 121586, "start": 1225.02, "end": 1230.4799999999998, "text": " In the context of the Lawson Criterion, the sprit for peak performance, that blanket looks", "tokens": [50823, 682, 264, 4319, 295, 264, 7744, 3015, 4779, 1681, 313, 11, 264, 637, 3210, 337, 10651, 3389, 11, 300, 17907, 1542, 51096], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 372, "seek": 121586, "start": 1230.4799999999998, "end": 1232.6, "text": " like a massive triumph on day one.", "tokens": [51096, 411, 257, 5994, 29156, 322, 786, 472, 13, 51202], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 373, "seek": 121586, "start": 1232.8, "end": 1237.6799999999998, "text": " But in the context of viability theory, you have completely failed the test.", "tokens": [51212, 583, 294, 264, 4319, 295, 1932, 2310, 5261, 11, 291, 362, 2584, 7612, 264, 1500, 13, 51456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 374, "seek": 121586, "start": 1238.24, "end": 1239.3, "text": " Because it couldn't persist.", "tokens": [51484, 1436, 309, 2809, 380, 13233, 13, 51537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 375, "seek": 121586, "start": 1239.4199999999998, "end": 1243.62, "text": " Because your cooling system, your breeding system, and your structural materials are all", "tokens": [51543, 1436, 428, 14785, 1185, 11, 428, 26051, 1185, 11, 293, 428, 15067, 5319, 366, 439, 51753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 376, "seek": 121586, "start": 1243.62, "end": 1244.7199999999998, "text": " hopelessly coupled.", "tokens": [51753, 27317, 356, 29482, 13, 51808], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1884023802621024, "compression_ratio": 1.7137546468401488, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428741183959316e-12}, {"id": 377, "seek": 124472, "start": 1244.72, "end": 1250.44, "text": " The cooling system isn't just there to extract heat to spin a turbine for electricity.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 14785, 1185, 1943, 380, 445, 456, 281, 8947, 3738, 281, 6060, 257, 27536, 337, 10356, 13, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 378, "seek": 124472, "start": 1250.68, "end": 1250.7, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50663, 1779, 13, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 379, "seek": 124472, "start": 1250.78, "end": 1251.6200000000001, "text": " It regulates the metal.", "tokens": [50668, 467, 9837, 1024, 264, 5760, 13, 50710], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 380, "seek": 124472, "start": 1251.82, "end": 1252.3, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50720, 7587, 13, 50744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 381, "seek": 124472, "start": 1252.6200000000001, "end": 1257.6000000000001, "text": " It dictates the temperature that the structural materials operate at, which directly influences", "tokens": [50760, 467, 12569, 1024, 264, 4292, 300, 264, 15067, 5319, 9651, 412, 11, 597, 3838, 21222, 51009], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 382, "seek": 124472, "start": 1257.6000000000001, "end": 1261.82, "text": " how fast those atoms can migrate back into place after a neutron knocks them out.", "tokens": [51009, 577, 2370, 729, 16871, 393, 31821, 646, 666, 1081, 934, 257, 44362, 40815, 552, 484, 13, 51220], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 383, "seek": 124472, "start": 1262.32, "end": 1263.98, "text": " Temperature dictates the aging rate.", "tokens": [51245, 34864, 1503, 12569, 1024, 264, 19090, 3314, 13, 51328], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 384, "seek": 124472, "start": 1264.32, "end": 1267.68, "text": " So we have the plasma, which requires active adjustments in microseconds.", "tokens": [51345, 407, 321, 362, 264, 22564, 11, 597, 7029, 4967, 18624, 294, 3123, 37841, 28750, 13, 51513], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 385, "seek": 124472, "start": 1268.02, "end": 1271.0, "text": " We have the tritium fuel cycle, which drifts over days.", "tokens": [51530, 492, 362, 264, 504, 270, 2197, 6616, 6586, 11, 597, 1224, 8065, 670, 1708, 13, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 386, "seek": 124472, "start": 1271.3600000000001, "end": 1274.54, "text": " And we have the structural walls, which degrade over years.", "tokens": [51697, 400, 321, 362, 264, 15067, 7920, 11, 597, 368, 8692, 670, 924, 13, 51856], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13877463886756022, "compression_ratio": 1.740983606557377, "no_speech_prob": 1.5186313578191557e-12}, {"id": 387, "seek": 127454, "start": 1274.54, "end": 1275.74, "text": " A huge spread of time.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 2603, 3974, 295, 565, 13, 50425], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 388, "seek": 127454, "start": 1276.1399999999999, "end": 1276.28, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50445, 865, 13, 50452], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 389, "seek": 127454, "start": 1276.42, "end": 1281.78, "text": " And this massive spread reveals the exact mechanism by which these reactors will actually", "tokens": [50459, 400, 341, 5994, 3974, 20893, 264, 1900, 7513, 538, 597, 613, 41649, 486, 767, 50727], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 390, "seek": 127454, "start": 1281.78, "end": 1282.18, "text": " die.", "tokens": [50727, 978, 13, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 391, "seek": 127454, "start": 1282.3799999999999, "end": 1284.2, "text": " They don't die from a single explosion.", "tokens": [50757, 814, 500, 380, 978, 490, 257, 2167, 15673, 13, 50848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 392, "seek": 127454, "start": 1284.42, "end": 1286.76, "text": " They die from failure cascades across time.", "tokens": [50859, 814, 978, 490, 7763, 3058, 66, 2977, 2108, 565, 13, 50976], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 393, "seek": 127454, "start": 1286.92, "end": 1290.04, "text": " Because a fusion reactor runs on many different clocks simultaneously.", "tokens": [50984, 1436, 257, 23100, 20628, 6676, 322, 867, 819, 41528, 16561, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 394, "seek": 127454, "start": 1290.48, "end": 1293.68, "text": " You have plasma instabilities happening in milliseconds.", "tokens": [51162, 509, 362, 22564, 1058, 6167, 2737, 294, 34184, 13, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21000259305224006, "compression_ratio": 1.5727699530516432, "no_speech_prob": 2.201738791285379e-12}, {"id": 395, "seek": 129368, "start": 1293.68, "end": 1297.76, "text": " Thermal transients fluctuations in heat happening in minutes.", "tokens": [50365, 38957, 304, 1145, 2448, 45276, 294, 3738, 2737, 294, 2077, 13, 50569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1817451868301783, "compression_ratio": 1.5116279069767442, "no_speech_prob": 1.789757469831954e-12}, {"id": 396, "seek": 129368, "start": 1297.76, "end": 1300.3600000000001, "text": " The tritium inventory drifting over days.", "tokens": [50569, 440, 504, 270, 2197, 14228, 37973, 670, 1708, 13, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1817451868301783, "compression_ratio": 1.5116279069767442, "no_speech_prob": 1.789757469831954e-12}, {"id": 397, "seek": 129368, "start": 1300.48, "end": 1302.72, "text": " Material damage accumulating over years.", "tokens": [50705, 29160, 4344, 12989, 12162, 670, 924, 13, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1817451868301783, "compression_ratio": 1.5116279069767442, "no_speech_prob": 1.789757469831954e-12}, {"id": 398, "seek": 129368, "start": 1303.0600000000002, "end": 1308.04, "text": " And, as we will discuss shortly, institutional memory eroding over decades.", "tokens": [50834, 400, 11, 382, 321, 486, 2248, 13392, 11, 18391, 4675, 1189, 8616, 670, 7878, 13, 51083], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1817451868301783, "compression_ratio": 1.5116279069767442, "no_speech_prob": 1.789757469831954e-12}, {"id": 399, "seek": 129368, "start": 1308.42, "end": 1311.52, "text": " Now, separating these timescales is usually a good thing, right?", "tokens": [51102, 823, 11, 29279, 613, 1413, 66, 4229, 307, 2673, 257, 665, 551, 11, 558, 30, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1817451868301783, "compression_ratio": 1.5116279069767442, "no_speech_prob": 1.789757469831954e-12}, {"id": 400, "seek": 129368, "start": 1311.74, "end": 1313.52, "text": " That's how engineers manage complexity.", "tokens": [51268, 663, 311, 577, 11955, 3067, 14024, 13, 51357], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1817451868301783, "compression_ratio": 1.5116279069767442, "no_speech_prob": 1.789757469831954e-12}, {"id": 401, "seek": 131352, "start": 1313.52, "end": 1315.44, "text": " It's the only way to build anything complex.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 264, 787, 636, 281, 1322, 1340, 3997, 13, 50461], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 402, "seek": 131352, "start": 1315.76, "end": 1315.94, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50477, 1779, 13, 50486], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 403, "seek": 131352, "start": 1316.3799999999999, "end": 1320.58, "text": " The algorithm controlling the magnetic field doesn't need to worry about 10-year radiation", "tokens": [50508, 440, 9284, 14905, 264, 12688, 2519, 1177, 380, 643, 281, 3292, 466, 1266, 12, 5294, 12420, 50718], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 404, "seek": 131352, "start": 1320.58, "end": 1323.96, "text": " damage when it's just trying to fix a millisecond flutter in the plasma.", "tokens": [50718, 4344, 562, 309, 311, 445, 1382, 281, 3191, 257, 27940, 18882, 932, 9947, 294, 264, 22564, 13, 50887], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 405, "seek": 131352, "start": 1324.1, "end": 1324.62, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50894, 7587, 13, 50920], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 406, "seek": 131352, "start": 1324.9, "end": 1330.46, "text": " But Fliction argues that this separation, which makes designing the plant possible, is precisely", "tokens": [50934, 583, 3235, 4105, 38218, 300, 341, 14634, 11, 597, 1669, 14685, 264, 3709, 1944, 11, 307, 13402, 51212], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 407, "seek": 131352, "start": 1330.46, "end": 1332.2, "text": " the vulnerability that destroys it.", "tokens": [51212, 264, 24210, 300, 36714, 309, 13, 51299], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 408, "seek": 131352, "start": 1332.46, "end": 1337.32, "text": " Because the separation breaks down when a fast event violates a fundamental assumption that", "tokens": [51312, 1436, 264, 14634, 9857, 760, 562, 257, 2370, 2280, 3448, 1024, 257, 8088, 15302, 300, 51555], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 409, "seek": 131352, "start": 1337.32, "end": 1338.82, "text": " a slow system depends on.", "tokens": [51555, 257, 2964, 1185, 5946, 322, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14343394030321827, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 2.012559173134032e-12}, {"id": 410, "seek": 133882, "start": 1338.82, "end": 1342.02, "text": " This is the exact anatomy of a failure cascade.", "tokens": [50365, 639, 307, 264, 1900, 31566, 295, 257, 7763, 50080, 13, 50525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 411, "seek": 133882, "start": 1342.5, "end": 1344.54, "text": " Here's where it gets really interesting for you as a listener.", "tokens": [50549, 1692, 311, 689, 309, 2170, 534, 1880, 337, 291, 382, 257, 31569, 13, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 412, "seek": 133882, "start": 1345.08, "end": 1346.84, "text": " Give me a concrete example of this.", "tokens": [50678, 5303, 385, 257, 9859, 1365, 295, 341, 13, 50766], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 413, "seek": 133882, "start": 1347.48, "end": 1350.7, "text": " How does a microsecond event destroy a five-year plan?", "tokens": [50798, 1012, 775, 257, 3123, 37841, 18882, 2280, 5293, 257, 1732, 12, 5294, 1393, 30, 50959], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 414, "seek": 133882, "start": 1350.9399999999998, "end": 1351.2, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50971, 1033, 13, 50984], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 415, "seek": 133882, "start": 1351.34, "end": 1353.98, "text": " Let's say you have a microsecond plasma disruption.", "tokens": [50991, 961, 311, 584, 291, 362, 257, 3123, 37841, 18882, 22564, 28751, 13, 51123], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 416, "seek": 133882, "start": 1354.6599999999999, "end": 1361.76, "text": " The control system misses a tiny chaotic instability, and a small pocket of the plasma briefly loses", "tokens": [51157, 440, 1969, 1185, 29394, 257, 5870, 27013, 34379, 11, 293, 257, 1359, 8963, 295, 264, 22564, 10515, 18293, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 417, "seek": 133882, "start": 1361.76, "end": 1362.34, "text": " confinement.", "tokens": [51512, 41064, 13, 51541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 418, "seek": 133882, "start": 1362.98, "end": 1363.32, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51573, 1033, 13, 51590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 419, "seek": 133882, "start": 1363.32, "end": 1368.32, "text": " In a fraction of a second, it deposits a massive, intense burst of thermal and mechanical", "tokens": [51590, 682, 257, 14135, 295, 257, 1150, 11, 309, 30958, 257, 5994, 11, 9447, 12712, 295, 15070, 293, 12070, 51840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19240237871805826, "compression_ratio": 1.6172413793103448, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640202325188e-12}, {"id": 420, "seek": 136882, "start": 1368.82, "end": 1373.3, "text": " stress onto a highly localized, small section of the first wall.", "tokens": [50365, 4244, 3911, 257, 5405, 44574, 11, 1359, 3541, 295, 264, 700, 2929, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 421, "seek": 136882, "start": 1373.5, "end": 1376.02, "text": " Just a sudden, violent scorch mark on the wall.", "tokens": [50599, 1449, 257, 3990, 11, 11867, 38629, 339, 1491, 322, 264, 2929, 13, 50725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 422, "seek": 136882, "start": 1376.1599999999999, "end": 1376.5, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50732, 1779, 13, 50749], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 423, "seek": 136882, "start": 1376.9399999999998, "end": 1380.8, "text": " Now, your slow timescale maintenance schedule was built on statistical averages.", "tokens": [50771, 823, 11, 428, 2964, 1413, 37088, 11258, 7567, 390, 3094, 322, 22820, 42257, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 424, "seek": 136882, "start": 1381.5, "end": 1386.24, "text": " The engineers calculated that under normal operation, the wall will age uniformly and needs", "tokens": [50999, 440, 11955, 15598, 300, 833, 2710, 6916, 11, 264, 2929, 486, 3205, 48806, 293, 2203, 51236], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 425, "seek": 136882, "start": 1386.24, "end": 1387.84, "text": " to be replaced every five years.", "tokens": [51236, 281, 312, 10772, 633, 1732, 924, 13, 51316], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 426, "seek": 136882, "start": 1388.12, "end": 1390.1599999999999, "text": " But the schedule doesn't know about the scorch mark.", "tokens": [51330, 583, 264, 7567, 1177, 380, 458, 466, 264, 38629, 339, 1491, 13, 51432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 427, "seek": 136882, "start": 1390.3, "end": 1390.82, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [51439, 48746, 736, 13, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 428, "seek": 136882, "start": 1390.82, "end": 1395.48, "text": " The spreadsheet tracking the calendar doesn't know that this specific microsecond event just", "tokens": [51465, 440, 27733, 11603, 264, 12183, 1177, 380, 458, 300, 341, 2685, 3123, 37841, 18882, 2280, 445, 51698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 429, "seek": 136882, "start": 1395.48, "end": 1398.36, "text": " aged a tiny piece of the wall by three years in an instant.", "tokens": [51698, 21213, 257, 5870, 2522, 295, 264, 2929, 538, 1045, 924, 294, 364, 9836, 13, 51842], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1264848122229943, "compression_ratio": 1.6884735202492211, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012521390952993e-12}, {"id": 430, "seek": 139836, "start": 1398.36, "end": 1401.6999999999998, "text": " Because the maintenance schedule is looking at the calendar, not the millisecond sensor", "tokens": [50365, 1436, 264, 11258, 7567, 307, 1237, 412, 264, 12183, 11, 406, 264, 27940, 18882, 10200, 50532], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 431, "seek": 139836, "start": 1401.6999999999998, "end": 1402.02, "text": " data.", "tokens": [50532, 1412, 13, 50548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 432, "seek": 139836, "start": 1402.12, "end": 1402.56, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50553, 7587, 13, 50575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 433, "seek": 139836, "start": 1402.8999999999999, "end": 1405.52, "text": " So that affected section of the wall continues in service.", "tokens": [50592, 407, 300, 8028, 3541, 295, 264, 2929, 6515, 294, 2643, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 434, "seek": 139836, "start": 1405.78, "end": 1407.9399999999998, "text": " A year later, it fails prematurely.", "tokens": [50736, 316, 1064, 1780, 11, 309, 18199, 34877, 356, 13, 50844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 435, "seek": 139836, "start": 1408.28, "end": 1412.1999999999998, "text": " That failure compromises the cooling flow to that specific region.", "tokens": [50861, 663, 7763, 11482, 3598, 264, 14785, 3095, 281, 300, 2685, 4458, 13, 51057], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 436, "seek": 139836, "start": 1413.3, "end": 1417.8999999999999, "text": " The localized overheating then alters the electrical properties of the magnets behind the wall,", "tokens": [51112, 440, 44574, 29807, 990, 550, 419, 1559, 264, 12147, 7221, 295, 264, 33022, 2261, 264, 2929, 11, 51342], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 437, "seek": 139836, "start": 1418.06, "end": 1423.34, "text": " which slightly changes the shape of the magnetic field, which triggers more frequent plasma", "tokens": [51350, 597, 4748, 2962, 264, 3909, 295, 264, 12688, 2519, 11, 597, 22827, 544, 18004, 22564, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 438, "seek": 139836, "start": 1423.34, "end": 1424.1999999999998, "text": " disruptions.", "tokens": [51614, 14124, 626, 13, 51657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 439, "seek": 139836, "start": 1424.3, "end": 1425.2199999999998, "text": " A complete cascade.", "tokens": [51662, 316, 3566, 50080, 13, 51708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1578777006694249, "compression_ratio": 1.6724137931034482, "no_speech_prob": 1.7758134372714007e-12}, {"id": 440, "seek": 142522, "start": 1425.22, "end": 1425.7, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 50389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 441, "seek": 142522, "start": 1426.34, "end": 1430.26, "text": " The fast timescale punched a hole in the slow timescale's assumptions.", "tokens": [50421, 440, 2370, 1413, 37088, 37842, 257, 5458, 294, 264, 2964, 1413, 37088, 311, 17695, 13, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 442, "seek": 142522, "start": 1430.84, "end": 1435.64, "text": " And because all the systems are coupled, the failure cascades across the entire reactor.", "tokens": [50646, 400, 570, 439, 264, 3652, 366, 29482, 11, 264, 7763, 3058, 66, 2977, 2108, 264, 2302, 20628, 13, 50886], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 443, "seek": 142522, "start": 1435.92, "end": 1440.5, "text": " It's like discovering your house's foundation cracked during a tiny localized earthquake.", "tokens": [50900, 467, 311, 411, 24773, 428, 1782, 311, 7030, 25140, 1830, 257, 5870, 44574, 18778, 13, 51129], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 444, "seek": 142522, "start": 1440.7, "end": 1444.8, "text": " But you don't notice until the roof caves in three years later, because your inspection", "tokens": [51139, 583, 291, 500, 380, 3449, 1826, 264, 8418, 32288, 294, 1045, 924, 1780, 11, 570, 428, 22085, 51344], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 445, "seek": 142522, "start": 1444.8, "end": 1447.34, "text": " schedule was based on average annual rainfall.", "tokens": [51344, 7567, 390, 2361, 322, 4274, 9784, 29382, 13, 51471], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 446, "seek": 142522, "start": 1447.68, "end": 1448.98, "text": " That is a perfect analogy.", "tokens": [51488, 663, 307, 257, 2176, 21663, 13, 51553], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928180497946197, "compression_ratio": 1.5877862595419847, "no_speech_prob": 1.6619765459691127e-12}, {"id": 447, "seek": 144898, "start": 1448.98, "end": 1454.88, "text": " And it is precisely why Flixion introduces the concept of digital twins as a survival mechanism.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 309, 307, 13402, 983, 3235, 970, 313, 31472, 264, 3410, 295, 4562, 22555, 382, 257, 12559, 7513, 13, 50660], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 448, "seek": 144898, "start": 1455.28, "end": 1455.46, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50680, 1079, 13, 50689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 449, "seek": 144898, "start": 1455.56, "end": 1456.84, "text": " And I love how he frames this.", "tokens": [50694, 400, 286, 959, 577, 415, 12083, 341, 13, 50758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 450, "seek": 144898, "start": 1456.94, "end": 1458.7, "text": " Digital twins are such a buzzword right now.", "tokens": [50763, 15522, 22555, 366, 1270, 257, 13036, 7462, 558, 586, 13, 50851], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 451, "seek": 144898, "start": 1458.78, "end": 1459.52, "text": " They really are.", "tokens": [50855, 814, 534, 366, 13, 50892], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 452, "seek": 144898, "start": 1459.8600000000001, "end": 1463.82, "text": " Usually they're pitched as these magical AI saviors that just look pretty on a computer", "tokens": [50909, 11419, 436, 434, 32994, 382, 613, 12066, 7318, 601, 4917, 830, 300, 445, 574, 1238, 322, 257, 3820, 51107], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 453, "seek": 144898, "start": 1463.82, "end": 1464.96, "text": " monitor in the control room.", "tokens": [51107, 6002, 294, 264, 1969, 1808, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 454, "seek": 144898, "start": 1465.46, "end": 1467.96, "text": " But Flixion calls them prediction folded into repair.", "tokens": [51189, 583, 3235, 970, 313, 5498, 552, 17630, 23940, 666, 10535, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 455, "seek": 144898, "start": 1468.3600000000001, "end": 1474.54, "text": " A digital twin is a continuously updated, high fidelity computational model of the reactor.", "tokens": [51334, 316, 4562, 18397, 307, 257, 15684, 10588, 11, 1090, 46404, 28270, 2316, 295, 264, 20628, 13, 51643], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1631651426616468, "compression_ratio": 1.6091549295774648, "no_speech_prob": 1.6949242573685575e-12}, {"id": 456, "seek": 147454, "start": 1474.54, "end": 1479.26, "text": " But its true value isn't just in mirroring the current state of the machine.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 1080, 2074, 2158, 1943, 380, 445, 294, 8013, 278, 264, 2190, 1785, 295, 264, 3479, 13, 50601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20348387498121995, "compression_ratio": 1.4615384615384615, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074343241357814e-12}, {"id": 457, "seek": 147454, "start": 1479.82, "end": 1480.3799999999999, "text": " What is it then?", "tokens": [50629, 708, 307, 309, 550, 30, 50657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20348387498121995, "compression_ratio": 1.4615384615384615, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074343241357814e-12}, {"id": 458, "seek": 147454, "start": 1480.6599999999999, "end": 1484.54, "text": " Its value is in bridging those separated time scales.", "tokens": [50671, 6953, 2158, 307, 294, 16362, 3249, 729, 12005, 565, 17408, 13, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20348387498121995, "compression_ratio": 1.4615384615384615, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074343241357814e-12}, {"id": 459, "seek": 147454, "start": 1484.72, "end": 1487.04, "text": " How does it actually do that computations-wise?", "tokens": [50874, 1012, 775, 309, 767, 360, 300, 2807, 763, 12, 3711, 30, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20348387498121995, "compression_ratio": 1.4615384615384615, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074343241357814e-12}, {"id": 460, "seek": 147454, "start": 1487.3799999999999, "end": 1490.6, "text": " It runs simulations slightly faster than real time.", "tokens": [51007, 467, 6676, 35138, 4748, 4663, 813, 957, 565, 13, 51168], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20348387498121995, "compression_ratio": 1.4615384615384615, "no_speech_prob": 1.7074343241357814e-12}, {"id": 461, "seek": 149060, "start": 1490.6, "end": 1496.98, "text": " If the digital twin can recognize a specific complex pattern of magnetic flutter, one that", "tokens": [50365, 759, 264, 4562, 18397, 393, 5521, 257, 2685, 3997, 5102, 295, 12688, 932, 9947, 11, 472, 300, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 462, "seek": 149060, "start": 1496.98, "end": 1502.0, "text": " usually precedes a major disruption, it can alert the control system to intervene before", "tokens": [50684, 2673, 16969, 279, 257, 2563, 28751, 11, 309, 393, 9615, 264, 1969, 1185, 281, 30407, 949, 50935], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 463, "seek": 149060, "start": 1502.0, "end": 1504.9399999999998, "text": " the physical sensor feels the full force of the event.", "tokens": [50935, 264, 4001, 10200, 3417, 264, 1577, 3464, 295, 264, 2280, 13, 51082], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 464, "seek": 149060, "start": 1505.06, "end": 1505.8, "text": " Oh, that's incredible.", "tokens": [51088, 876, 11, 300, 311, 4651, 13, 51125], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 465, "seek": 149060, "start": 1505.8999999999999, "end": 1510.9399999999998, "text": " It acts as a predictive feedback layer that anticipates deviation and initiates constraint", "tokens": [51130, 467, 10672, 382, 257, 35521, 5824, 4583, 300, 10416, 1024, 25163, 293, 6265, 1024, 25534, 51382], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 466, "seek": 149060, "start": 1510.9399999999998, "end": 1512.86, "text": " projection before the damage is done.", "tokens": [51382, 22743, 949, 264, 4344, 307, 1096, 13, 51478], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 467, "seek": 149060, "start": 1513.04, "end": 1515.2199999999998, "text": " It catches the marble before it rolls off the table.", "tokens": [51487, 467, 25496, 264, 26844, 949, 309, 15767, 766, 264, 3199, 13, 51596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 468, "seek": 149060, "start": 1515.34, "end": 1516.8, "text": " That's a great way to visualize it.", "tokens": [51602, 663, 311, 257, 869, 636, 281, 23273, 309, 13, 51675], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07884125276045366, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809556134186887e-12}, {"id": 469, "seek": 151680, "start": 1516.8, "end": 1521.6, "text": " But if the system is constantly being battered by these cascades, and we're constantly relying", "tokens": [50365, 583, 498, 264, 1185, 307, 6460, 885, 4220, 292, 538, 613, 3058, 66, 2977, 11, 293, 321, 434, 6460, 24140, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 470, "seek": 151680, "start": 1521.6, "end": 1526.84, "text": " on digital twins and constraint projection to save us, how do we choose the safest place", "tokens": [50605, 322, 4562, 22555, 293, 25534, 22743, 281, 3155, 505, 11, 577, 360, 321, 2826, 264, 37558, 1081, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 471, "seek": 151680, "start": 1526.84, "end": 1527.36, "text": " to operate?", "tokens": [50867, 281, 9651, 30, 50893], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 472, "seek": 151680, "start": 1527.62, "end": 1529.06, "text": " Well, that's the geography problem.", "tokens": [50906, 1042, 11, 300, 311, 264, 26695, 1154, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 473, "seek": 151680, "start": 1529.3799999999999, "end": 1529.6599999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50994, 1779, 13, 51008], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 474, "seek": 151680, "start": 1530.18, "end": 1535.9199999999998, "text": " It turns out, just being inside the safe zone, the admissible region, isn't enough.", "tokens": [51034, 467, 4523, 484, 11, 445, 885, 1854, 264, 3273, 6668, 11, 264, 5910, 41073, 4458, 11, 1943, 380, 1547, 13, 51321], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 475, "seek": 151680, "start": 1536.12, "end": 1536.3999999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51331, 1779, 13, 51345], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 476, "seek": 151680, "start": 1536.52, "end": 1538.04, "text": " Not all safety is created equal.", "tokens": [51351, 1726, 439, 4514, 307, 2942, 2681, 13, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 477, "seek": 151680, "start": 1538.34, "end": 1540.36, "text": " We have to talk about the geography of safety.", "tokens": [51442, 492, 362, 281, 751, 466, 264, 26695, 295, 4514, 13, 51543], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 478, "seek": 151680, "start": 1540.36, "end": 1542.82, "text": " We need to define two critical concepts here.", "tokens": [51543, 492, 643, 281, 6964, 732, 4924, 10392, 510, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 479, "seek": 151680, "start": 1543.28, "end": 1545.6, "text": " Constraint projection and attractor basins.", "tokens": [51689, 8574, 424, 686, 22743, 293, 5049, 284, 987, 1292, 13, 51805], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12888950290101947, "compression_ratio": 1.7030716723549488, "no_speech_prob": 1.616915694217791e-12}, {"id": 480, "seek": 154560, "start": 1545.6, "end": 1547.3, "text": " Let's start with constraint projection.", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 722, 365, 25534, 22743, 13, 50450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 481, "seek": 154560, "start": 1547.62, "end": 1553.3799999999999, "text": " Constraint projection is the active, constant, and costly work of pulling the drifting system", "tokens": [50466, 8574, 424, 686, 22743, 307, 264, 4967, 11, 5754, 11, 293, 28328, 589, 295, 8407, 264, 37973, 1185, 50754], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 482, "seek": 154560, "start": 1553.3799999999999, "end": 1554.4199999999998, "text": " back to safety.", "tokens": [50754, 646, 281, 4514, 13, 50806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 483, "seek": 154560, "start": 1554.6, "end": 1555.84, "text": " Like pushing the marble back.", "tokens": [50815, 1743, 7380, 264, 26844, 646, 13, 50877], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 484, "seek": 154560, "start": 1556.0, "end": 1556.34, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50885, 1079, 13, 50902], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 485, "seek": 154560, "start": 1556.76, "end": 1560.3, "text": " It's the control system firing a massive burst of neutral beams.", "tokens": [50923, 467, 311, 264, 1969, 1185, 16045, 257, 5994, 12712, 295, 10598, 31040, 13, 51100], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 486, "seek": 154560, "start": 1560.62, "end": 1562.76, "text": " It's the cooling system ramping up its pumps.", "tokens": [51116, 467, 311, 264, 14785, 1185, 12428, 278, 493, 1080, 27648, 13, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 487, "seek": 154560, "start": 1563.1799999999998, "end": 1566.6799999999998, "text": " It is the literal physical energy you spend to not die.", "tokens": [51244, 467, 307, 264, 20411, 4001, 2281, 291, 3496, 281, 406, 978, 13, 51419], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 488, "seek": 154560, "start": 1566.9599999999998, "end": 1568.1799999999998, "text": " And attractor basins.", "tokens": [51433, 400, 5049, 284, 987, 1292, 13, 51494], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 489, "seek": 154560, "start": 1568.82, "end": 1570.48, "text": " I like to frame this visually for the listener.", "tokens": [51526, 286, 411, 281, 3920, 341, 19622, 337, 264, 31569, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 490, "seek": 154560, "start": 1571.06, "end": 1574.4399999999998, "text": " Imagine the safe zone, the admissible region, as a large table.", "tokens": [51638, 11739, 264, 3273, 6668, 11, 264, 5910, 41073, 4458, 11, 382, 257, 2416, 3199, 13, 51807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 491, "seek": 154560, "start": 1574.58, "end": 1574.8, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51814, 1033, 13, 51825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13516180443041254, "compression_ratio": 1.7048611111111112, "no_speech_prob": 1.5674070114740646e-12}, {"id": 492, "seek": 157480, "start": 1574.8, "end": 1578.1, "text": " If your marble is anywhere on that table, you are technically safe.", "tokens": [50365, 759, 428, 26844, 307, 4992, 322, 300, 3199, 11, 291, 366, 12120, 3273, 13, 50530], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 493, "seek": 157480, "start": 1578.5, "end": 1579.48, "text": " The reactor is operating.", "tokens": [50550, 440, 20628, 307, 7447, 13, 50599], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 494, "seek": 157480, "start": 1579.76, "end": 1581.6399999999999, "text": " But the topography of that table matters.", "tokens": [50613, 583, 264, 1192, 5820, 295, 300, 3199, 7001, 13, 50707], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 495, "seek": 157480, "start": 1581.76, "end": 1582.32, "text": " Very much so.", "tokens": [50713, 4372, 709, 370, 13, 50741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 496, "seek": 157480, "start": 1582.58, "end": 1585.76, "text": " Imagine placing your marble in a deep soup bowl sitting on the table.", "tokens": [50754, 11739, 17221, 428, 26844, 294, 257, 2452, 7884, 6571, 3798, 322, 264, 3199, 13, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 497, "seek": 157480, "start": 1586.08, "end": 1590.6399999999999, "text": " If you bump the table like a physical disturbance in the reactor, the marble rolls up the side", "tokens": [50929, 759, 291, 9961, 264, 3199, 411, 257, 4001, 35684, 294, 264, 20628, 11, 264, 26844, 15767, 493, 264, 1252, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 498, "seek": 157480, "start": 1590.6399999999999, "end": 1593.3999999999999, "text": " of the bowl, but gravity naturally pulls it back to the bottom.", "tokens": [51157, 295, 264, 6571, 11, 457, 12110, 8195, 16982, 309, 646, 281, 264, 2767, 13, 51295], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 499, "seek": 157480, "start": 1593.54, "end": 1595.96, "text": " The system naturally settles back to stability.", "tokens": [51302, 440, 1185, 8195, 5584, 904, 646, 281, 11826, 13, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 500, "seek": 157480, "start": 1596.3799999999999, "end": 1598.8999999999999, "text": " It requires very little active constraint projection.", "tokens": [51444, 467, 7029, 588, 707, 4967, 25534, 22743, 13, 51570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 501, "seek": 157480, "start": 1599.48, "end": 1601.44, "text": " The bowl does the work for you.", "tokens": [51599, 440, 6571, 775, 264, 589, 337, 291, 13, 51697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13483684781997923, "compression_ratio": 1.7902097902097902, "no_speech_prob": 1.2112087591567566e-12}, {"id": 502, "seek": 160144, "start": 1601.44, "end": 1601.92, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 50389], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19539294523351333, "compression_ratio": 1.4104477611940298, "no_speech_prob": 1.4213657377817879e-12}, {"id": 503, "seek": 160144, "start": 1601.92, "end": 1608.22, "text": " Now imagine taking that same marble and putting it on an inverted dinner plate sitting on the table.", "tokens": [50389, 823, 3811, 1940, 300, 912, 26844, 293, 3372, 309, 322, 364, 38969, 6148, 5924, 3798, 322, 264, 3199, 13, 50704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19539294523351333, "compression_ratio": 1.4104477611940298, "no_speech_prob": 1.4213657377817879e-12}, {"id": 504, "seek": 160144, "start": 1608.4, "end": 1609.1000000000001, "text": " Much harder.", "tokens": [50713, 12313, 6081, 13, 50748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19539294523351333, "compression_ratio": 1.4104477611940298, "no_speech_prob": 1.4213657377817879e-12}, {"id": 505, "seek": 160144, "start": 1609.22, "end": 1610.06, "text": " It's still on the table.", "tokens": [50754, 467, 311, 920, 322, 264, 3199, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19539294523351333, "compression_ratio": 1.4104477611940298, "no_speech_prob": 1.4213657377817879e-12}, {"id": 506, "seek": 160144, "start": 1610.28, "end": 1612.04, "text": " Still technically in the admissible region.", "tokens": [50807, 8291, 12120, 294, 264, 5910, 41073, 4458, 13, 50895], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19539294523351333, "compression_ratio": 1.4104477611940298, "no_speech_prob": 1.4213657377817879e-12}, {"id": 507, "seek": 161204, "start": 1612.04, "end": 1620.02, "text": " But a slight breeze, the tiniest disturbance in the plasma, and the marble rolls off the plate and races toward the edge of the table.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 257, 4036, 24532, 11, 264, 256, 3812, 377, 35684, 294, 264, 22564, 11, 293, 264, 26844, 15767, 766, 264, 5924, 293, 15484, 7361, 264, 4691, 295, 264, 3199, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10909306786277077, "compression_ratio": 1.4774193548387098, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071330685192952e-12}, {"id": 508, "seek": 161204, "start": 1620.5, "end": 1625.1399999999999, "text": " You have to constantly frantically poke it with your finger to keep it balanced in the center.", "tokens": [50788, 509, 362, 281, 6460, 431, 49505, 19712, 309, 365, 428, 5984, 281, 1066, 309, 13902, 294, 264, 3056, 13, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10909306786277077, "compression_ratio": 1.4774193548387098, "no_speech_prob": 1.5071330685192952e-12}, {"id": 509, "seek": 162514, "start": 1625.14, "end": 1627.4, "text": " That is a shallow attractor basin.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 257, 20488, 5049, 284, 34863, 13, 50478], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 510, "seek": 162514, "start": 1627.76, "end": 1634.2800000000002, "text": " And here is the deeply painful tradeoff that plasma physicists grapple with every single day.", "tokens": [50496, 400, 510, 307, 264, 8760, 11697, 4923, 4506, 300, 22564, 48716, 27165, 306, 365, 633, 2167, 786, 13, 50822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 511, "seek": 162514, "start": 1634.68, "end": 1636.4, "text": " Basin depth costs performance.", "tokens": [50842, 5859, 259, 7161, 5497, 3389, 13, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 512, "seek": 162514, "start": 1636.7, "end": 1637.5400000000002, "text": " This is the kicker.", "tokens": [50943, 639, 307, 264, 4437, 260, 13, 50985], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 513, "seek": 162514, "start": 1638.0400000000002, "end": 1642.0400000000002, "text": " This is where the viability theory violently clashes with the loss in criteria.", "tokens": [51010, 639, 307, 689, 264, 1932, 2310, 5261, 46728, 596, 12808, 365, 264, 4470, 294, 11101, 13, 51210], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 514, "seek": 162514, "start": 1642.24, "end": 1642.6200000000001, "text": " Completely.", "tokens": [51220, 39978, 13, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 515, "seek": 162514, "start": 1642.8400000000001, "end": 1647.96, "text": " The plasma configurations that yield the absolute highest fusion gain, the ones that break records,", "tokens": [51250, 440, 22564, 31493, 300, 11257, 264, 8236, 6343, 23100, 6052, 11, 264, 2306, 300, 1821, 7724, 11, 51506], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 516, "seek": 162514, "start": 1648.1000000000001, "end": 1654.0800000000002, "text": " the ones that generate the headline-grabbing milestones, they are almost always incredibly shallow basins.", "tokens": [51513, 264, 2306, 300, 8460, 264, 28380, 12, 70, 5305, 4324, 42038, 11, 436, 366, 1920, 1009, 6252, 20488, 987, 1292, 13, 51812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462668010166713, "compression_ratio": 1.6890459363957597, "no_speech_prob": 1.6747600485242375e-12}, {"id": 517, "seek": 165408, "start": 1654.08, "end": 1655.98, "text": " They are the marble balanced on the dinner plate.", "tokens": [50365, 814, 366, 264, 26844, 13902, 322, 264, 6148, 5924, 13, 50460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 518, "seek": 165408, "start": 1656.1399999999999, "end": 1656.4399999999998, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50468, 7587, 13, 50483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 519, "seek": 165408, "start": 1656.6799999999998, "end": 1660.28, "text": " They require enormous amounts of active constraint projection to maintain.", "tokens": [50495, 814, 3651, 11322, 11663, 295, 4967, 25534, 22743, 281, 6909, 13, 50675], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 520, "seek": 165408, "start": 1660.3999999999999, "end": 1661.36, "text": " And the deep bowls.", "tokens": [50681, 400, 264, 2452, 28513, 13, 50729], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 521, "seek": 165408, "start": 1661.74, "end": 1664.1799999999998, "text": " The safest, most resilient configurations.", "tokens": [50748, 440, 37558, 11, 881, 23699, 31493, 13, 50870], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 522, "seek": 165408, "start": 1664.8, "end": 1668.34, "text": " The deep bowls where the plasma naturally wants to stabilize.", "tokens": [50901, 440, 2452, 28513, 689, 264, 22564, 8195, 2738, 281, 31870, 13, 51078], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 523, "seek": 165408, "start": 1669.4199999999998, "end": 1672.02, "text": " They almost always leave power on the table.", "tokens": [51132, 814, 1920, 1009, 1856, 1347, 322, 264, 3199, 13, 51262], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 524, "seek": 165408, "start": 1672.22, "end": 1672.4399999999998, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51272, 3153, 13, 51283], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 525, "seek": 165408, "start": 1672.6399999999999, "end": 1677.24, "text": " Viability theory demands that we accept lower peak performance in exchange for survival.", "tokens": [51293, 6626, 2310, 5261, 15107, 300, 321, 3241, 3126, 10651, 3389, 294, 7742, 337, 12559, 13, 51523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 526, "seek": 165408, "start": 1677.6799999999998, "end": 1683.12, "text": " We have to accept being a little less awesome today so that the machine doesn't tear itself apart tomorrow.", "tokens": [51545, 492, 362, 281, 3241, 885, 257, 707, 1570, 3476, 965, 370, 300, 264, 3479, 1177, 380, 12556, 2564, 4936, 4153, 13, 51817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18860083870265795, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362179623349848e-12}, {"id": 527, "seek": 168312, "start": 1683.12, "end": 1687.4799999999998, "text": " We have to design the Honda Civic, not the Formula One car.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 362, 281, 1715, 264, 26989, 46237, 11, 406, 264, 35872, 1485, 1032, 13, 50583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 528, "seek": 168312, "start": 1687.8, "end": 1695.02, "text": " Because the energy required to constantly frantically poke that marble back to the center of the plate isn't just electrical power.", "tokens": [50599, 1436, 264, 2281, 4739, 281, 6460, 431, 49505, 19712, 300, 26844, 646, 281, 264, 3056, 295, 264, 5924, 1943, 380, 445, 12147, 1347, 13, 50960], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 529, "seek": 168312, "start": 1695.1799999999998, "end": 1695.8, "text": " What else is it?", "tokens": [50968, 708, 1646, 307, 309, 30, 50999], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 530, "seek": 168312, "start": 1695.86, "end": 1698.32, "text": " It is thermodynamic and it is heavily human.", "tokens": [51002, 467, 307, 8810, 34988, 293, 309, 307, 10950, 1952, 13, 51125], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 531, "seek": 168312, "start": 1698.5, "end": 1700.36, "text": " Let's unpack that thermodynamic cost.", "tokens": [51134, 961, 311, 26699, 300, 8810, 34988, 2063, 13, 51227], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 532, "seek": 168312, "start": 1700.4799999999998, "end": 1700.6799999999998, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51233, 865, 13, 51243], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 533, "seek": 168312, "start": 1701.1399999999999, "end": 1704.02, "text": " This brings us to a really fascinating reframing of energy.", "tokens": [51266, 639, 5607, 505, 281, 257, 534, 10343, 1895, 2356, 278, 295, 2281, 13, 51410], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 534, "seek": 168312, "start": 1704.26, "end": 1708.4199999999998, "text": " It's not about net energy like a bank account where you put in 10 megawatts and get out 20.", "tokens": [51422, 467, 311, 406, 466, 2533, 2281, 411, 257, 3765, 2696, 689, 291, 829, 294, 1266, 10816, 38036, 1373, 293, 483, 484, 945, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 535, "seek": 168312, "start": 1708.54, "end": 1708.78, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51636, 1779, 13, 51648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 536, "seek": 168312, "start": 1708.86, "end": 1711.4599999999998, "text": " It's about throughput and managing entropy.", "tokens": [51652, 467, 311, 466, 44629, 293, 11642, 30867, 13, 51782], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11586585299659322, "compression_ratio": 1.597444089456869, "no_speech_prob": 2.1504135278016534e-12}, {"id": 537, "seek": 171146, "start": 1711.46, "end": 1712.8600000000001, "text": " Explain that for the audience.", "tokens": [50365, 39574, 300, 337, 264, 4034, 13, 50435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 538, "seek": 171146, "start": 1713.22, "end": 1719.32, "text": " In physics, the second law of thermodynamics tells us that the universe naturally moves toward degradation, chaos, and disorder.", "tokens": [50453, 682, 10649, 11, 264, 1150, 2101, 295, 8810, 35483, 5112, 505, 300, 264, 6445, 8195, 6067, 7361, 40519, 11, 14158, 11, 293, 13399, 13, 50758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 539, "seek": 171146, "start": 1719.94, "end": 1721.66, "text": " Entropy is a measure of that disorder.", "tokens": [50789, 3951, 27514, 307, 257, 3481, 295, 300, 13399, 13, 50875], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 540, "seek": 171146, "start": 1721.92, "end": 1722.14, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50888, 1033, 13, 50899], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 541, "seek": 171146, "start": 1722.38, "end": 1727.46, "text": " Repair, in a thermodynamic sense, is literally the creation of local negative entropy.", "tokens": [50911, 3696, 1246, 11, 294, 257, 8810, 34988, 2020, 11, 307, 3736, 264, 8016, 295, 2654, 3671, 30867, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 542, "seek": 171146, "start": 1727.8400000000001, "end": 1728.96, "text": " You are restoring order.", "tokens": [51184, 509, 366, 36349, 1668, 13, 51240], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 543, "seek": 171146, "start": 1729.3, "end": 1733.22, "text": " You are taking a degraded crystal lattice and replacing it with a pristine one.", "tokens": [51257, 509, 366, 1940, 257, 24740, 292, 13662, 34011, 293, 19139, 309, 365, 257, 582, 42745, 472, 13, 51453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14274025946548305, "compression_ratio": 1.6431535269709543, "no_speech_prob": 1.720821402040329e-12}, {"id": 544, "seek": 173322, "start": 1733.22, "end": 1733.9, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15703172198796678, "compression_ratio": 1.483695652173913, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404720042298202e-12}, {"id": 545, "seek": 173322, "start": 1734.38, "end": 1740.2, "text": " But you can only create local negative entropy by producing far greater entropy somewhere else.", "tokens": [50423, 583, 291, 393, 787, 1884, 2654, 3671, 30867, 538, 10501, 1400, 5044, 30867, 4079, 1646, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15703172198796678, "compression_ratio": 1.483695652173913, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404720042298202e-12}, {"id": 546, "seek": 173322, "start": 1740.82, "end": 1751.8, "text": " So when the reactor fixes a broken wall or a control system expends power to correct a plasma flutter, it is literally purchasing order by burning energy and materials.", "tokens": [50745, 407, 562, 264, 20628, 32539, 257, 5463, 2929, 420, 257, 1969, 1185, 1278, 2581, 1347, 281, 3006, 257, 22564, 932, 9947, 11, 309, 307, 3736, 20906, 1668, 538, 9488, 2281, 293, 5319, 13, 51294], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15703172198796678, "compression_ratio": 1.483695652173913, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404720042298202e-12}, {"id": 547, "seek": 175180, "start": 1751.8, "end": 1752.48, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50365, 1079, 13, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25216066136079673, "compression_ratio": 1.2758620689655173, "no_speech_prob": 1.299238277727155e-12}, {"id": 548, "seek": 175180, "start": 1753.0, "end": 1759.8999999999999, "text": " Infliction details three distinct types of degradation that must constantly be repaired, constantly purchasing this negative entropy.", "tokens": [50425, 682, 3423, 4105, 4365, 1045, 10644, 3467, 295, 40519, 300, 1633, 6460, 312, 36551, 11, 6460, 20906, 341, 3671, 30867, 13, 50770], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25216066136079673, "compression_ratio": 1.2758620689655173, "no_speech_prob": 1.299238277727155e-12}, {"id": 549, "seek": 175180, "start": 1760.12, "end": 1760.4199999999998, "text": " Are they?", "tokens": [50781, 2014, 436, 30, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25216066136079673, "compression_ratio": 1.2758620689655173, "no_speech_prob": 1.299238277727155e-12}, {"id": 550, "seek": 176042, "start": 1760.42, "end": 1763.5800000000002, "text": " The first is gradual, statistically predictable wear.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 700, 307, 32890, 11, 36478, 27737, 3728, 13, 50523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 551, "seek": 176042, "start": 1763.94, "end": 1765.3000000000002, "text": " This is your schedule maintenance.", "tokens": [50541, 639, 307, 428, 7567, 11258, 13, 50609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 552, "seek": 176042, "start": 1765.64, "end": 1767.3600000000001, "text": " Replacing the first wall every five years.", "tokens": [50626, 47762, 5615, 264, 700, 2929, 633, 1732, 924, 13, 50712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 553, "seek": 176042, "start": 1767.48, "end": 1767.94, "text": " Makes sense.", "tokens": [50718, 25245, 2020, 13, 50741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 554, "seek": 176042, "start": 1768.2, "end": 1769.9, "text": " The second is sudden discrete damage.", "tokens": [50754, 440, 1150, 307, 3990, 27706, 4344, 13, 50839], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 555, "seek": 176042, "start": 1770.26, "end": 1771.16, "text": " Off-normal events.", "tokens": [50857, 6318, 12, 23157, 3931, 13, 50902], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 556, "seek": 176042, "start": 1771.6000000000001, "end": 1774.46, "text": " A sudden plasma disruption that scorches a cooling pipe.", "tokens": [50924, 316, 3990, 22564, 28751, 300, 38629, 3781, 257, 14785, 11240, 13, 51067], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 557, "seek": 176042, "start": 1774.8200000000002, "end": 1777.88, "text": " You can't schedule this, so you repair it by having reserved capacity.", "tokens": [51085, 509, 393, 380, 7567, 341, 11, 370, 291, 10535, 309, 538, 1419, 24819, 6042, 13, 51238], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 558, "seek": 176042, "start": 1778.3600000000001, "end": 1779.48, "text": " Spare parts in a warehouse.", "tokens": [51262, 1738, 543, 3166, 294, 257, 22244, 13, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 559, "seek": 176042, "start": 1780.0, "end": 1781.0800000000002, "text": " Backup cooling loops.", "tokens": [51344, 5833, 1010, 14785, 16121, 13, 51398], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 560, "seek": 176042, "start": 1781.48, "end": 1782.5800000000002, "text": " Technicians on standby.", "tokens": [51418, 8337, 8455, 322, 50170, 13, 51473], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19461584990879274, "compression_ratio": 1.555984555984556, "no_speech_prob": 1.410302647233963e-12}, {"id": 561, "seek": 178258, "start": 1782.58, "end": 1784.76, "text": " And the third type of degradation.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 264, 2636, 2010, 295, 40519, 13, 50474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 562, "seek": 178258, "start": 1785.4399999999998, "end": 1789.9399999999998, "text": " This is the one that really caught my attention because it bridges the gap between physics and sociology.", "tokens": [50508, 639, 307, 264, 472, 300, 534, 5415, 452, 3202, 570, 309, 21114, 264, 7417, 1296, 10649, 293, 41744, 13, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 563, "seek": 178258, "start": 1790.1999999999998, "end": 1790.5, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50746, 1079, 13, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 564, "seek": 178258, "start": 1790.6799999999998, "end": 1792.3799999999999, "text": " Slow institutional degradation.", "tokens": [50770, 17703, 18391, 40519, 13, 50855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 565, "seek": 178258, "start": 1792.58, "end": 1794.32, "text": " The loss of tacit human knowledge.", "tokens": [50865, 440, 4470, 295, 25018, 270, 1952, 3601, 13, 50952], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 566, "seek": 178258, "start": 1794.6399999999999, "end": 1799.1599999999999, "text": " This is where viability theory expands the boundary of the machine once again.", "tokens": [50968, 639, 307, 689, 1932, 2310, 5261, 33706, 264, 12866, 295, 264, 3479, 1564, 797, 13, 51194], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 567, "seek": 178258, "start": 1799.6599999999999, "end": 1804.52, "text": " The human operators are not external observers watching the reactor through a window.", "tokens": [51219, 440, 1952, 19077, 366, 406, 8320, 48090, 1976, 264, 20628, 807, 257, 4910, 13, 51462], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 568, "seek": 178258, "start": 1804.6799999999998, "end": 1805.34, "text": " They are the machine.", "tokens": [51470, 814, 366, 264, 3479, 13, 51503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 569, "seek": 178258, "start": 1805.5, "end": 1809.96, "text": " They are a feedback loop integrated within the reactor, and they have their own admissible region.", "tokens": [51511, 814, 366, 257, 5824, 6367, 10919, 1951, 264, 20628, 11, 293, 436, 362, 641, 1065, 5910, 41073, 4458, 13, 51734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18258408740558454, "compression_ratio": 1.7473684210526317, "no_speech_prob": 1.8111277451729468e-12}, {"id": 570, "seek": 180996, "start": 1809.96, "end": 1814.3400000000001, "text": " We tend to think of the machine purely as the metal, the magnets, and the code.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 3928, 281, 519, 295, 264, 3479, 17491, 382, 264, 5760, 11, 264, 33022, 11, 293, 264, 3089, 13, 50584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 571, "seek": 180996, "start": 1815.44, "end": 1817.06, "text": " But the humans are part of it.", "tokens": [50639, 583, 264, 6255, 366, 644, 295, 309, 13, 50720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 572, "seek": 180996, "start": 1817.66, "end": 1819.76, "text": " Think about the concept of tacit knowledge.", "tokens": [50750, 6557, 466, 264, 3410, 295, 25018, 270, 3601, 13, 50855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 573, "seek": 180996, "start": 1820.44, "end": 1821.9, "text": " It's the unwritten rules.", "tokens": [50889, 467, 311, 264, 517, 26859, 4474, 13, 50962], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 574, "seek": 180996, "start": 1822.02, "end": 1822.54, "text": " The instincts.", "tokens": [50968, 440, 38997, 13, 50994], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 575, "seek": 180996, "start": 1822.8600000000001, "end": 1823.3600000000001, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51010, 7587, 13, 51035], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 576, "seek": 180996, "start": 1823.92, "end": 1827.44, "text": " Imagine you are the veteran operator sitting in that control room.", "tokens": [51063, 11739, 291, 366, 264, 18324, 12973, 3798, 294, 300, 1969, 1808, 13, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 577, "seek": 180996, "start": 1828.68, "end": 1834.8, "text": " You know that when the cryogenic pump makes a specific low-pitched humming sound on a humid Tuesday,", "tokens": [51301, 509, 458, 300, 562, 264, 3305, 25473, 5889, 1669, 257, 2685, 2295, 12, 79, 41328, 34965, 1626, 322, 257, 34649, 10017, 11, 51607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 578, "seek": 180996, "start": 1835.22, "end": 1836.76, "text": " it's going to fail in three days.", "tokens": [51628, 309, 311, 516, 281, 3061, 294, 1045, 1708, 13, 51705], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 579, "seek": 180996, "start": 1837.06, "end": 1837.26, "text": " Yep.", "tokens": [51720, 7010, 13, 51730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19406210857888925, "compression_ratio": 1.5992217898832686, "no_speech_prob": 1.7283393683245607e-12}, {"id": 580, "seek": 183726, "start": 1837.26, "end": 1840.24, "text": " The digital sensors say everything is perfectly green.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 4562, 14840, 584, 1203, 307, 6239, 3092, 13, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 581, "seek": 183726, "start": 1840.66, "end": 1844.64, "text": " The manual doesn't mention the humming sound, but you feel it in the floorboards.", "tokens": [50535, 440, 9688, 1177, 380, 2152, 264, 34965, 1626, 11, 457, 291, 841, 309, 294, 264, 4123, 17228, 13, 50734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 582, "seek": 183726, "start": 1845.12, "end": 1849.34, "text": " That operator's instinct is a vital constraint projection mechanism.", "tokens": [50758, 663, 12973, 311, 16556, 307, 257, 11707, 25534, 22743, 7513, 13, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 583, "seek": 183726, "start": 1849.76, "end": 1854.0, "text": " And what happens when that experienced crew retires, or when they quit because of a budget cut?", "tokens": [50990, 400, 437, 2314, 562, 300, 6751, 7260, 1533, 3145, 11, 420, 562, 436, 10366, 570, 295, 257, 4706, 1723, 30, 51202], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 584, "seek": 183726, "start": 1854.3, "end": 1855.16, "text": " The machine degrades.", "tokens": [51217, 440, 3479, 368, 22626, 13, 51260], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 585, "seek": 183726, "start": 1855.56, "end": 1860.5, "text": " If a plant loses its veteran operators, its physical repair capability is suddenly rendered useless", "tokens": [51280, 759, 257, 3709, 18293, 1080, 18324, 19077, 11, 1080, 4001, 10535, 13759, 307, 5800, 28748, 14115, 51527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 586, "seek": 183726, "start": 1860.5, "end": 1863.28, "text": " because the new crew won't recognize when to deploy it.", "tokens": [51527, 570, 264, 777, 7260, 1582, 380, 5521, 562, 281, 7274, 309, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 587, "seek": 183726, "start": 1863.4, "end": 1864.84, "text": " They'll just wait for the light to turn red.", "tokens": [51672, 814, 603, 445, 1699, 337, 264, 1442, 281, 1261, 2182, 13, 51744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12146799564361573, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.289318912051085e-12}, {"id": 588, "seek": 186484, "start": 1864.84, "end": 1868.76, "text": " They will look at the manual, see that the sensor is green, ignore the humming sound,", "tokens": [50365, 814, 486, 574, 412, 264, 9688, 11, 536, 300, 264, 10200, 307, 3092, 11, 11200, 264, 34965, 1626, 11, 50561], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 589, "seek": 186484, "start": 1868.86, "end": 1870.9599999999998, "text": " and let the pump fail, triggering a cascade.", "tokens": [50566, 293, 718, 264, 5889, 3061, 11, 40406, 257, 50080, 13, 50671], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 590, "seek": 186484, "start": 1871.3799999999999, "end": 1871.6599999999999, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [50692, 3153, 13, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 591, "seek": 186484, "start": 1871.82, "end": 1874.4599999999998, "text": " This institutional decay is completely invisible.", "tokens": [50714, 639, 18391, 21039, 307, 2584, 14603, 13, 50846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 592, "seek": 186484, "start": 1875.04, "end": 1876.98, "text": " It doesn't show up on a radiation monitor.", "tokens": [50875, 467, 1177, 380, 855, 493, 322, 257, 12420, 6002, 13, 50972], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 593, "seek": 186484, "start": 1877.3799999999999, "end": 1881.8, "text": " But the loss of tacit knowledge is just as lethal to the reactor's long-term viability", "tokens": [50992, 583, 264, 4470, 295, 25018, 270, 3601, 307, 445, 382, 34562, 281, 264, 20628, 311, 938, 12, 7039, 1932, 2310, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 594, "seek": 186484, "start": 1881.8, "end": 1884.82, "text": " as neutron radiation embrittling the steel.", "tokens": [51213, 382, 44362, 12420, 9392, 593, 1688, 264, 8269, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355415262201781, "compression_ratio": 1.5407725321888412, "no_speech_prob": 1.7013906559656955e-12}, {"id": 595, "seek": 188482, "start": 1884.82, "end": 1889.82, "text": " And once we recognize that the human operators are literally a structural component of the machine,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 1564, 321, 5521, 300, 264, 1952, 19077, 366, 3736, 257, 15067, 6542, 295, 264, 3479, 11, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 596, "seek": 188482, "start": 1890.1, "end": 1891.46, "text": " we can't stop there.", "tokens": [50629, 321, 393, 380, 1590, 456, 13, 50697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 597, "seek": 188482, "start": 1891.96, "end": 1896.7, "text": " The boundary of the reactor keeps moving outward, rippling into the larger world.", "tokens": [50722, 440, 12866, 295, 264, 20628, 5965, 2684, 26914, 11, 367, 2488, 1688, 666, 264, 4833, 1002, 13, 50959], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 598, "seek": 188482, "start": 1896.78, "end": 1898.08, "text": " The macro ecosystem.", "tokens": [50963, 440, 18887, 11311, 13, 51028], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 599, "seek": 188482, "start": 1898.28, "end": 1898.6, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51038, 1079, 13, 51054], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 600, "seek": 188482, "start": 1899.1399999999999, "end": 1904.26, "text": " We have to look at the systems the reactor relies on, but inherently does not control.", "tokens": [51081, 492, 362, 281, 574, 412, 264, 3652, 264, 20628, 30910, 322, 11, 457, 27993, 775, 406, 1969, 13, 51337], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 601, "seek": 188482, "start": 1904.3999999999999, "end": 1909.7, "text": " Supply chains, the electrical grid, macroeconomics, regulators, and public trust.", "tokens": [51344, 9391, 356, 12626, 11, 264, 12147, 10748, 11, 18887, 68, 2291, 1167, 11, 37311, 11, 293, 1908, 3361, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1621168695314966, "compression_ratio": 1.588, "no_speech_prob": 1.5005246394375615e-12}, {"id": 602, "seek": 190970, "start": 1909.7, "end": 1911.64, "text": " Let's start with supply chains.", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 722, 365, 5847, 12626, 13, 50462], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 603, "seek": 190970, "start": 1912.06, "end": 1914.28, "text": " We saw this in the global tech industry years ago.", "tokens": [50483, 492, 1866, 341, 294, 264, 4338, 7553, 3518, 924, 2057, 13, 50594], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 604, "seek": 190970, "start": 1915.18, "end": 1920.04, "text": " In 2011, massive floods in Thailand wiped out a few highly specialized factories,", "tokens": [50639, 682, 10154, 11, 5994, 35536, 294, 19434, 26879, 484, 257, 1326, 5405, 19813, 24813, 11, 50882], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 605, "seek": 190970, "start": 1920.38, "end": 1924.98, "text": " and suddenly the global supply of computer hard drives was crippled for months.", "tokens": [50899, 293, 5800, 264, 4338, 5847, 295, 3820, 1152, 11754, 390, 37667, 1493, 337, 2493, 13, 51129], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 606, "seek": 190970, "start": 1925.22, "end": 1925.92, "text": " A perfect example.", "tokens": [51141, 316, 2176, 1365, 13, 51176], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 607, "seek": 190970, "start": 1926.16, "end": 1927.38, "text": " Now, apply that to fusion.", "tokens": [51188, 823, 11, 3079, 300, 281, 23100, 13, 51249], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 608, "seek": 190970, "start": 1928.1200000000001, "end": 1931.98, "text": " If you need a highly specialized superconducting tape for your magnets,", "tokens": [51286, 759, 291, 643, 257, 5405, 19813, 1687, 38150, 278, 7314, 337, 428, 33022, 11, 51479], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 609, "seek": 190970, "start": 1932.3400000000001, "end": 1935.46, "text": " and there's only one factory in the world that knows how to make it.", "tokens": [51497, 293, 456, 311, 787, 472, 9265, 294, 264, 1002, 300, 3255, 577, 281, 652, 309, 13, 51653], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 610, "seek": 190970, "start": 1935.72, "end": 1938.94, "text": " You are operating in an incredibly shallow basin.", "tokens": [51666, 509, 366, 7447, 294, 364, 6252, 20488, 34863, 13, 51827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17773474677134368, "compression_ratio": 1.6195286195286196, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735402347435978e-12}, {"id": 611, "seek": 193894, "start": 1938.94, "end": 1943.42, "text": " If that single manufacturer goes bankrupt, or if they experience a fire,", "tokens": [50365, 759, 300, 2167, 18022, 1709, 21780, 11, 420, 498, 436, 1752, 257, 2610, 11, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 612, "seek": 193894, "start": 1943.66, "end": 1947.88, "text": " or if they just lose their own tacit knowledge, your reactor dies.", "tokens": [50601, 420, 498, 436, 445, 3624, 641, 1065, 25018, 270, 3601, 11, 428, 20628, 2714, 13, 50812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 613, "seek": 193894, "start": 1947.92, "end": 1950.14, "text": " So you cannot project constraint without parts.", "tokens": [50814, 407, 291, 2644, 1716, 25534, 1553, 3166, 13, 50925], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 614, "seek": 193894, "start": 1950.26, "end": 1950.6000000000001, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50931, 7587, 13, 50948], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 615, "seek": 193894, "start": 1951.38, "end": 1956.74, "text": " A diversified, robust supply chain is the external equivalent of a deep attractor basin.", "tokens": [50987, 316, 6111, 2587, 11, 13956, 5847, 5021, 307, 264, 8320, 10344, 295, 257, 2452, 5049, 284, 34863, 13, 51255], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 616, "seek": 193894, "start": 1956.8600000000001, "end": 1957.54, "text": " And economics.", "tokens": [51261, 400, 14564, 13, 51295], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 617, "seek": 193894, "start": 1958.18, "end": 1959.92, "text": " Money is an admissibility condition.", "tokens": [51327, 16631, 307, 364, 5910, 891, 2841, 4188, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 618, "seek": 193894, "start": 1960.1200000000001, "end": 1962.7, "text": " We don't usually think of dollars as a law of physics,", "tokens": [51424, 492, 500, 380, 2673, 519, 295, 3808, 382, 257, 2101, 295, 10649, 11, 51553], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 619, "seek": 193894, "start": 1962.94, "end": 1965.16, "text": " but in viability theory, they absolutely are.", "tokens": [51565, 457, 294, 1932, 2310, 5261, 11, 436, 3122, 366, 13, 51676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11259362504288957, "compression_ratio": 1.547703180212014, "no_speech_prob": 1.5251294151197303e-12}, {"id": 620, "seek": 196516, "start": 1965.16, "end": 1970.2, "text": " Money is the abstract constraint that allows you to purchase all that local negative entropy.", "tokens": [50365, 16631, 307, 264, 12649, 25534, 300, 4045, 291, 281, 8110, 439, 300, 2654, 3671, 30867, 13, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 621, "seek": 196516, "start": 1970.5800000000002, "end": 1973.72, "text": " Financial reserves are the economic equivalent of an attractor basin.", "tokens": [50636, 25560, 27483, 366, 264, 4836, 10344, 295, 364, 5049, 284, 34863, 13, 50793], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 622, "seek": 196516, "start": 1973.88, "end": 1975.38, "text": " So if you have cash, you can survive.", "tokens": [50801, 407, 498, 291, 362, 6388, 11, 291, 393, 7867, 13, 50876], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 623, "seek": 196516, "start": 1975.5800000000002, "end": 1977.1000000000001, "text": " If you have deep financial reserves,", "tokens": [50886, 759, 291, 362, 2452, 4669, 27483, 11, 50962], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 624, "seek": 196516, "start": 1977.3200000000002, "end": 1981.68, "text": " you can weather an unexpected six-month shutdown to replace a degraded breeding blanket.", "tokens": [50973, 291, 393, 5503, 364, 13106, 2309, 12, 23534, 34927, 281, 7406, 257, 24740, 292, 26051, 17907, 13, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 625, "seek": 196516, "start": 1982.2, "end": 1983.4, "text": " If you have no reserves,", "tokens": [51217, 759, 291, 362, 572, 27483, 11, 51277], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 626, "seek": 196516, "start": 1983.5600000000002, "end": 1986.6200000000001, "text": " if you are operating on a razor-thin margin to appease investors,", "tokens": [51285, 498, 291, 366, 7447, 322, 257, 30478, 12, 392, 259, 10270, 281, 2363, 651, 11519, 11, 51438], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 627, "seek": 196516, "start": 1986.94, "end": 1992.2, "text": " that exact same shutdown becomes a fatal failure cascade for the entire organization.", "tokens": [51454, 300, 1900, 912, 34927, 3643, 257, 24069, 7763, 50080, 337, 264, 2302, 4475, 13, 51717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14188444203343883, "compression_ratio": 1.7379310344827585, "no_speech_prob": 1.9432734501417803e-12}, {"id": 628, "seek": 199220, "start": 1992.2, "end": 1993.68, "text": " And the grid itself.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 264, 10748, 2564, 13, 50439], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 629, "seek": 199220, "start": 1994.3, "end": 1996.0800000000002, "text": " The relationship is bidirectional.", "tokens": [50470, 440, 2480, 307, 12957, 621, 41048, 13, 50559], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 630, "seek": 199220, "start": 1996.8, "end": 2001.56, "text": " Yes, the grid has to be robust enough to absorb the gigawatts of power the fusion plant produces.", "tokens": [50595, 1079, 11, 264, 10748, 575, 281, 312, 13956, 1547, 281, 15631, 264, 8741, 38036, 1373, 295, 1347, 264, 23100, 3709, 14725, 13, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 631, "seek": 199220, "start": 2002.1000000000001, "end": 2007.74, "text": " But the grid also has to supply massive amounts of power to start the reactor in the first place.", "tokens": [50860, 583, 264, 10748, 611, 575, 281, 5847, 5994, 11663, 295, 1347, 281, 722, 264, 20628, 294, 264, 700, 1081, 13, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 632, "seek": 199220, "start": 2007.8600000000001, "end": 2008.0800000000002, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51148, 1779, 13, 51159], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 633, "seek": 199220, "start": 2008.28, "end": 2012.8400000000001, "text": " Firing up those neutral beams and spinning up the cryoplants takes incredible energy.", "tokens": [51169, 479, 5057, 493, 729, 10598, 31040, 293, 15640, 493, 264, 3305, 33224, 1719, 2516, 4651, 2281, 13, 51397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 634, "seek": 199220, "start": 2013.18, "end": 2017.6200000000001, "text": " If the local grid stutters or browns out during a delicate startup sequence,", "tokens": [51414, 759, 264, 2654, 10748, 342, 325, 1559, 420, 6292, 82, 484, 1830, 257, 21417, 18578, 8310, 11, 51636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 635, "seek": 199220, "start": 2017.82, "end": 2020.44, "text": " it can severely stress the reactor's systems.", "tokens": [51646, 309, 393, 26271, 4244, 264, 20628, 311, 3652, 13, 51777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14906428410456732, "compression_ratio": 1.6920289855072463, "no_speech_prob": 1.7419004606777921e-12}, {"id": 636, "seek": 202044, "start": 2020.44, "end": 2025.48, "text": " Which brings us to the most intangible but perhaps most powerful external constraint of all,", "tokens": [50365, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 264, 881, 560, 656, 964, 457, 4317, 881, 4005, 8320, 25534, 295, 439, 11, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 637, "seek": 202044, "start": 2025.88, "end": 2026.54, "text": " public trust.", "tokens": [50637, 1908, 3361, 13, 50670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 638, "seek": 202044, "start": 2027.02, "end": 2027.96, "text": " This blew my mind.", "tokens": [50694, 639, 19075, 452, 1575, 13, 50741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 639, "seek": 202044, "start": 2028.3200000000002, "end": 2031.38, "text": " So what does this all mean for how the public views fusion?", "tokens": [50759, 407, 437, 775, 341, 439, 914, 337, 577, 264, 1908, 6809, 23100, 30, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 640, "seek": 202044, "start": 2032.44, "end": 2035.16, "text": " If we are judging the strict viability of a machine,", "tokens": [50965, 759, 321, 366, 23587, 264, 10910, 1932, 2310, 295, 257, 3479, 11, 51101], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 641, "seek": 202044, "start": 2036.0, "end": 2039.92, "text": " doesn't PR public relations actually become a literal engineering constraint?", "tokens": [51143, 1177, 380, 11568, 1908, 2299, 767, 1813, 257, 20411, 7043, 25534, 30, 51339], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 642, "seek": 202044, "start": 2040.18, "end": 2041.14, "text": " It absolutely does.", "tokens": [51352, 467, 3122, 775, 13, 51400], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 643, "seek": 202044, "start": 2041.28, "end": 2043.8200000000002, "text": " Public trust is a field, much like a magnetic field.", "tokens": [51407, 9489, 3361, 307, 257, 2519, 11, 709, 411, 257, 12688, 2519, 13, 51534], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 644, "seek": 202044, "start": 2044.14, "end": 2047.02, "text": " It is not just a ledger for one specific facility.", "tokens": [51550, 467, 307, 406, 445, 257, 4684, 1321, 337, 472, 2685, 8973, 13, 51694], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 645, "seek": 202044, "start": 2047.18, "end": 2047.38, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51702, 1779, 13, 51712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14109037648076597, "compression_ratio": 1.6254545454545455, "no_speech_prob": 1.905636672766553e-12}, {"id": 646, "seek": 204738, "start": 2047.38, "end": 2053.0, "text": " A nuclear incident or a major toxic spill at an entirely different facility on the other side of the globe", "tokens": [50365, 316, 8179, 9348, 420, 257, 2563, 12786, 22044, 412, 364, 7696, 819, 8973, 322, 264, 661, 1252, 295, 264, 15371, 50646], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13646326869367117, "compression_ratio": 1.5934959349593496, "no_speech_prob": 2.280714029093134e-12}, {"id": 647, "seek": 204738, "start": 2053.0, "end": 2056.84, "text": " instantly changes the political viability of a fusion plant in your hometown.", "tokens": [50646, 13518, 2962, 264, 3905, 1932, 2310, 295, 257, 23100, 3709, 294, 428, 22112, 13, 50838], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13646326869367117, "compression_ratio": 1.5934959349593496, "no_speech_prob": 2.280714029093134e-12}, {"id": 648, "seek": 204738, "start": 2057.1800000000003, "end": 2062.06, "text": " Because the general public doesn't always distinguish between different types of advanced technology.", "tokens": [50855, 1436, 264, 2674, 1908, 1177, 380, 1009, 20206, 1296, 819, 3467, 295, 7339, 2899, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13646326869367117, "compression_ratio": 1.5934959349593496, "no_speech_prob": 2.280714029093134e-12}, {"id": 649, "seek": 204738, "start": 2062.6400000000003, "end": 2064.46, "text": " Nuclear is just nuclear to a lot of people.", "tokens": [51128, 42528, 307, 445, 8179, 281, 257, 688, 295, 561, 13, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13646326869367117, "compression_ratio": 1.5934959349593496, "no_speech_prob": 2.280714029093134e-12}, {"id": 650, "seek": 204738, "start": 2064.6400000000003, "end": 2065.1800000000003, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51228, 7587, 13, 51255], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13646326869367117, "compression_ratio": 1.5934959349593496, "no_speech_prob": 2.280714029093134e-12}, {"id": 651, "seek": 204738, "start": 2065.82, "end": 2068.78, "text": " And regulators respond directly to public sentiment.", "tokens": [51287, 400, 37311, 4196, 3838, 281, 1908, 16149, 13, 51435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13646326869367117, "compression_ratio": 1.5934959349593496, "no_speech_prob": 2.280714029093134e-12}, {"id": 652, "seek": 206878, "start": 2068.78, "end": 2072.78, "text": " If public trust drops, regulators might impose tighter safety restrictions.", "tokens": [50365, 759, 1908, 3361, 11438, 11, 37311, 1062, 26952, 30443, 4514, 14191, 13, 50565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16263727914719356, "compression_ratio": 1.702127659574468, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640636006057e-12}, {"id": 653, "seek": 206878, "start": 2073.5400000000004, "end": 2075.1200000000003, "text": " Which means longer licensing times.", "tokens": [50603, 3013, 1355, 2854, 29759, 1413, 13, 50682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16263727914719356, "compression_ratio": 1.702127659574468, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640636006057e-12}, {"id": 654, "seek": 206878, "start": 2075.4, "end": 2078.5600000000004, "text": " Which forces the plant to spend more money on compliance.", "tokens": [50696, 3013, 5874, 264, 3709, 281, 3496, 544, 1460, 322, 15882, 13, 50854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16263727914719356, "compression_ratio": 1.702127659574468, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640636006057e-12}, {"id": 655, "seek": 206878, "start": 2079.02, "end": 2081.34, "text": " Which squeezes the financial basin.", "tokens": [50877, 3013, 22390, 279, 264, 4669, 34863, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16263727914719356, "compression_ratio": 1.702127659574468, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640636006057e-12}, {"id": 656, "seek": 206878, "start": 2082.0600000000004, "end": 2087.2000000000003, "text": " Which ultimately starves the plant of the operating cash it needs to perform physical maintenance.", "tokens": [51029, 3013, 6284, 3543, 977, 264, 3709, 295, 264, 7447, 6388, 309, 2203, 281, 2042, 4001, 11258, 13, 51286], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16263727914719356, "compression_ratio": 1.702127659574468, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640636006057e-12}, {"id": 657, "seek": 206878, "start": 2087.6200000000003, "end": 2093.4, "text": " So a change in public mood literally accelerates the physical degradation of the reactor walls.", "tokens": [51307, 407, 257, 1319, 294, 1908, 9268, 3736, 10172, 1024, 264, 4001, 40519, 295, 264, 20628, 7920, 13, 51596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16263727914719356, "compression_ratio": 1.702127659574468, "no_speech_prob": 1.839640636006057e-12}, {"id": 658, "seek": 209340, "start": 2093.4, "end": 2094.6600000000003, "text": " It is entirely connected.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 307, 7696, 4582, 13, 50428], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 659, "seek": 209340, "start": 2095.02, "end": 2096.2400000000002, "text": " And it works in reverse, too.", "tokens": [50446, 400, 309, 1985, 294, 9943, 11, 886, 13, 50507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 660, "seek": 209340, "start": 2096.92, "end": 2100.78, "text": " Over-promising timelines today drains the public trust basin for tomorrow.", "tokens": [50541, 4886, 12, 28722, 3436, 45886, 965, 47694, 264, 1908, 3361, 34863, 337, 4153, 13, 50734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 661, "seek": 209340, "start": 2101.1, "end": 2104.6800000000003, "text": " Oh, like when a startup promises commercial electricity in five years.", "tokens": [50750, 876, 11, 411, 562, 257, 18578, 16403, 6841, 10356, 294, 1732, 924, 13, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 662, "seek": 209340, "start": 2104.78, "end": 2105.02, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50934, 1779, 13, 50946], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 663, "seek": 209340, "start": 2105.38, "end": 2109.86, "text": " When a fusion startup issues a press release promising the moon and they inevitably fail to deliver,", "tokens": [50964, 1133, 257, 23100, 18578, 2663, 257, 1886, 4374, 20257, 264, 7135, 293, 436, 28171, 3061, 281, 4239, 11, 51188], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 664, "seek": 209340, "start": 2110.2400000000002, "end": 2113.9, "text": " they aren't just missing a deadline, they are draining the trust basin.", "tokens": [51207, 436, 3212, 380, 445, 5361, 257, 20615, 11, 436, 366, 42916, 264, 3361, 34863, 13, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 665, "seek": 209340, "start": 2113.94, "end": 2114.8, "text": " Which hurts them later.", "tokens": [51392, 3013, 11051, 552, 1780, 13, 51435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16584119991380342, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 3.546170085008682e-12}, {"id": 666, "seek": 211480, "start": 2114.8, "end": 2120.2400000000002, "text": " This leaves the technology incredibly vulnerable when it actually does deploy a decade later.", "tokens": [50365, 639, 5510, 264, 2899, 6252, 10955, 562, 309, 767, 775, 7274, 257, 10378, 1780, 13, 50637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 667, "seek": 211480, "start": 2120.7000000000003, "end": 2126.48, "text": " Because the accumulated societal credibility required to weather the early inevitable operational hiccups", "tokens": [50660, 1436, 264, 31346, 33472, 28852, 4739, 281, 5503, 264, 2440, 21451, 16607, 23697, 66, 7528, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 668, "seek": 211480, "start": 2126.48, "end": 2128.42, "text": " simply isn't there anymore.", "tokens": [50949, 2935, 1943, 380, 456, 3602, 13, 51046], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 669, "seek": 211480, "start": 2128.5, "end": 2131.44, "text": " Looking at this massive intertwined web array.", "tokens": [51050, 11053, 412, 341, 5994, 44400, 2001, 3670, 10225, 13, 51197], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 670, "seek": 211480, "start": 2132.32, "end": 2133.9, "text": " The quantum mechanics of the plasma.", "tokens": [51241, 440, 13018, 12939, 295, 264, 22564, 13, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 671, "seek": 211480, "start": 2134.52, "end": 2136.26, "text": " The atomic degradation of the walls.", "tokens": [51351, 440, 22275, 40519, 295, 264, 7920, 13, 51438], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 672, "seek": 211480, "start": 2136.7000000000003, "end": 2138.5800000000004, "text": " The tacit knowledge of the human operators.", "tokens": [51460, 440, 25018, 270, 3601, 295, 264, 1952, 19077, 13, 51554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 673, "seek": 211480, "start": 2139.1000000000004, "end": 2140.82, "text": " The fragility of the supply chain.", "tokens": [51580, 440, 9241, 1140, 295, 264, 5847, 5021, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 674, "seek": 211480, "start": 2140.92, "end": 2141.92, "text": " The flow of capital.", "tokens": [51671, 440, 3095, 295, 4238, 13, 51721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 675, "seek": 211480, "start": 2141.92, "end": 2144.42, "text": " And the shifting winds of public trust.", "tokens": [51721, 400, 264, 17573, 17765, 295, 1908, 3361, 13, 51846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16741931221701883, "compression_ratio": 1.6827586206896552, "no_speech_prob": 2.2807951274156357e-12}, {"id": 676, "seek": 214480, "start": 2144.8, "end": 2150.1400000000003, "text": " We arrive at the final, mind-bending, philosophical conclusion of Flixian's work.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 8881, 412, 264, 2572, 11, 1575, 12, 65, 2029, 11, 25066, 10063, 295, 3235, 970, 952, 311, 589, 13, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 677, "seek": 214480, "start": 2150.5, "end": 2153.9, "text": " The physics of viability and the concept of identity without matter.", "tokens": [50650, 440, 10649, 295, 1932, 2310, 293, 264, 3410, 295, 6575, 1553, 1871, 13, 50820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 678, "seek": 214480, "start": 2154.04, "end": 2155.2000000000003, "text": " The theory scales up, right?", "tokens": [50827, 440, 5261, 17408, 493, 11, 558, 30, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 679, "seek": 214480, "start": 2155.42, "end": 2156.0600000000004, "text": " It does.", "tokens": [50896, 467, 775, 13, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 680, "seek": 214480, "start": 2156.1400000000003, "end": 2161.94, "text": " Because fusion is just one mechanism among many in the universe used to sustain organizational coherence", "tokens": [50932, 1436, 23100, 307, 445, 472, 7513, 3654, 867, 294, 264, 6445, 1143, 281, 6769, 24730, 26528, 655, 51222], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 681, "seek": 214480, "start": 2161.94, "end": 2165.1600000000003, "text": " against the relentless drag of the second law of thermodynamics.", "tokens": [51222, 1970, 264, 46136, 5286, 295, 264, 1150, 2101, 295, 8810, 35483, 13, 51383], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 682, "seek": 214480, "start": 2165.88, "end": 2168.36, "text": " Think about identity across continuous replacement.", "tokens": [51419, 6557, 466, 6575, 2108, 10957, 14419, 13, 51543], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1447641975001285, "compression_ratio": 1.553030303030303, "no_speech_prob": 1.973819762149387e-12}, {"id": 683, "seek": 216836, "start": 2168.36, "end": 2174.3, "text": " We established earlier that over a 30-year lifespan, because of that brutal neutron damage and", "tokens": [50365, 492, 7545, 3071, 300, 670, 257, 2217, 12, 5294, 40361, 11, 570, 295, 300, 17878, 44362, 4344, 293, 50662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11207008361816406, "compression_ratio": 1.5192307692307692, "no_speech_prob": 1.98137274816379e-12}, {"id": 684, "seek": 216836, "start": 2174.3, "end": 2178.1400000000003, "text": " thermodynamic wear, nearly every physical part of the reactor will be replaced.", "tokens": [50662, 8810, 34988, 3728, 11, 6217, 633, 4001, 644, 295, 264, 20628, 486, 312, 10772, 13, 50854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11207008361816406, "compression_ratio": 1.5192307692307692, "no_speech_prob": 1.98137274816379e-12}, {"id": 685, "seek": 216836, "start": 2178.1400000000003, "end": 2181.8, "text": " The walls, the sensors, the cooling loops, perhaps even the magnets.", "tokens": [50854, 440, 7920, 11, 264, 14840, 11, 264, 14785, 16121, 11, 4317, 754, 264, 33022, 13, 51037], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11207008361816406, "compression_ratio": 1.5192307692307692, "no_speech_prob": 1.98137274816379e-12}, {"id": 686, "seek": 216836, "start": 2182.1400000000003, "end": 2185.88, "text": " Over enough time, not a single atom of the original machine will remain.", "tokens": [51054, 4886, 1547, 565, 11, 406, 257, 2167, 12018, 295, 264, 3380, 3479, 486, 6222, 13, 51241], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11207008361816406, "compression_ratio": 1.5192307692307692, "no_speech_prob": 1.98137274816379e-12}, {"id": 687, "seek": 218588, "start": 2185.88, "end": 2188.1, "text": " So, it's the same reactor.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 11, 309, 311, 264, 912, 20628, 13, 50476], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 688, "seek": 218588, "start": 2188.38, "end": 2193.6, "text": " It is the classic philosophical problem of the ship of Theseus, mapped onto advanced nuclear", "tokens": [50490, 467, 307, 264, 7230, 25066, 1154, 295, 264, 5374, 295, 1981, 301, 11, 33318, 3911, 7339, 8179, 50751], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 689, "seek": 218588, "start": 2193.6, "end": 2194.1, "text": " engineering.", "tokens": [50751, 7043, 13, 50776], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 690, "seek": 218588, "start": 2194.26, "end": 2194.82, "text": " I love this.", "tokens": [50784, 286, 959, 341, 13, 50812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 691, "seek": 218588, "start": 2195.08, "end": 2199.48, "text": " For those listening who might not be familiar, the ship of Theseus is an ancient thought experiment.", "tokens": [50825, 1171, 729, 4764, 567, 1062, 406, 312, 4963, 11, 264, 5374, 295, 1981, 301, 307, 364, 7832, 1194, 5120, 13, 51045], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 692, "seek": 218588, "start": 2200.1800000000003, "end": 2201.0, "text": " It goes like this.", "tokens": [51080, 467, 1709, 411, 341, 13, 51121], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 693, "seek": 218588, "start": 2201.4, "end": 2207.2200000000003, "text": " If you have a famous wooden ship, and over the years, as it sails, you replace every single", "tokens": [51141, 759, 291, 362, 257, 4618, 14744, 5374, 11, 293, 670, 264, 924, 11, 382, 309, 601, 4174, 11, 291, 7406, 633, 2167, 51432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16773286778876123, "compression_ratio": 1.5866666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9891191558457644e-12}, {"id": 694, "seek": 220722, "start": 2207.22, "end": 2212.7, "text": " rotting board with a new piece of wood, until absolutely no original wood remains, is it", "tokens": [50365, 4297, 783, 3150, 365, 257, 777, 2522, 295, 4576, 11, 1826, 3122, 572, 3380, 4576, 7023, 11, 307, 309, 50639], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 695, "seek": 220722, "start": 2212.7, "end": 2214.2999999999997, "text": " still the ship of Theseus?", "tokens": [50639, 920, 264, 5374, 295, 1981, 301, 30, 50719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 696, "seek": 220722, "start": 2214.48, "end": 2215.66, "text": " And Flickshane argues yes.", "tokens": [50728, 400, 3235, 618, 2716, 1929, 38218, 2086, 13, 50787], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 697, "seek": 220722, "start": 2216.7599999999998, "end": 2217.58, "text": " Resoundingly yes.", "tokens": [50842, 5015, 554, 12163, 2086, 13, 50883], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 698, "seek": 220722, "start": 2217.74, "end": 2217.9199999999996, "text": " Why?", "tokens": [50891, 1545, 30, 50900], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 699, "seek": 220722, "start": 2218.18, "end": 2221.8999999999996, "text": " Because the identity of the reactor, or the ship, doesn't live in the atoms.", "tokens": [50913, 1436, 264, 6575, 295, 264, 20628, 11, 420, 264, 5374, 11, 1177, 380, 1621, 294, 264, 16871, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 700, "seek": 220722, "start": 2222.0, "end": 2224.3999999999996, "text": " It doesn't live in the steel, or the lithium, or the copper.", "tokens": [51104, 467, 1177, 380, 1621, 294, 264, 8269, 11, 420, 264, 32180, 11, 420, 264, 15007, 13, 51224], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 701, "seek": 220722, "start": 2224.54, "end": 2226.3599999999997, "text": " It lives in the maintained pattern.", "tokens": [51231, 467, 2909, 294, 264, 17578, 5102, 13, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 702, "seek": 220722, "start": 2226.3599999999997, "end": 2229.72, "text": " It is the continuous conservation of organization.", "tokens": [51322, 467, 307, 264, 10957, 16185, 295, 4475, 13, 51490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 703, "seek": 220722, "start": 2230.3199999999997, "end": 2232.2599999999998, "text": " Energy is conserved automatically by the universe.", "tokens": [51520, 14939, 307, 1014, 6913, 6772, 538, 264, 6445, 13, 51617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 704, "seek": 220722, "start": 2232.4199999999996, "end": 2233.7799999999997, "text": " You can't create or destroy it.", "tokens": [51625, 509, 393, 380, 1884, 420, 5293, 309, 13, 51693], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18234826590268666, "compression_ratio": 1.6832740213523132, "no_speech_prob": 1.5252648319710738e-12}, {"id": 705, "seek": 223378, "start": 2233.78, "end": 2238.82, "text": " But organizational coherence, the specific pattern that makes a reactor a reactor, or", "tokens": [50365, 583, 24730, 26528, 655, 11, 264, 2685, 5102, 300, 1669, 257, 20628, 257, 20628, 11, 420, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 706, "seek": 223378, "start": 2238.82, "end": 2240.82, "text": " a ship, a ship, is fragile.", "tokens": [50617, 257, 5374, 11, 257, 5374, 11, 307, 23847, 13, 50717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 707, "seek": 223378, "start": 2241.0600000000004, "end": 2241.88, "text": " Extremely fragile.", "tokens": [50729, 24921, 736, 23847, 13, 50770], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 708, "seek": 223378, "start": 2241.94, "end": 2243.1800000000003, "text": " It's constantly decaying.", "tokens": [50773, 467, 311, 6460, 21039, 278, 13, 50835], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 709, "seek": 223378, "start": 2243.4, "end": 2247.6800000000003, "text": " It must be fought for, purchased with energy, and projected every single second.", "tokens": [50846, 467, 1633, 312, 11391, 337, 11, 14734, 365, 2281, 11, 293, 26231, 633, 2167, 1150, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 710, "seek": 223378, "start": 2248.0400000000004, "end": 2253.5600000000004, "text": " And what's truly fascinating is that this framework of viability theory goes far beyond", "tokens": [51078, 400, 437, 311, 4908, 10343, 307, 300, 341, 8388, 295, 1932, 2310, 5261, 1709, 1400, 4399, 51354], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 711, "seek": 223378, "start": 2253.5600000000004, "end": 2254.38, "text": " fusion energy.", "tokens": [51354, 23100, 2281, 13, 51395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 712, "seek": 223378, "start": 2255.0, "end": 2260.1400000000003, "text": " The exact same mathematical principles, the exact same logic of attractor basins and constraint", "tokens": [51426, 440, 1900, 912, 18894, 9156, 11, 264, 1900, 912, 9952, 295, 5049, 284, 987, 1292, 293, 25534, 51683], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 713, "seek": 223378, "start": 2260.1400000000003, "end": 2262.78, "text": " projection applies to deep space probes.", "tokens": [51683, 22743, 13165, 281, 2452, 1901, 1239, 279, 13, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13256860815960428, "compression_ratio": 1.6460481099656357, "no_speech_prob": 1.573679012621676e-12}, {"id": 714, "seek": 226278, "start": 2262.78, "end": 2264.0, "text": " Like the Voyager probe.", "tokens": [50365, 1743, 264, 25563, 3557, 22715, 13, 50426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 715, "seek": 226278, "start": 2264.4, "end": 2267.2400000000002, "text": " It has zero physical repair capacity.", "tokens": [50446, 467, 575, 4018, 4001, 10535, 6042, 13, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 716, "seek": 226278, "start": 2267.6600000000003, "end": 2269.36, "text": " It can't swap out a degraded wall.", "tokens": [50609, 467, 393, 380, 18135, 484, 257, 24740, 292, 2929, 13, 50694], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 717, "seek": 226278, "start": 2269.5600000000004, "end": 2269.9, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50704, 1779, 13, 50721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 718, "seek": 226278, "start": 2269.9, "end": 2276.0600000000004, "text": " It relies entirely on incredibly deep attractor basins built by its original engineers and", "tokens": [50721, 467, 30910, 7696, 322, 6252, 2452, 5049, 284, 987, 1292, 3094, 538, 1080, 3380, 11955, 293, 51029], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 719, "seek": 226278, "start": 2276.0600000000004, "end": 2281.2200000000003, "text": " predictive digital twins run by operators back on Earth to survive decades in the void.", "tokens": [51029, 35521, 4562, 22555, 1190, 538, 19077, 646, 322, 4755, 281, 7867, 7878, 294, 264, 22009, 13, 51287], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 720, "seek": 226278, "start": 2281.7400000000002, "end": 2281.92, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51313, 3153, 13, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 721, "seek": 226278, "start": 2282.1600000000003, "end": 2283.6800000000003, "text": " And this applies to other things too, right?", "tokens": [51334, 400, 341, 13165, 281, 661, 721, 886, 11, 558, 30, 51410], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 722, "seek": 226278, "start": 2283.7400000000002, "end": 2284.1800000000003, "text": " Oh yeah.", "tokens": [51413, 876, 1338, 13, 51435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 723, "seek": 226278, "start": 2284.34, "end": 2285.96, "text": " It applies to manufacturing hubs.", "tokens": [51443, 467, 13165, 281, 11096, 46870, 13, 51524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 724, "seek": 226278, "start": 2286.1600000000003, "end": 2289.0, "text": " It applies to civic institutions in a bustling city.", "tokens": [51534, 467, 13165, 281, 29089, 8142, 294, 257, 19432, 1688, 2307, 13, 51676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 725, "seek": 226278, "start": 2289.1600000000003, "end": 2291.3, "text": " It applies to biological ecosystems.", "tokens": [51684, 467, 13165, 281, 13910, 32647, 13, 51791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1837998067051911, "compression_ratio": 1.648936170212766, "no_speech_prob": 1.913146507534491e-12}, {"id": 726, "seek": 229130, "start": 2291.3, "end": 2293.46, "text": " Cities are just thermodynamic organizations.", "tokens": [50365, 36672, 366, 445, 8810, 34988, 6150, 13, 50473], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 727, "seek": 229130, "start": 2293.6800000000003, "end": 2294.2400000000002, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50484, 7587, 13, 50512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 728, "seek": 229130, "start": 2294.52, "end": 2296.3, "text": " A city brings in energy and materials.", "tokens": [50526, 316, 2307, 5607, 294, 2281, 293, 5319, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 729, "seek": 229130, "start": 2296.5600000000004, "end": 2298.0800000000004, "text": " It repairs its physical infrastructure.", "tokens": [50628, 467, 28823, 1080, 4001, 6896, 13, 50704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 730, "seek": 229130, "start": 2298.42, "end": 2301.7000000000003, "text": " It maintains its institutional knowledge through schools and culture.", "tokens": [50721, 467, 33385, 1080, 18391, 3601, 807, 4656, 293, 3713, 13, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 731, "seek": 229130, "start": 2301.92, "end": 2305.82, "text": " And it expends massive amounts of energy to push back against urban decay.", "tokens": [50896, 400, 309, 1278, 2581, 5994, 11663, 295, 2281, 281, 2944, 646, 1970, 9681, 21039, 13, 51091], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 732, "seek": 229130, "start": 2306.0800000000004, "end": 2308.26, "text": " The physics of viability is universal.", "tokens": [51104, 440, 10649, 295, 1932, 2310, 307, 11455, 13, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22056987550523546, "compression_ratio": 1.4976303317535544, "no_speech_prob": 2.2017459470197176e-12}, {"id": 733, "seek": 230826, "start": 2308.26, "end": 2314.5, "text": " We have to stop looking at advanced technology and human progress in general as a sprint to", "tokens": [50365, 492, 362, 281, 1590, 1237, 412, 7339, 2899, 293, 1952, 4205, 294, 2674, 382, 257, 25075, 281, 50677], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13294674799992487, "compression_ratio": 1.389261744966443, "no_speech_prob": 2.0640130229954146e-12}, {"id": 734, "seek": 230826, "start": 2314.5, "end": 2315.48, "text": " a magic threshold.", "tokens": [50677, 257, 5585, 14678, 13, 50726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13294674799992487, "compression_ratio": 1.389261744966443, "no_speech_prob": 2.0640130229954146e-12}, {"id": 735, "seek": 230826, "start": 2316.0, "end": 2318.6200000000003, "text": " The Lawson criterion is just the starting line.", "tokens": [50752, 440, 7744, 3015, 46691, 307, 445, 264, 2891, 1622, 13, 50883], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13294674799992487, "compression_ratio": 1.389261744966443, "no_speech_prob": 2.0640130229954146e-12}, {"id": 736, "seek": 230826, "start": 2319.0, "end": 2321.5400000000004, "text": " It's the moment the baby takes its first breath.", "tokens": [50902, 467, 311, 264, 1623, 264, 3186, 2516, 1080, 700, 6045, 13, 51029], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13294674799992487, "compression_ratio": 1.389261744966443, "no_speech_prob": 2.0640130229954146e-12}, {"id": 737, "seek": 232154, "start": 2321.54, "end": 2329.96, "text": " We have to start looking at engineering as the careful, costly, recursive maintenance of order against the chaos of the universe.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 362, 281, 722, 1237, 412, 7043, 382, 264, 5026, 11, 28328, 11, 20560, 488, 11258, 295, 1668, 1970, 264, 14158, 295, 264, 6445, 13, 50786], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1614239766047551, "compression_ratio": 1.532967032967033, "no_speech_prob": 1.9201133738544485e-12}, {"id": 738, "seek": 232154, "start": 2330.46, "end": 2331.7599999999998, "text": " Persistence over performance.", "tokens": [50811, 14006, 468, 655, 670, 3389, 13, 50876], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1614239766047551, "compression_ratio": 1.532967032967033, "no_speech_prob": 1.9201133738544485e-12}, {"id": 739, "seek": 232154, "start": 2332.52, "end": 2335.98, "text": " Designing the deep basin rather than balancing on the edge of the plate.", "tokens": [50914, 3885, 9676, 264, 2452, 34863, 2831, 813, 22495, 322, 264, 4691, 295, 264, 5924, 13, 51087], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1614239766047551, "compression_ratio": 1.532967032967033, "no_speech_prob": 1.9201133738544485e-12}, {"id": 740, "seek": 232154, "start": 2336.32, "end": 2339.2, "text": " The endless marathon, not the glorious sprint.", "tokens": [51104, 440, 16144, 27601, 11, 406, 264, 24026, 25075, 13, 51248], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1614239766047551, "compression_ratio": 1.532967032967033, "no_speech_prob": 1.9201133738544485e-12}, {"id": 741, "seek": 233920, "start": 2339.2, "end": 2341.5, "text": " That is the core message of the theory.", "tokens": [50365, 663, 307, 264, 4965, 3636, 295, 264, 5261, 13, 50480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15376055790827825, "compression_ratio": 1.4673913043478262, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489135581775448e-12}, {"id": 742, "seek": 233920, "start": 2341.7799999999997, "end": 2345.9399999999996, "text": " I want to leave you, the listener, with a direct challenge based on this theory.", "tokens": [50494, 286, 528, 281, 1856, 291, 11, 264, 31569, 11, 365, 257, 2047, 3430, 2361, 322, 341, 5261, 13, 50702], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15376055790827825, "compression_ratio": 1.4673913043478262, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489135581775448e-12}, {"id": 743, "seek": 233920, "start": 2346.7, "end": 2351.7999999999997, "text": " Consider your own life, your career, or the company you work for as a thermodynamic organization.", "tokens": [50740, 17416, 428, 1065, 993, 11, 428, 3988, 11, 420, 264, 2237, 291, 589, 337, 382, 257, 8810, 34988, 4475, 13, 50995], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15376055790827825, "compression_ratio": 1.4673913043478262, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489135581775448e-12}, {"id": 744, "seek": 233920, "start": 2352.64, "end": 2355.2, "text": " Are you constantly optimizing for peak performance?", "tokens": [51037, 2014, 291, 6460, 40425, 337, 10651, 3389, 30, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15376055790827825, "compression_ratio": 1.4673913043478262, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489135581775448e-12}, {"id": 745, "seek": 235520, "start": 2355.2, "end": 2357.72, "text": " Trying to hit your own personal Lawson criterion.", "tokens": [50365, 20180, 281, 2045, 428, 1065, 2973, 7744, 3015, 46691, 13, 50491], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 746, "seek": 235520, "start": 2357.7999999999997, "end": 2358.2799999999997, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50495, 7587, 13, 50519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 747, "seek": 235520, "start": 2358.7999999999997, "end": 2364.08, "text": " Are you running at 100% capacity, chasing the headline, and leaving yourself perfectly balanced on the dinner plate,", "tokens": [50545, 2014, 291, 2614, 412, 2319, 4, 6042, 11, 17876, 264, 28380, 11, 293, 5012, 1803, 6239, 13902, 322, 264, 6148, 5924, 11, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 748, "seek": 235520, "start": 2364.3599999999997, "end": 2366.9199999999996, "text": " completely vulnerable to the slightest breeze of disruption?", "tokens": [50823, 2584, 10955, 281, 264, 41040, 24532, 295, 28751, 30, 50951], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 749, "seek": 235520, "start": 2367.4199999999996, "end": 2369.4199999999996, "text": " Or are you investing in basin depth?", "tokens": [50976, 1610, 366, 291, 10978, 294, 34863, 7161, 30, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 750, "seek": 235520, "start": 2369.48, "end": 2370.62, "text": " Are you building those reserves?", "tokens": [51079, 2014, 291, 2390, 729, 27483, 30, 51136], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 751, "seek": 235520, "start": 2371.08, "end": 2375.2999999999997, "text": " Are you deliberately leaving some power on the table to build the invisible reserves,", "tokens": [51159, 2014, 291, 23506, 5012, 512, 1347, 322, 264, 3199, 281, 1322, 264, 14603, 27483, 11, 51370], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 752, "seek": 235520, "start": 2375.62, "end": 2379.16, "text": " the redundancies, the financial margins, and the tacit knowledge required", "tokens": [51386, 264, 27830, 32286, 11, 264, 4669, 30317, 11, 293, 264, 25018, 270, 3601, 4739, 51563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.153254436845539, "compression_ratio": 1.685897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.4611188777977069e-12}, {"id": 753, "seek": 235520, "start": 2379.16, "end": 2382.9199999999996, "text": " to simply survive the long, slow, inevitable decay of time?", "tokens": [51563, 281, 2935, 7867, 264, 938, 11, 2964, 11, 21451, 21039, 295, 